cture#主链路","content":"TdClient::spawn_receive_loop → Routed"},"178":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-54","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"按 @extra / request_id 认出这条回来的东西属于谁"},"179":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-55","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"Update → 分发"},"180":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"process_value：PreUpdate → 解析 @type → PreRoute"},"181":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"→ InPlugin → 双通道 → PostResponse"},"182":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"Response → 回投"},"183":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"deliver_response"},"184":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"emit_scoped(owner, \"response\", …)"},"185":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"`process`（吃 `&str`）只是 `process_value` 的前半段（解析 JSON 再交给它）；接收循环那条路\n本来就有 `Value`，所以走 `process_value`。"},"186":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                                            | 数值            | 谁跑它                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreUpdate` / `PreRoute` / `InPlugin` / `PostResponse` | 0 / 1 / 2 / 3 | `UpdatePipeline::process_value` |","table":"table-1"},"187":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"| 阶段                                    | 数值    | 谁跑它                                          |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Stage::PreToolCall` / `PostToolCall` | 4 / 5 | **目前没有生产调用方**（只有 `fuyubot-middleware` 自己的测试） |","table":"table-1"},"188":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"六阶段的数值在 `fuyubot-abi::Stage`，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应，由 `runtime.rs` 的\n`stage_numbers_match_the_middleware_crate` 测试钉住。"},"189":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"三条容易搞错的语义："},"190":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**归属是「额外定向」，不是「排除广播」**：`emit` 发给所有订阅者，`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 是\n「全局 + 该归属」。响应因此对所有插件透明。"},"191":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本\n（按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的 payload）。"},"192":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#主链路","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只用来选通道**，不参与负载匹配；等响应写\n`{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":N}`。"},"193":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`HostRuntime::plugin_scope()` 给这次加载分配一个 owner id，之后所有跨 ABI 的注册\n（订阅 / 工具 / 服务 / 中间件）都记在这个 owner 名下（`RegistrationKind` + `Registration`）。\n`scope.commit()` 保留；提前 drop（init 失败、start 报错、ABI 不匹配）或 `LoadedPlugin` 被 drop 时，\n`rollback_owner(owner)` 一次性撤掉这批注册；宿主自己（owner 0）不受影响。"},"194":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"`LoadedPlugin` 的字段声明顺序就是卸载顺序：先 `plugin_stop`，再 `rollback_owner`，\n最后 `_lib: Library` 才 drop——到这一步动态库才真正卸载。"},"195":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"中间插件要批量托管脚本时，用**内置 scope 服务**（`get_service(\"fuyubot.host.scope\")`）开子作用域：\n`create` 出的子作用域从当前作用域栈继承 owner（脱离加载线程的场景——比如 watch 线程——要先建\nroot scope 再 `enter`，否则 owner 退化成宿主 0，卸载时回滚不到），注册落在子作用域里，\n`rollback_scope` 可以只撤这一批；插件卸载时连 owner 一起收。"},"196":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#注册作用域与卸载","content":"**唯一的例外是 Go 的 c-shared 库**：它的运行时有线程与信号处理器，卸载后进程会 access violation\n（`0xC0000005`，而且崩在退出那一刻）。`PluginLoader` 用文件里的 Go buildinfo 魔数认出 Go 产物，\n对这类库 `plugin_stop` 与注册回滚照跑，但**故意不卸载那个 `Library`**，让它映射到进程退出。\n代价是「同一进程内反复加载同一个 Go 插件」不可靠（热重载路径），收益是 Go 插件能正常用。"},"197":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每个插件有两个依赖列表：`inject`（硬）与 `soft_inject`（软）。它们**只影响准入与顺序**，\n不影响加载——插件已经 `dlopen` 进来了，只是还没轮到它跑。"},"198":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖解析：硬依赖管准入，软依赖管排序"},"199":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮先退掉依赖已消失的，再激活一个：硬依赖不齐就停在 Pending，齐了就按「软依赖也齐的先」排序后激活；激活失败会级联到依赖它的插件。"},"200":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"插件清单"},"201":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"注册顺序 = 文件名字典序，所以同层 tie-break 是确定的"},"202":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"每轮 reconcile：先退后进"},"203":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖不再满足的先 Deactivate，然后只推进一个 fiber"},"204":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"硬依赖（inject）全可用？"},"205":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不齐"},"206":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"齐了"},"207":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending：等着"},"208":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"不是失败——提供者可能只是还没起来"},"209":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"按软依赖排序"},"210":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"软依赖也齐的先，其余排后面"},"211":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"激活这一个 fiber"},"212":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"跑 apply，注册落进它自己的作用域"},"213":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"214":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"215":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"级联到依赖它的"},"216":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四条规则："},"217":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**硬依赖不齐 → 不激活**，停在 `Pending`。这是「等」，不是「错」——提供者可能只是排在后面还没轮到。"},"218":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**软依赖不齐 → 照样激活**，只是排在有软依赖的后面（两轮扫描：先扫软的也齐了的，再扫其余）。"},"219":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**每轮只推进一个 fiber**，先退后进。一轮的推进量有保险丝（`2n + 16`），万一依赖图构了环也不会卡死。"},"220":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"**激活失败 → 级联**：依赖它的插件一并标 `Failed`，因为那个提供者永远回不来了。"},"221":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"四种状态怎么走"},"222":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending 等到依赖齐了才进 Activating；apply 成功是 Active，报错是 Failed；Active 的依赖消失会退回 Pending。Failed 是终态。"},"223":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Pending"},"224":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Activating"},"225":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Active"},"226":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"Failed"},"227":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-103","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖齐"},"228":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-104","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"成功"},"229":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-105","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"apply 报错"},"230":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-106","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"依赖消失 → Deactivate（退回等着）"},"231":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-107","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#依赖与激活顺序","content":"`Pending` 与 `Failed` 的分界就是「还可能好」和「不会好了」：`is_permanently_missing` 只在\n提供者**已经 Failed** 时返回真。服务表里没有、也没有同名 fiber 的依赖，一律保持 `Pending`——\n它可能是以后才出现的服务（比如另一个插件在外层作用域里 later 才 provide）。"},"232":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-108","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"进程边界：动态库插件同进程，脚本插件一进程一脚本"},"233":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-109","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程里跑 fuyubot 本体、原生 cdylib 插件、以及 python_host / js_host 这两个中间插件；中间插件再用 uv run / bun 起子进程跑脚本。"},"234":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-110","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"宿主进程（同一个地址空间）"},"235":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-111","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"fuyubot 宿主"},"236":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-112","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"原生插件 cdylib"},"237":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-113","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"Rust / C / C++"},"238":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-114","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"中间插件 cdylib"},"239":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-115","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"python_host / js_host"},"240":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-116","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"dlopen · C ABI"},"241":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-117","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"uv run / bun"},"242":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-118","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"子进程（一进程一脚本）"},"243":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-119","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 A"},"244":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-120","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"main.py"},"245":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-121","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本 B"},"246":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-122","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"index.ts"},"247":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-123","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本经薄 SDK 回调 → 中间插件（原生桥）→ 宿主；子进程死了宿主只记一条错，不跟着崩。"},"248":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-124","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|         | 动态库插件             | 脚本插件（目录形态）    |\n| ------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| 进程 / 边界 | 与宿主同进程；C ABI 函数调用 | 一进程一脚本；经原生桥回调 |","table":"table-2"},"249":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-125","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|      | 动态库插件 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                   |\n| ---- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本定位 | 不适用   | manifest（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）声明入口 |","table":"table-2"},"250":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-126","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|     | 动态库插件                 | 脚本插件（目录形态）                                 |\n| --- | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 装载  | `plugin install <产物>` | `plugin install <目录>` → `plugins/scripts/` |","table":"table-2"},"251":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-127","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|           | 动态库插件     | 脚本插件（目录形态）                    |\n| --------- | --------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 启动时序 / 崩溃 | 同步；崩了拖垮宿主 | 装依赖后起进程，等 `ready`；子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-2"},"252":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-128","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"|       | 动态库插件                                  | 脚本插件（目录形态）           |\n| ----- | -------------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| 已知天花板 | panic 靠 `C-unwind` + `catch_unwind` 接住 | 改代码不热载（watch 只认目录增删） |","table":"table-2"},"253":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-129","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#两种插件形态","content":"脚本侧（薄 SDK 与目录形态）见文档站的\n脚本插件。\n两门语言的中间插件是同一套机制的两份实现，所以「Python SDK 与 JS SDK 对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"254":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-130","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                 |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-core` | `lib.rs` 的 `Kernel`（Created → Started → Stopped）；`context.rs` 的 `Context`（`Arc<RwLock<HashMap<TypeId, Arc<dyn Any + Send + Sync>>>>`）；`effect.rs` 的 `Effect`（`Box<dyn FnOnce()>` 回滚守卫，`#[must_use]`，`merge()` 后注册者先撤销）；`plugin.rs` 的 `Plugin` trait + `define_plugin!`；`manager.rs` 的 `PluginManager`（load / load_all / unload / reload + DFS 三色拓扑排序） |","table":"table-3"},"255":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-131","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate           | 里面有什么                                                            |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-event` | `EventBus` / `Filter` / `SubscriptionHandle` / `EventContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"256":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-132","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate             | 里面有什么                                                      |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-service` | `ServiceContainer` / `ServiceHandle` / `ServiceContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"257":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-133","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate          | 里面有什么                                                                          |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tool` | `ToolDescriptor` / `ToolRegistry` / `ToolHandle` / `ffi` 模块 / `ToolContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"258":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-134","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| crate                | 里面有什么                                                                                      |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-middleware` | `Stage` / `Middleware` / `Next` / `Pipeline` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `MiddlewareContextExt` |","table":"table-3"},"259":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-135","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"三条共用约定："},"260":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-136","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**回调错误类型由 core 定**：四个 crate 不能互相依赖，所以 `fuyubot_core::Result<T>` 是全仓唯一允许 boxed error 的地方。"},"261":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-137","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**与 Context 的集成 = `install(ctx)` + 扩展 trait**：返回的 `Effect` 要一直持有，否则服务立刻从 Context 消失。"},"262":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-138","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**所有注册都返回句柄且 `#[must_use]`**：四个 Handle 内部都包着 `core::Effect`，drop 即回滚。"},"263":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-139","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"各自的一条要点："},"264":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-140","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 事件  | `emit` 在锁**外面**调回调，所以回调里再 `on` / `emit` / `off` 不会自锁；某个回调返回 `Err` 会**中断**本次广播并把错误抛出去。`Filter` 用点分路径（`\"message.chat.id\"`）做字段相等匹配 |","table":"table-4"},"265":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-141","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                        |\n| --- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务  | 命名容器（跨语言插件报不出 Rust 的 `TypeId`）。同名重复注册报错；`get::<T>` 类型不匹配返回 `None`，用 `contains` + `type_of` 区分「没注册」和「类型不对」 |","table":"table-4"},"266":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-142","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工具  | `call_tool` = 查表 → 权限门 → input_schema → 处理器 → output_schema。`handler: Option<ToolHandlerFn>`，`None` 表示「只有元数据的声明型工具」；注册/注销用 `on_change` 广播（**不认识事件系统**，要不要转成事件总线由宿主层决定） |","table":"table-4"},"267":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-143","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"| 机制  | 要点                                                                                                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 中间件 | 洋葱模型，`next.run(ctx)` 前是进入段、后是退出段。`run(stage, ctx)` 会**先复制层列表再执行**，所以中间件里再 `use_middleware` 不会自锁；不调 `next.run` 就是不往下走 |","table":"table-4"},"268":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-144","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"内核的几条语义："},"269":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-145","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Context` 只有 `&self`**：`provide` 返回 `Effect`，drop 即注销，所以调用方必须持有它。"},"270":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-146","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`Effect::merge` 是 LIFO**：`a.merge(b)` 的撤销顺序是 `b → a`。"},"271":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-147","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**加载顺序由依赖决定，卸载是加载顺序的倒序**；`load_all` 报错会把本次已加载的卸掉，不留半加载。"},"272":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-148","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**有依赖者时 `unload` 拒绝**（`HasDependents`），不级联。"},"273":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-149","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#四大机制与内核","content":"**`reload` 之所以能工作**，是因为管理器存的是 `Arc<dyn Plugin>` 而不是 `Box`。"},"274":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-150","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"两个 crate 一人一半：`-sys` 只出类型、不做加载，`tdlib` 才是运行时。"},"275":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-151","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate                  | `build.rs` 做什么                                 | `src/` 里有什么                                                                                                                                                                          |\n| ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`绑定层 | 拿 `td_api.tl` + 生成编译期两份产物（无条件执行，没有 feature 早退） | `build_support.rs`（与另一个 crate 共用的缓存/下载设施）、`ffi.rs`（函数指针 + 符号名 + 指针形状 `const assert`）、`tl_schema.rs`（解析与 JSON 互转）、`tl_codegen.rs` + `docs.rs`、`schema.rs`、`td_api.rs`（`include!` 生成物） |","table":"table-5"},"276":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-152","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"| crate              | `build.rs` 做什么                        | `src/` 里有什么                                                       |\n| ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-tdlib`运行时 | 只管 vendored 动态库 + 把库 staging 到可执行文件旁边 | `loader.rs` / `loader/vendored.rs` / `client.rs` / `authorize.rs` |","table":"table-5"},"277":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-153","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"三条边界约定："},"278":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-154","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**重导出的路径不变**：`fuyubot_tdlib::` 根上重导出 `-sys` 的 `ffi` / `schema` / `td_api` /\n`tl_schema` 与 `TdApiSchema` / `EntryKind` / `TlEntry` / `TlParam` / `SchemaError` / `TdApi` /\n`DEFAULT_LOG_VERBOSITY`，所以既有调用方一行都不用改。"},"279":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-155","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份源码被两边共用**：`build_support.rs` 与 `loader/vendored.rs` 各自的 `build.rs` 都用 `#[path]`\n引同一份，因此它们只能依赖 std 与可选依赖。"},"280":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-156","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**两份 metadata 必须一致**：`[package.metadata.fuyubot]` 在两个 crate 里各有一份，值要对得上\n（守卫测试 `metadata_is_in_sync_between_the_two_crates`）。"},"281":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-157","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`loader::resolve` 按这个顺序找动态库："},"282":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-158","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`（文件或目录）"},"283":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-159","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**vendored 目录**"},"284":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-160","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"**可执行文件所在目录**（ExeDir）"},"285":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-161","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"Linux 带版本号的系统库"},"286":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-162","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"裸库名（真去 `dlopen` 试一次）"},"287":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-163","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"全失败返回 `TdlibLoadError::NotFound`，消息里逐条列出 `[1]`…`[4]` 的尝试与原因。"},"288":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-164","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"真正加载**必须**走 `loader::open_library`（Windows 绝对路径会走 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`），\n**不要直接用 `Library::new`**——以后任何新增的加载动态库的地方都走它。"},"289":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-165","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#绑定层与运行时fuyubot-tdlib-sys--fuyubot-tdlib","content":"`@extra` 是**字符串**（`RequestId::to_extra()`）；`route()` 遇到非数字的 `@extra` 会退化成更新，不 panic。"},"290":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-166","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"编译期：一份 schema 生成两份产物"},"291":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-167","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl 经 tl_schema::parse 解析一次，左路生成 Rust 类型源码、include! 进 td_api；右路写成 JSON、include_str! 进 TdApiSchema::compiled。两条路来自同一个解析结果，所以形状不会漂移。"},"292":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-168","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"td_api.tl"},"293":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-169","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"包内 vendor 优先 → 缓存 → 下载"},"294":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-170","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_schema::parse"},"295":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-171","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"tl_codegen::generate"},"296":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-172","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api.json"},"297":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-173","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"$OUT_DIR/td_api_generated.rs"},"298":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-174","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"include_str!"},"299":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-175","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"fuyubot_tdlib_sys::td_api"},"300":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-176","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"serde 带 tag 的 enum / struct"},"301":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-177","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"TdApiSchema::compiled"},"302":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-178","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"运行时查「有没有这个方法 / 字段」"},"303":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-179","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#td_apitl-转成了什么只在编译期","content":"两份产物来自同一个解析结果，而且 `tl_schema.rs` 被 build.rs 用 `#[path]` 引同一份实现，所以「编译期\n写出来的形状」与「运行时读回去的形状」不可能漂移。生成规则：类 → 带 `#[serde(tag = \"@type\")]` 的 enum；\n函数 → 带 `METHOD` / `RESULT` 常量的 struct（派生 `Default`，没填的字段不写进请求）；类字段一律\n`Option<Box<T>>`（断互递归 + 对上「缺字段就是没有」）；认不出的类型降级成 `serde_json::Value`；Rust\n关键字转义（`r#type`）；**文档四级齐全**（类 / 变体 / 函数 / 字段）。归类只认\n`---functions---` / `---types---` 分区标记，认不出来时**构建直接失败**。\n`check_request` 那套元数据仍然保留——它做的是生成类型做不到的本地校验（生成类型只能保证**结构**对，\n挡不住「用错方法名」）。"},"304":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-180","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                      | 位置            | 作用                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable` / `PluginHandle` / `HostApi` | `fuyubot-abi` | 函数表（21 字段） / `plugin_init` 的返回值（`abi_version == 0` = 失败） / 插件侧门面 |","table":"table-6"},"305":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-181","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                                                            | 位置               | 作用                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `HostRuntime` / `UpdatePipeline` / `PluginLoader` / `LoadedPlugin` | `fuyubot-loader` | 20 个桥的落点、请求留档、响应回投、`rollback_owner`、全局配置读写；六阶段（实跑 4 个）+ 双通道路由；dlopen 与 drop 即卸载 |","table":"table-6"},"306":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-182","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                               | 位置              | 作用                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TdClient` / `Routed` / `ReceiveLoop` | `fuyubot-tdlib` | TDLib 客户端；`route()` 分出 `Update` / `Response`；停止把手（`stop()` / `join()`，drop **不会**停） |","table":"table-6"},"307":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-183","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                    | 位置                 | 作用                                                                                                    |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify` / `RichMessage` | `fuyubot-simplify` | 发消息 / 相册 / 编辑 / 删除 / Markdown 转 entities / 等响应 / **富消息**（`rich` 模块，本地 Markdown → 块树）；参数是**每个方法一个结构体** |","table":"table-6"},"308":{"id":"/docs/dev/architecture-184","page_id":"/docs/dev/architecture","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/architecture#关键类型对照","content":"| 类型 / 函数                   | 位置                  | 作用                                     |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `TdApiSchema::compiled()` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys` | 编译期烘焙的元数据；`check_request` 做本地方法名/参数名校验 |","table":"table-6"},"309":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"page","content":"构建与测试","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test"},"310":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test","content":"三条硬门槛、两类测试，以及本机的离线约定"},"311":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"三条硬门槛"},"312":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"构建输入与缓存"},"313":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"两类测试"},"314":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"测试写法的三条规矩"},"315":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"本机的离线约定"},"316":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"⚠️ 三条都带 `--workspace`：根 `Cargo.toml` 有 `default-members = [\"crates/*\"]`，\n**裸** `cargo build` / `cargo test` 只编 `crates/`，不编 `examples/`。\n`#[allow]` 不算消 warning——能改就改。"},"317":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#三条硬门槛","content":"`cargo tree --workspace --offline` 必须无环；依赖方向随时能用\n`cargo tree -p <crate> -e normal --depth 1` 验。"},"318":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**，`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它："},"319":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"包内那份随 crate 发布（1.8.69 已带），所以**从 crates.io 装下来的下游和 docs.rs 都不用联网**。\n它按 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] tdlib-version` 拼路径，换了版本却没补 `vendor/` 时会自动退到缓存/下载。"},"320":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"缓存根按顺序找（`build_support::cache_roots()`，两个 build.rs 共用同一串）："},"321":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把第三档指好（`relative = true`，相对仓库根），克隆下来直接能用。"},"322":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"**手写必须绝对路径**：两个 build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根，相对路径会解析到 crate 下面然后 404。"},"323":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`$OUT_DIR` 每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空 → 退到它意味着下次**重新下载**，缓存根全写不进去时会明确警告。"},"324":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"转换在编译期完成：日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于那份文件，**别当常量写进断言**。"},"325":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#构建输入与缓存","content":"`.cargo/config.toml` 另有两个别名：`cargo bot`（= `fuyubot run`）、`cargo package-bot`\n（release 构建 `fuyubot` + 三个内置插件，产物在 `target/release/`，tdjson 由 build.rs 放到 exe 同级）。\n**没有 `package-sdk`**：`fuyubot-sdk` 在 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库，那边用 `cargo build -p fuyubot-sdk-cli`。"},"326":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"**默认自检不碰任何外部文件**：真 tdjson、真 `td_api.tl`（用 `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` 顶替时）、真 Releases 下载\n全部藏在 `#[ignore]` 后面。所以「全绿」只证明代码自洽——**与真实 TDLib 对不对得上只有那些\n`--ignored` 能回答**："},"327":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#两类测试","content":"改 `ffi.rs` 的符号名/arity、`loader::open_library`（或任何加载动态库的地方）、\n`tl_schema` / `tl_codegen`，或碰登录/授权代码之后，**必须**跑一次。\n`--features vendored` 那条（会尝试访问 Releases，失败只警告）在动 build 脚本 / 资产表时也要跑。"},"328":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**临时目录不许用 `%TEMP%`**：一律 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`。MSYS 会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`，\n受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了——换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"329":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"**嵌套调用 cargo / 编译器时**，把子进程的 `TEMP`/`TMP` 也指到那里：MSVC 的 `link.exe`\n建不了 `%TEMP%` 里的 `lnk*.tmp`，直接 `LNK1104`，插件/夹具根本编不出来。"},"330":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#测试写法的三条规矩","content":"非平凡逻辑留**一个**可运行自检：`#[cfg(test)]` 里一个 `assert` 测试即可，不引测试框架。"},"331":{"id":"/docs/dev/build-test-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/build-test","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/build-test#本机的离线约定","content":"DSH 沙箱里 cargo 的 TLS 连不上 crates.io（`schannel … SEC_E_NO_CREDENTIALS`）。\n`Cargo.lock` 已落盘，`--offline` 就够；**只有改依赖版本时**才需要联网，那时向用户申请一次完整权限跑\n`cargo fetch`。"},"332":{"id":"/docs/dev","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"page","content":"开发文档","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev"},"333":{"id":"/docs/dev-0","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"改框架本身：结构、构建测试、踩过的坑、发布"},"334":{"id":"/docs/dev-1","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"本节的页面"},"335":{"id":"/docs/dev-2","page_id":"/docs/dev","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"一分钟上手"},"336":{"id":"/docs/dev-3","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"这一节是给**改 fuyubot 仓库**的人看的，不是给用它写 bot 的人看的。"},"337":{"id":"/docs/dev-4","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"**公开文档都在这个文档站**：结构、ABI、插件写法、使用方式。"},"338":{"id":"/docs/dev-5","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么    | 在哪     |\n| ------ | ------ |\n| 结构与数据流 | 架构与数据流 |","table":"table-0"},"339":{"id":"/docs/dev-6","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么      | 在哪   |\n| -------- | ---- |\n| 构建、测试、发布 | 下面三页 |","table":"table-0"},"340":{"id":"/docs/dev-7","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"| 看什么                       | 在哪                                    |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 当前状态 / 构建契约 / 已知缺口 / 踩过的坑 | 仓库里随源码分发的工程台账（`docs/`，不入库，只给改代码的人接力用） |","table":"table-0"},"341":{"id":"/docs/dev-8","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev","content":"仓库有一条硬规矩：**文档里出现的命令必须真跑过**，带输出的示例要抄真实输出。\n改行为就同步改文档：文档站给使用者与插件作者，仓库里的工程台账给下一个改代码的人。\n否则下一个人会比你更相信旧文档。"},"342":{"id":"/docs/dev-9","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"架构与数据流\" href=\"/docs/dev/architecture/\" />"},"343":{"id":"/docs/dev-10","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"构建与测试\" href=\"/docs/dev/build-test/\" />"},"344":{"id":"/docs/dev-11","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"常见陷阱\" href=\"/docs/dev/pitfalls/\" />"},"345":{"id":"/docs/dev-12","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#本节的页面","content":"<Card title=\"发布\" href=\"/docs/dev/release/\" />"},"346":{"id":"/docs/dev-13","page_id":"/docs/dev","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev#一分钟上手","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`TDLIB_TD_API_TL` → 缓存 → 从 Releases 下载，拿不到就让构建失败。\n仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把缓存指到 `.tdlib-cache/`（相对仓库根），所以上面三条直接敲就行。"},"347":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"page","content":"常见陷阱","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls"},"348":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"编号即引用锚：这些坑真踩过，别再踩回去"},"349":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"ABI 与回调"},"350":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"事件语义"},"351":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"TDLib"},"352":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"Rust / Windows"},"353":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","content":"每条都**真踩过**。这里挑最容易复发的几类；仓库内部的台账编号是跨文件引用锚，只随源码分发，不在这里展开。"},"354":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`extern \"C\"` 边界逃出去的 panic 直接 abort**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`：插件与中间件回调必须是\n`unsafe extern \"C-unwind\"`，`define_plugin!` 自己也要包一层。"},"355":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**一个 crate 只能展开一次 `define_plugin!`**：七个导出符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次必然重复定义。"},"356":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**订阅句柄必须活着**：每轮循环里 `let _h = …` 就是每轮退订；`for` 里注册要把句柄收进循环外的 `Vec`。"},"357":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#abi-与回调","content":"**`Effect` / `Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`**：`let _ =` 会立刻回滚；`drop` 就是注销。"},"358":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**归属（scope）不是「排除广播」**：第一版写成「全局 `emit` 只发 scope 0」，插件永远收不到更新。\n正确语义是「`emit` 发给所有人；`emit_scoped(scope)` 额外定向给该归属」。"},"359":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#事件语义","content":"**过滤器里的 `event_type` 键只选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"360":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**方法名/字段路径按 TDLib 来，不按 Bot API**：只有 `sendMessage` + `input_message_content`；\n`updateFile` 的 file id 在 `file.id` 不是顶层 `file_id`；`user` 没有 `is_bot` / `username`。"},"361":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**`td_api.tl` 的「函数 vs 构造器」只认 `---functions---` / `---types---` 标记**：\n`updateNewMessage … = Update` 是构造器，任何按首字母大写的启发式都会误判。"},"362":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#tdlib","content":"**写死 TDLib 方法名/参数名的模块必须留一条 `check_request` 测试**（离线就能红）。"},"363":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`Context` 的固有方法会遮蔽扩展 trait 的同名方法**：命名服务只能叫 `provide_named` / `resolve`。"},"364":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**thiserror 把名为 `source` 的字段当错误链**：存额外文本的字段叫 `detail`。"},"365":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**Windows 文件锁是强制锁**：锁住的字节范围别人 `read` 会 `ERROR_LOCK_VIOLATION`，\n所以实例状态把「锁」与「内容」分成两个文件（`.fuyubot/lock` 与 `.fuyubot/status`）。"},"366":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**PowerShell 的 `Get-Content` 在本机按 cp936 解码 UTF-8**：中文注释会毁，还会吞换行导致行号错位。\n改源码一律用编辑器工具，shell 只用来跑命令。"},"367":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"**`tar` 在 Windows runner 上要 POSIX 路径**（`/d/a/…`）：GNU tar 会把 `D:/…` 当成「连主机 D」。"},"368":{"id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/pitfalls","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/pitfalls#rust--windows","content":"> 新踩的坑要补进仓库的 `docs/pitfalls.md` 台账（随源码分发）并给新编号——编号是跨文件引用锚。"},"369":{"id":"/docs/dev/release","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"page","content":"发布","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release"},"370":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"两套发布资产（TDLib 库 / fuyubot 本体）与文档站的静态部署"},"371":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"TDLib 资产（构建期契约）"},"372":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"fuyubot 本体（用户下载即用）"},"373":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"文档站"},"374":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"仓库有两套**互不替代**的发布资产，tag 前缀不同，别混："},"375":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                            | tag           | 生产方                                        | 谁消费                             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| TDLib 动态库 `TDLib-<os>-<arch>` | `TDLib-v<版本>` | `build-tdlib.yml` + `.github/scripts/*.sh` | 构建期（`fuyubot-tdlib` 的 loader 表） |","table":"table-0"},"376":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release","content":"| 资产                                      | tag     | 生产方               | 谁消费         |\n| --------------------------------------- | ------- | ----------------- | ----------- |\n| fuyubot 本体 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip` | `v<版本>` | `release-bot.yml` | 终端用户下载、解压即跑 |","table":"table-0"},"377":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"消费方是 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表，生产方是\n`.github/workflows/build-tdlib.yml` 的 matrix；`tests/release_assets.rs` 会**读 workflow 双向比对**，\n漂了就红。四条硬要求："},"378":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"tag 必须精确是 **`TDLib-v<版本>`**（下载 URL 由 `release_url()` 拼）；"},"379":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"资产名**精确等于** `ASSETS` 表的值，**不带扩展名**，`<os>-<arch>` 用 cargo 口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`）；"},"380":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"内容必须是 **`.tar.gz`**（`.zip` 会被 `extract_library` 当裸库原样写出，得到坏文件还不报错）；"},"381":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#tdlib-资产构建期契约","content":"**加平台只动 `ASSETS` 表 + CI matrix，两边同时加**（`macos/x86_64` 故意不在表里：没有那个 runner）。"},"382":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"运行时仓库的 `release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag（或手动 dispatch）上按平台编 `fuyubot-cli` 与三个内置插件，\n**构建阶段就把最终布局组好**（`plugins/` 直接填内置插件，不单独打包），每平台出一份中间\n`.tar.gz`（已是最终布局）；`publish`（Linux runner）把它转成用户下载的 zip 再挂 Release："},"383":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**资产名**：`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，例 `fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`。\n`<版本>` 取自 tag（分支上手动构建退回 `dev-<sha7>`）；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64。名字里带版本，同一页 Release 里多个构建可以并存、一眼可辨。"},"384":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"**zip 解压出来就是本体**——不再套一层目录："},"385":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"`fuyubot-sdk-<os>-<arch>.zip` 由 **SDK 仓库**（`FuyuBot-SDK` 的 `release-sdk.yml`）发布，\n不混进运行时的包。"},"386":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"平台集合与 `ASSETS` 表一致：Windows / Linux 各 x86_64 + aarch64，**macOS 只有 aarch64**。"},"387":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"中间产物（每平台一份 `fuyubot-*.tar.gz`）只留在 Actions artifacts 里，**不挂 Release**——\n它是构建产物，不是发布形态。"},"388":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"三条契约：**资产名 `fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**、**zip 解压即本体**（无套层目录）、\n**`tdjson` 与可执行文件同级**（靠 loader 优先级 2「可执行文件所在目录」命中）。\nzip 只在 `publish`（Linux runner）里生成，Windows runner 的 bash 没有 `zip` 命令。"},"389":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#fuyubot-本体用户下载即用","content":"GitHub Actions 在本机验不了。改 workflow 的组包步骤时，把 `Package the runtime` 与\n`Turn each bundle into a flat zip` 两段 bash **原样抠出来在本机跑一次**，\n解压产物验证 `--version` / `init` / `run --replay` / `--no-login --background` 全通——\n这一步是踩过「改了却没验」之后定的规矩。"},"390":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"本站是静态导出（`output: 'export'`），产物 `out/`："},"391":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"**push `main` 自动构建并发布到 `gh-pages`**（`pages.yml`；Pages 的 source 是 `gh-pages` 分支）。\nGitHub Pages 是项目页（挂在 `/FuyuBot-docs/` 下）：构建前设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_PATH=/FuyuBot-docs`，\n正式域名在**构建前**设 `NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL`（绝对 URL 是烘进产物的）；\n`public/.nojekyll` 不能少（`_next/` 以 `_` 开头会被 Jekyll 吞掉）。"},"392":{"id":"/docs/dev/release-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/release","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/release#文档站","content":"发布前过一遍提交检查清单：文档站与运行时仓库里的工程台账都更新、`cargo build/test/fmt` 三条绿、\n没把凭据写进任何文件。"},"393":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"page","content":"simplify 封装是怎么实现的","breadcrumbs":["Docs","开发文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals"},"394":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-0","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"按功能范围拆开 fuyubot-simplify 的实现：等待语义、同步 td_execute、错误映射、异步线程与测试守卫"},"395":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-1","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"三条不可协商的原则"},"396":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-2","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"1. 请求出口：一切经 ABI"},"397":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-3","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"2. 文本链路：为什么不异步"},"398":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-4","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"3. 发送：两步合成一次等待"},"399":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-5","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"4. 编辑 / 删除 / 应答：只有一步"},"400":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-6","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"5. 富消息：为什么单列一条路"},"401":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-7","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"6. 等待层：三个底层出口"},"402":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-8","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"7. 命令订阅：为什么状态要放堆上"},"403":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-9","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"8. 异步版：一次调用一个线程"},"404":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-10","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"9. 错误映射"},"405":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-11","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"10. 真 schema 守卫（离线测试）"},"406":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-12","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#11-后加的四个子系统各自为什么这么实现","content":"11. 后加的四个子系统：各自为什么这么实现"},"407":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-13","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"管理权：为什么返回 `bool`"},"408":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-14","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"转发：为什么不等发送结局"},"409":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-15","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"表情反应：bot 与用户号是两套方法"},"410":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-16","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"连接状态：只能订阅"},"411":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-17","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"话题：`MessageTopic` 有四个构造器"},"412":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-18","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"12. 加一个新方法 / 新字段的清单"},"413":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-19","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","content":"这一篇是给**改这一层的人**看的：为什么这么做，以及加东西时该动哪儿。\n用这一层的人请先看插件 › Simplify 封装。"},"414":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-20","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**只简化输入，不改变输出。** 返回值永远是 TDLib 的原始 JSON（`Value` / `Vec<Value>`），\n不带自己的包装类型。插件要能随时退回手写请求。"},"415":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-21","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**一个方法一个参数结构体 + 短字段名。** `text` / `media` / `topic_id` 这些名字只服务于「人好写」，\n到 TDLib 字段名的映射**只有一处实现**（`send_params` / `edit_*_params` / `put_common`）。\n短名字不代表裸标量：`topic_id` 是 `Topic`，\n`media` 是 `Media`——凡是有「选哪个构造器」问题的一律用枚举，不用 `i64` 让人猜。"},"416":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-22","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"**公开方法都等到结果**（唯一例外是同步的 `formatted`）。请求号不外泄——泄漏就意味着调用方要自己管\n`old_message_id` / `request_id` 那一套，而这正是这一层要替人扛的东西。"},"417":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-23","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#三条不可协商的原则","content":"改这一层之前先读一遍这三条：违反任何一条的改动，都应该先回来改这一节说清楚为什么要破例。"},"418":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-24","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"`Simplify` 只持有一个 `HostApi`（它是 `Copy`）。**没有一处**直接碰 `tdjson` 的符号："},"419":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-25","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"异步方法走 `host.td_invoke_simplified(\"方法名\", payload)`——`@type` 由宿主补，\n返回 `RequestId`；响应从 `\"response\"` 通道回来（只发给发起请求的那个插件）。"},"420":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-26","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"唯一走别的是 `formatted`：同步的 `host.td_execute`（下一节解释）。"},"421":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-27","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#1-请求出口一切经-abi","content":"参数 JSON 不是字符串拼接，而是 `serde_json::Map` 一层层 `insert` 出来的——每个字段「发 / 不发」\n在代码里一眼能看出来（`Option` 为 `None` 就是整个字段缺省，不是发 `null`）。"},"422":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-28","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`Text { text, parse_mode }` → `formattedText { text, entities }` 只有一条路：TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。\n**这里刻意不做第二套解析器**——一旦自己解析，「我们认的语法」和「Telegram 认的语法」就开始漂移\n（实测就已经够意外了：MarkdownV2 的粗体是 `*x*`，`**x**` 会被吞成 `x` 且不给 bold entity）。"},"423":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-29","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"代价是一次往返，而这次往返**必须是同步的**："},"424":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-30","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"插件通常正是在**更新回调里**发消息，而「更新」和「响应」都靠接收循环那个线程投递。\n在那儿 `td_invoke` + 等响应 = 自己卡自己的投递线程，等到的一定是超时。\n`parseTextEntities` 不碰服务器，TDLib 允许同步跑它（`td_json_client_execute`）——所以这条链路\n即使在**更新回调里**也是安全的，换成异步等待反而会把自己卡死。"},"425":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-31","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"实现上的三点："},"426":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-32","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`ParseMode::to_td()` 把四个模式换成三个 `TextParseMode`（`Plain` 返回 `None`，直接跳过请求）；"},"427":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-33","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"拿不到结果（没接 TDLib / 报错 / 回了个别的）→ `formatted_from` 退回纯文本，并打一条 `Warn`；\n一条 Markdown 写错的消息不该让整条消息发不出去；"},"428":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-34","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#2-文本链路为什么不异步","content":"`formatted` 作为**渲染闭包**传进 `send_params(.., render)` / `edit_*_params(.., render)`，\n所以每个发送 / 编辑方法都自动得到「文本的最终形态」，不需要各自处理解析。"},"429":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-35","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"TDLib 是异步的，`sendMessage` 的真相是这样的："},"430":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-36","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"封装把 ②③ 合成一次（见 `await_response` / `await_outcome`）："},"431":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-37","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_response`：等 `\"response\"` 通道，`request_id` 精确匹配；`@type == \"error\"` → `SimplifyError::Tdlib`；"},"432":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-38","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`await_outcome`：走**兜底的 `\"update\"` 通道** + `\"old_message_id\"` 匹配。成功与失败两条更新都在这条通道上，\n所以一次等待就能拿到「到底成了没」；按临时消息的 id 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来。"},"433":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-39","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"**超时先补救**：`cancel_sending` 用 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条还没发出去的消息撤掉，\n再返回 `Timeout(u64)`。发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消。这一步**只打日志**，不把删除的成败返回结果。"},"434":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-40","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"相册是同一套的 N 倍：`sendMessageAlbum` 的响应是 `Messages`（一组），`pending_messages` 取出每一项的临时 id，\n然后**逐项** `await_outcome`。`timeout_ms` 是**整组共用一个预算**——方法是把 deadline 算出来，\n每次只剩 `remaining_ms(deadline)`，不是每项各重新计时。"},"435":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-41","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#3-发送两步合成一次等待","content":"`AlbumSize` 是**发之前**挡下来的（`invoke_send_album` 里先验 2–10 项），因为一个错项数的相册\n发出去也只会让服务端拒绝，不如在本地给个清脆的错误。"},"436":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-42","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"这类方法**没有结局更新**——结果就是响应本身："},"437":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-43","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"成功 ⇒ `Message`（编辑）或 `ok`（删除 / 应答）；"},"438":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-44","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`@type == \"error\"` ⇒ `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（`Message is not modified`、消息太老删不动都在这一档）。"},"439":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-45","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"**这里刻意不重试**：该等多久是限流策略的事，调用方比封装层更清楚。"},"440":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-46","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#4-编辑--删除--应答只有一步","content":"`editMessageReplyMarkup` 是真签名里 `reply_markup` **必填**的那个（`chat_id message_id reply_markup`），\n所以「不要键盘」不能靠省略字段表示，必须发 `replyMarkupRemoveKeyboard`——`edit_markup_params` 用\n`entry(..).or_insert_with(..)` 兜住这一点。相册要挂键盘就只能先发、再用这条改。"},"441":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-47","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"`messageRichMessage` 与普通消息的互斥规则完全不同（那边「文本 / 媒体」二选一，这边是一棵树），\n所以它有独立参数类型 `RichMessageParams` 与独立的构造入口（`RichMessage`）。"},"442":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-48","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"特殊性在于：**Markdown/HTML 源由服务端解析且仅 bot 可用**，让 local 之间也就没有中间态可看。\n为了让用户号也能写 Markdown，`fuyubot-simplify` 带了一份**受控子集**的本地转换器\n（`markdown` 模块 → `InputPageBlock` 块树）：认不出的一律退回普通文本，不报错。\n按钮在 Markdown 里没有语法，所以是显式的 `RichButton` + `with_button_row`。"},"443":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-49","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#5-富消息为什么单列一条路","content":"实现细节、覆盖表与测试分工在插件 › 富消息，这里不重复——\n**只记住一条**：发/编辑也只是 `sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，\n出口仍然只有一个。"},"444":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-50","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"公开方法底下其实只有三种等待："},"445":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-51","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                              | 等什么     | 过滤器                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `wait_response(request_id, ms)` | 某个请求的响应 | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"446":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-52","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                            | 等什么     | 过滤器                       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, ms)` | 一条匹配的更新 | `UpdateFilter::to_json()` |","table":"table-0"},"447":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-53","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"| 出口                    | 等什么                          | 过滤器                                   |\n| --------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` 内部的循环 | 一组 `updateFile`，直到 completed | `{\"event_type\":\"update\",\"file.id\":…}` |","table":"table-0"},"448":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-54","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里有个容易写错的地方：`update_type` 落在 **`event_type` 键**（通道选择），\n其余条件才是对负载的字段匹配；普通更新把消息包在 `message` 里（所以条件是 `message.chat_id`），\n而 `updateNewCallbackQuery` 这类把字段放在顶层（`UpdateFilter::flat` 切的就是这个前缀）。"},"449":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-55","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#6-等待层三个底层出口","content":"`wait_for_update` 返回的 `WaitHandle::payload_json` 是宿主的**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用前有效；\n`wait_for_update_json` 内部用 `payload_of` 当场拷成 `Value`。凡是跨越宿主调用的，都要拷。"},"450":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-56","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"`on_command` 把 Rust 闭包交给 C 回调，`user_data` 必须是一个**稳定**的指针。现在递给 ABI 的\n是**一个结构体**（处理函数 + `HostApi`）的堆地址："},"451":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-57","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"Box 活着时堆上那份的地址不变；trampoline 里再还原成 `&CommandHandler`。所有权整体压在\n`CommandSubscription` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**（`Drop` 里调 `host.off(handle)`），语义跟 `Effect` 一致。"},"452":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-58","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"以前这里是「两层 Box」（`Box<Box<dyn Fn(..)>>`，交出去的是内层胖指针的目标地址）。加身份判定之后\n需要随订阅一起活的状态不止一个闭包，就收成一个结构体——**同样的道理：只有堆上那份的地址能交出去**。"},"453":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-59","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"过滤发生在这个 trampoline 里：`command.addressed_to` 是 `Some(别人)` 就直接返回，闭包根本不会被调。\n判定要问宿主（`fuyubot.host.identity` 的 `usernames`），**每条点名命令都现问一次**：这是纯内存的\nservice 读，不碰 TDLib；反过来把它缓存进 `CommandHandler` 就会在用户名被 `updateUser` 改掉之后\n一直按旧名字判断（踩过一次）。命令是人手敲的，这点开销无所谓。"},"454":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-60","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#7-命令订阅为什么状态要放堆上","content":"trampoline 是 `extern \"C-unwind\"`（宿主要求），并且对所有空指针先 `return -1` / `0`，不会 panic 过 FFI。"},"455":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-61","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"`*_then` 的实现就三行——`spawn_then(move || simplify.xxx(..), on_done)`："},"456":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-62","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"因为等待必须是阻塞的（上层 API 就是这么设计的），要「不阻塞」只能换线程。代价是每次调用一个 OS 线程\n（有 `timeout_ms` 兜着，不会一直挂着），并且 `JoinHandle` 必须交回插件——**插件卸载前要 join**，\n否则动态库卸载之后线程还在执行库里的代码。这是 Gotcha，不是建议。"},"457":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-63","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#8-异步版一次调用一个线程","content":"这一层**不引入 async runtime**：阻塞 + 线程已经够表达这套语义，而且 `HostApi` 本身是同步的 C ABI。"},"458":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-64","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 请求本身就发不出去（ABI 层） | `Abi(AbiError)`（宿主没接 TDLib 时也会在这里冒泡） |","table":"table-1"},"459":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-65","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源        | 变体          |\n| --------- | ----------- |\n| 参数串里含 NUL | `BadString` |","table":"table-1"},"460":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-66","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                     | 变体                        |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 响应是 `@type == \"error\"` | `Tdlib { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"461":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-67","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                        | 变体                             |\n| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `updateMessageSendFailed` | `SendFailed { code, message }` |","table":"table-1"},"462":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-68","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源               | 变体             |\n| ---------------- | -------------- |\n| 到期没结局（**已先撤回**过） | `Timeout(u64)` |","table":"table-1"},"463":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-69","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"| 来源                                    | 变体                                                                                                              |\n| ------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 本地校验挡下来的（相册项数、空的富消息 / 按钮行、源不是块树、转发条数） | `AlbumSize` / `EmptyRichMessage` / `RichSourceNotBlocks` / `EmptyButtonRow` / `EmptyForward` / `TooManyForward` |","table":"table-1"},"464":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-70","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"身份类查询（`me` / `chat_member`）走的是另一条路：**不把错误往上传**。\n调用方只想要「有 / 没有管理权」，不该被迫处理 TDLib 的错误码，所以内部 `soften`\n把 `error` 响应记一行 `Warn` 之后当成「没拿到」，再由上层的 `bool` 方法折成 `false`。"},"465":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-71","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#9-错误映射","content":"区分 `Tdlib` 与 `SendFailed` 是有意的：**方法被拒绝**和**发出去了但没发成**是两回事，\n调用方的处理也不一样（前者通常是用法错，后者通常是限流 / 权限）。"},"466":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-72","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"靠肉眼对 `td_api.tl` 是靠不住的（本文开头那批方法名以前就按 Bot API 拼错过一次），\n所以每次改动都要过这几条离线测试："},"467":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-73","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema`：`TdApiSchema::compiled()`\n（编译期从 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据）逐条 `check_request(\"方法名\", &payload)`——\n参数名写错、漏字段、多发字段都会失败，**不需要联网**；"},"468":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-74","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`every_media_kind_becomes_one_send_message` / `media_setters_touch_only_the_variants_that_have_the_field`：\n七个 `Media` 变体各自的 `inputMessage*` 形状，以及「链式设置器只在有这个字段的变体上生效」；"},"469":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-75","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`album_rejects_wrong_sizes` / `edit_reply_markup_is_how_an_album_gets_a_keyboard`：\n上面两节说的那些边界；"},"470":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-76","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table` / `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for`\n（在 `rich.rs`）：本地 Markdown 转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表一类一例，加块 / 删块会让它失败。"},"471":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-77","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"上面第一条只覆盖「离线也发得出去」的那些请求。**要走账号分支的**（比如 bot 专用的\n`setMessageReactions`）离线根本走不到，所以 `chat.rs` 里另有一条\n`new_request_shapes_pass_the_real_schema`：直接把 `*_params` 函数拼出来的形状喂给\n`check_request`。加新方法时**两边都要接**：前者靠在 schema 测试里补一次调用，后者靠补一个 case。"},"472":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-78","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"嵌套构造器的名字同样要验：`every_message_topic_constructor_is_reachable` 检查四个\n`MessageTopic` 构造器的 `@type` 与字段名都还在真 `td_api.tl` 里（见下一节）。"},"473":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-79","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#10-真-schema-守卫离线测试","content":"在线行为（`cargo test -p fuyubot-tdlib -- --ignored`）验证的是「真库认不认这些值」，与上面这层互补。"},"474":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-80","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"TDLib 里没有「这个人是不是管理员」这种字段：`user` 连 `is_bot` 都没有（身份在 `user.type`），\n管理权只在 `getChatMember` 的 `ChatMember.status` 里。所以："},"475":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-81","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`chat_member()` 拿原始 `ChatMember`（想要细节就用它）；"},"476":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-82","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"`is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` 直接返回 `bool`——**不是 `Result<bool>`**。\n查不到的四种情况（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊 / 拿不到自己 id）答案都一样：\n「不确定」时说「没有」比说「有」安全，让调用方处理一堆「其实是没查到」的 `Err` 没有价值。"},"477":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-83","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"「自己」没有捷径：`getChat` 不带「我是不是管理员」，只能 `getMe` 拿 id 再 `getChatMember`。\n两次等待**各用一份** `timeout_ms`。"},"478":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-84","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#管理权为什么返回-bool","content":"群主（`chatMemberStatusCreator`）**没有** `rights` 结构，所以除了 `is_anonymous`（它在 creator\n自己的字段上）以外一律算「有」——`is_admin_status` 里这个分支是显式的。"},"479":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-85","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`forwardMessages` 的响应是 `Messages`，和 `sendMessage` 一样是**还没发完**的临时消息。\n这里刻意只等响应：转发的成败通常不参与后续逻辑，多等一轮（N 条 `updateMessageSend*`）不划算。\nTDLib 单项失败时在对应位置放 `null`，所以调用方仍能按位判断。"},"480":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-86","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#转发为什么不等发送结局","content":"`message_ids` 在 `forward_params` 里**排序去重**：TDLib 要求严格递增，而调用方手里的 id 多半\n是从若干条更新里攒出来的。"},"481":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-87","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                  | bot                                  |\n| --- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 加一个 | `addMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions`（**bot 只能用这个**） |","table":"table-2"},"482":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-88","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"|     | 用户号                     | bot                        |\n| --- | ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 去掉  | `removeMessageReaction` | `setMessageReactions` 传空列表 |","table":"table-2"},"483":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-89","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"语义差别是真实的：用户是「在已有反应上追加 / 删掉指定的一个」，bot 是「整组覆盖」。\n所以 bot 侧的 `unreact` **忽略** `reaction` 参数直接清空——这一点写在方法文档里，不要当 bug 修。"},"484":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-90","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#表情反应bot-与用户号是两套方法","content":"判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type`，也就是每次 `react` 多一次往返。**这里刻意不做缓存**：\n`Simplify` 是 `Copy` 且无状态，加个进程级 `OnceLock` 会让「离线环境拿到过什么」变成隐藏状态，\n测试也会被污染。调用方已经知道自己是哪种时，直接调 `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` 就绕开了。"},"485":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-91","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"TDLib 没有 `getConnectionState`，状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 出现且**不重放**——\n所以只能订阅并记住最新那条，`ConnectionTracker` 就是干这个的："},"486":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-92","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"与第 7 节的「状态放堆上」同一个道理：结构体会**按值返回**（被移动），\n只有堆上那一份的地址能交出去给 ABI。所有权压在 `ConnectionTracker` 上，所以 **drop = 退订**。"},"487":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-93","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#连接状态只能订阅","content":"`is_ready()` 对「还没收到过任何更新」也返回 `false`——宁可保守，别把「不知道」当「连上了」。\n⚠️ 这是**连接**状态，不是授权状态：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"488":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-94","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`sendMessage` / `sendMessageAlbum` / `forwardMessages` 的 `topic_id` 是 `MessageTopic`，\n**不是**一个裸 id："},"489":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-95","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicForum { forum_topic_id: int32 }` —— **论坛**群组，以及与 bot 的私聊；"},"490":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-96","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicThread { message_thread_id: int53 }` —— **非论坛**群组的评论串；"},"491":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-97","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"`messageTopicDirectMessages` / `messageTopicSavedMessages`。"},"492":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-98","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#话题messagetopic-有四个构造器","content":"这一层以前固定按 `messageTopicThread` 拼，等于在非论坛群以外全错，所以改成 `Topic` 枚举并\n**不给 `From<i64>`**：论坛话题是 `int32`、评论串是 `int53`，一个裸数字说不清是哪一种。"},"493":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-99","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**参数结构体**（一个方法一个，字段用短名字）→ `Default`（`timeout_ms` 用 `DEFAULT_TIMEOUT_MS`）；"},"494":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-100","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**请求组装函数** `xxx_params(.., render)`：`@type` 不要自己写（那是宿主补的），\n字段名以真 `td_api.tl` 为准；"},"495":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-101","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**`Simplify` 上的方法**：阻塞版等到结果 + 同名 `*_then`（见第 8 节）；"},"496":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-102","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补测试**：先让 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 盖住新请求；"},"497":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-103","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"**补文档**：插件 › Simplify 封装 里按**功能范围**归到对应那一节，\n别新开章节堆在末尾。"},"498":{"id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals-104","page_id":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/dev/simplify-internals#12-加一个新方法--新字段的清单","content":"方法名 / 字段名**不要按 Telegram Bot API 的直觉写**。TDLib 里一切发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n媒体类型在 `input_message_content.@type` 里；话题是 `topic_id`（而且是 `MessageTopic`，\n论坛话题是 `messageTopicForum` **不是** `messageTopicThread`）、回复是 `reply_to`、\n没有顶层 `caption`。要查就查真 `td_api.tl`（或 `fuyubot-sdk td-method <名字>`）。"},"499":{"id":"/docs","page_id":"/docs","type":"page","content":"fuyubot 文档","tags":[],"url":"/docs"},"500":{"id":"/docs-0","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架"},"501":{"id":"/docs-1","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个 CLI，职责严格分离"},"502":{"id":"/docs-2","page_id":"/docs","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs#下一步","content":"下一步"},"503":{"id":"/docs-3","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"**fuyubot** 是一个基于 TDLib 的 Telegram bot / user 框架：Rust 内核 + C ABI 插件 + 多语言 SDK。\n插件就是一个动态库（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`），一个 cdylib 就是一个插件。"},"504":{"id":"/docs-4","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"使用文档\" href=\"/docs/usage/\" description=\"下载安装、配置文件、运行、回放、实例管理与排错\" />"},"505":{"id":"/docs-5","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"插件开发\" href=\"/docs/plugin/\" description=\"Rust / C / C++ / Python / JS / TS 插件、事件、TDLib 调用与 ABI\" />"},"506":{"id":"/docs-6","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"开发文档\" href=\"/docs/dev/\" description=\"改框架本身：架构、构建测试、常见陷阱、发布\" />"},"507":{"id":"/docs-7","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 文档\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" description=\"fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk 的完整命令参考\" />"},"508":{"id":"/docs-8","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI       | 干什么 | 子命令                                           |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot` | 跑框架 | `init` / `run` / `status` / `stop` / `plugin` |","table":"table-0"},"509":{"id":"/docs-9","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"| CLI           | 干什么 | 子命令                                                                       |\n| ------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk` | 写插件 | `init` / `codegen` / `check` / `abi-version` / `td-methods` / `td-method` |","table":"table-0"},"510":{"id":"/docs-10","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#两个-cli职责严格分离","content":"两个都**不编译、不打包插件**——编译是插件作者用自己语言工具链（`cargo build`、`cl /LD`、`gcc -shared`）完成的事，\n`fuyubot plugin install` 只负责把编好的产物**复制**进插件目录。"},"511":{"id":"/docs-11","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"**普通用户**：到 Releases 下对应平台的包，解压就跑 ——\n见 下载与安装"},"512":{"id":"/docs-12","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要自己编：见 从源码构建"},"513":{"id":"/docs-13","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"要写插件：看 插件总览"},"514":{"id":"/docs-14","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"想改框架：看 开发文档"},"515":{"id":"/docs-15","page_id":"/docs","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs#下一步","content":"卡住了：看 常见问题"},"516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"page","content":"ABI 契约","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi"},"517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"HostApiVTable、导出符号、内存所有权与版本协商"},"518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件必须导出的符号"},"519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"HostApiVTable：`host_ctx` + 22 个函数指针"},"520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"服务作用域"},"521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"服务的形状：`ServiceVTable`"},"522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"怎么调方法"},"523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"宿主预置的服务"},"524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"内存所有权：三条硬规矩"},"525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本协商"},"526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"simplify 操作表"},"527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"结果怎么回来"},"528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"入参的形状"},"529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作清单"},"530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"为什么本 ABI 一个可变参数函数指针都没有"},"531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"五种语言各自声明的兼容 ABI 版本"},"532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"回调为什么是 `C-unwind`"},"533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi","content":"这是**唯一**的跨语言契约：形状只有 `fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` 一份实现，C 头文件\n`fuyubot_plugin.h` 由 cbindgen 从它生成（**产物，不是源码**，别手改）。宿主侧所有桥在\n`fuyubot-loader/src/runtime.rs`。**改 ABI = 改那个文件 + 加版本号。**"},"534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"v3 的四个契约符号仍是必需/可选的底线；v4 另外导出三个**静态符号**，让\n`fuyubot-sdk check` 不 dlopen 也能看见插件是按哪个 ABI 编的（版本值仍只能运行时判定）。"},"535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                                           | 必须吗    | 说明                                              |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*const HostApiVTable) -> PluginHandle` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-0"},"536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号             | 类型                                                         | 必须吗 | 说明                                  |\n| -------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle, *const c_char) -> i32` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件；返回 `0` 成功 |","table":"table-0"},"537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号            | 类型                                   | 必须吗 | 说明             |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                  | 必须吗    | 说明                                |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(*mut c_char)` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-0"},"539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                   | 类型                                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn(PluginHandle)` | v4 可选 | 版本不匹配、不能调 `plugin_stop` 时，用来释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态 |","table":"table-0"},"540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                    | 类型                              | 必须吗   | 说明                                     |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> u32` | v4 可选 | 返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`；静态工具只检查“存在”，值要运行时看 |","table":"table-0"},"541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"| 符号                | 类型                                        | 必须吗   | 说明                                                                                                       |\n| ----------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | `unsafe extern \"C\" fn() -> *const c_char` | v4 可选 | 自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读；名字与 `init` 不一致只告警，依赖以 manifest 为准 |","table":"table-0"},"542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"符号名由常量钉住（`SYM_PLUGIN_INIT` / `SYM_PLUGIN_START` / `SYM_PLUGIN_STOP` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_STRING` / `SYM_PLUGIN_FREE_HANDLE` / `SYM_PLUGIN_ABI_VERSION` /\n`SYM_PLUGIN_MANIFEST`），`PluginLoader::load_with_config` 按这些名字 `lib.get(...)`。\nC++ 里必须把它们放进 `extern \"C\"` 块，否则名字被 mangle，宿主 dlsym 不到。"},"543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"`PluginHandle` = `{ abi_version: u32, size: u32, context: *mut c_void, name: *const c_char }`；\n`is_valid()` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以插件的 `context` 不能是\n`NULL`。`PluginHandle::FAILED` 是全零版本号，`const _` 里有\n`assert!(PluginHandle::FAILED.abi_version == 0)`。"},"544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主拿一个 cdylib 之后，按这个顺序敲你的符号——右边那条岔路是版本不匹配时的走法："},"545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"插件符号的调用时序与版本不匹配时的岔路"},"546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"宿主先 dlopen 并按名字 dlsym 七个符号，然后读 manifest 决定激活顺序，再调 plugin_init 校验 VTable；版本不匹配时只能调 plugin_free_handle 而不能调 plugin_stop，匹配则进 plugin_start、运行、最后 plugin_stop 与回滚。"},"547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"1 · dlopen + dlsym 七个符号"},"548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"C++ 要放进 extern \"C\""},"549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"2 · plugin_manifest（v4 可选）"},"550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"决定激活顺序"},"551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"3 · plugin_init(&amp;VTable) → PluginHandle"},"552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"先比 version 再比 size"},"553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不匹配"},"554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"拒绝加载"},"555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"abi_version == 0"},"556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_handle"},"557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"不能调 stop"},"558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"4 · plugin_start(handle, config_json)"},"559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"订阅 / 工具 / 中间件"},"560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"5 · 运行：事件回调与 td_invoke"},"561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"6 · plugin_stop → 回滚这批注册"},"562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"最后才卸载 cdylib"},"563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"plugin_free_string：谁分配谁释放"},"564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#插件必须导出的符号","content":"三点值得记住：`plugin_manifest` 在 `plugin_init` **之前**读（宿主得先知道你的依赖才能排顺序）；\n版本不匹配时**只能**用 `plugin_free_handle` 收尾，那一刻 `plugin_stop` 不会被调；\n卸载顺序是 `plugin_stop` → 回滚注册 → 最后才 drop 那个 `Library`。"},"565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"`version` 在偏移 0、`size` 在 4、`host_ctx` 在 8，其余 **22 个是函数指针**，全是 `Option<...>`；\n总大小 = `2 * size_of::<u32>() + 23 * size_of::<*const c_void>()`（`host_ctx` + 22 个函数），\n由 `const _` 里的 `offset_of!` / `size_of` 断言钉死。每个函数第一个参数都是 `host: *mut c_void`。"},"566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"下表签名省略第一个参数 `host`："},"567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段        | 签名    | 宿主实现          | 说明                                        |\n| --- | --------- | ----- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| —   | `version` | `u32` | `ABI_VERSION` | 必须等于 `ABI_VERSION`；首个字段，插件能在读其它任何字段之前先比一次 |","table":"table-1"},"568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名    | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                  |\n| --- | ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| —   | `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<HostApiVTable>()` | 老宿主 + 新插件时先比 `size` 再读尾部字段，读越界就是 UB |","table":"table-1"},"569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段         | 签名            | 宿主实现           | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------- | -------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| —   | `host_ctx` | `*mut c_void` | `&HostRuntime` | 每个函数都原样回传；插件作者看不见它（`HostApi` 自动带上） |","table":"table-1"},"570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段   | 签名                                                                      | 宿主实现     | 说明                                                                         |\n| --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 1   | `on` | `(update_type, filter_json, callback, user_data) -> SubscriptionHandle` | `api_on` | 订阅；`filter_json` 里的 `event_type` 选通道，其余键做负载匹配；`NULL` / 空串 / `\"null\"` = 收全部 |","table":"table-1"},"571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名               | 宿主实现      | 说明                   |\n| --- | ----- | ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 2   | `off` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_off` | 退订；句柄 drop 时宿主也会整批回滚 |","table":"table-1"},"572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段     | 签名                                  | 宿主实现       | 说明                                              |\n| --- | ------ | ----------------------------------- | ---------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | `emit` | `(event_type, payload_json) -> i32` | `api_emit` | 发自定义事件；对插件而言是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`，只送自己 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-1"},"573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段              | 签名                                                    | 宿主实现                | 说明                                                                                                    |\n| --- | --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | `register_tool` | `(descriptor_json, handler, user_data) -> ToolHandle` | `api_register_tool` | 登记元数据 + 可选处理器；处理器是 `C-unwind fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，只登记元数据用 `register_tool_meta` |","table":"table-1"},"574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                                | 宿主实现            | 说明                                          |\n| --- | ----------- | --------------------------------- | --------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 5   | `call_tool` | `(name, input_json) -> RequestId` | `api_call_tool` | 走 `ToolRegistry::call_tool` 的请求号路径（兼容/异步工具） |","table":"table-1"},"575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                 | 签名                                    | 宿主实现                   | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 6   | `call_tool_result` | `(name, input_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_call_tool_result` | **同步**执行工具并返回结果 JSON（失败 `{\"error\":…}`）。宿主线程局部缓冲，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                    | 宿主实现             | 说明                                 |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------- | ---------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 7   | `list_tools` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_tools` | 全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃 |","table":"table-1"},"577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段             | 签名                    | 宿主实现               | 说明                                    |\n| --- | -------------- | --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| 8   | `list_plugins` | `() -> *const c_char` | `api_list_plugins` | 进程内插件报告 JSON 数组（名字 / 状态 / 缺依赖 / 失败原因） |","table":"table-1"},"578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                   |\n| --- | ----------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| 9   | `provide_service` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service` | 注册命名服务到**调用者自己的作用域**（默认私有，兄弟插件看不见）；`vtable` 必须活到注销为止 |","table":"table-1"},"579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名                               | 宿主实现              | 说明                                |\n| --- | ------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| 10  | `get_service` | `(name) -> *const ServiceVTable` | `api_get_service` | 从调用者自己的作用域**沿父链**向上查找；没有就是 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段          | 签名                           | 宿主实现            | 说明                           |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------- | --------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 11  | `td_invoke` | `(method_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke` | 发完整 TDLib 请求 JSON（含 `@type`） |","table":"table-1"},"581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                     | 签名                                        | 宿主实现                       | 说明                                                      |\n| --- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 12  | `td_invoke_simplified` | `(method_name, params_json) -> RequestId` | `api_td_invoke_simplified` | 给参数补上 `@type = method_name`；参数不是对象就整份替换成 `{\"@type\": …}` |","table":"table-1"},"582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                              |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 13  | `td_execute` | `(request_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的方法（`td_json_client_execute`），当场返回响应 JSON。**不发请求号、不进请求留档、不等响应通道**——所以能在事件回调里用；宿主没接 TDLib 时返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段               | 签名                                                      | 宿主实现                 | 说明                     |\n| --- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | -------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| 14  | `use_middleware` | `(stage: u32, callback, user_data) -> MiddlewareHandle` | `api_use_middleware` | 挂在某个阶段；回调返回非 0 → 本阶段中断 |","table":"table-1"},"584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                                             | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                           |\n| --- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 15  | `wait_for_update` | `(filter_json, timeout_ms: u64) -> WaitHandle` | `api_wait_for_update` | **阻塞**当前线程；`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态。Rust 插件优先用 `ResponseRouter` 的 await 版 |","table":"table-1"},"585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段            | 签名               | 宿主实现              | 说明         |\n| --- | ------------- | ---------------- | ----------------- | ---------- |\n| 16  | `cancel_wait` | `(handle) -> ()` | `api_cancel_wait` | 从另一个线程取消等待 |","table":"table-1"},"586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段    | 签名                            | 宿主实现      | 说明                                                              |\n| --- | ----- | ----------------------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 17  | `log` | `(level: u32, message) -> ()` | `api_log` | 落进宿主环形缓冲（`LOG_CAPACITY = 256`）并打一行到 stderr；非法 level 按 `Info` 处理 |","table":"table-1"},"587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                                | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------ | --------------------------------- | ---------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 18  | `get_config` | `(section, key) -> *const c_char` | `api_get_config` | 读全局配置：`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），否则把 `section` 当点路径在 `plugin` 表里下钻（`fuyubot.manage` → `plugin.fuyubot.manage`）；`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。**宿主线程局部缓冲**，读完即弃；段 / 键不存在返回 `NULL` |","table":"table-1"},"588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段           | 签名                         | 宿主实现             | 说明                                                                                                                                    |\n| --- | ------------ | -------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 19  | `set_config` | `(key, value_json) -> i32` | `api_set_config` | 写配置：**只能写调用者自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。`key` 空串覆盖整段、否则按点路径设键。返回 0 = 成功（写内存 + 回写 `fuyubot.toml`）；非 0 = 越权 / 解析失败 / 写盘失败 |","table":"table-1"},"589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                                              | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                     |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 20  | `provide_service_shared` | `(name, *const ServiceVTable) -> ServiceHandle` | `api_provide_service_shared` | 注册到**进程级**（所有插件可见，这也是宿主那四个机制所在的层级）。同名会撞，只在真要共享时用。v4 起追加在 VTable **尾部** |","table":"table-1"},"590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                | 签名                       | 宿主实现                  | 说明                                                                                         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------------------ | --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 21  | `simplify_invoke` | `(op_json) -> RequestId` | `api_simplify_invoke` | **跨语言跑一个 simplify 操作**（v5）。宿主起工作线程执行，结果照 `@request_id` 回投到 `\"response\"` 通道。见「simplify 操作表」 |","table":"table-1"},"591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#hostapivtablehost_ctx--22-个函数指针","content":"| #   | 字段                       | 签名                           | 宿主实现                         | 说明                                                                                            |\n| --- | ------------------------ | ---------------------------- | ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 22  | `simplify_invoke_result` | `(op_json) -> *const c_char` | `api_simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑一个不碰网络的 simplify 操作，当场返回结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲）。回调里安全；传异步 op 返回 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-1"},"592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"每个插件加载时拿到**自己的一层 `Context`**，于是："},"593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"`provide_service` 注册的服务只对本插件（和它更深的子作用域）可见——**默认私有**。\n两个插件注册同名服务**不冲突**，各用各的实现。"},"594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"宿主注册在根上的公共服务（事件总线 / 服务容器 / 工具表 / 中间件管线）沿父链照样看得到。"},"595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"真要跨插件共享才用 `provide_service_shared`：它写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞\n（直接报 `ServiceNameExists`）。"},"596":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"插件卸载时，它那层作用域连同里面的服务一起消失。"},"597":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"跨插件联动的端到端示例（`/help` 的命令注册表）见插件联动。"},"598":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"两条形状上的硬要求："},"599":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**第一个参数总是 `host: *mut c_void`**：裸函数指针没有捕获环境，VTable 里放不了闭包；\n不给显式上下文就只能靠进程级全局，那样一个进程只能有一个宿主、测试也没法并行。"},"600":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务作用域","content":"**每个函数指针字段都是 `Option<...>`**：C 侧传 `NULL` 合法，非 `Option` 字段收到 `NULL` 就是 UB。\nRust 侧 `HostApi::from_raw` 一次解包校验全部 22 个，之后调用路径上没有 `Option`、也没有 panic 分支。"},"601":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"一个服务就是一张 C 结构表——宿主和插件都不需要知道服务的 Rust 类型，按名字调方法即可："},"602":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段     | 类型              | 含义               |\n| ------ | --------------- | ---------------- |\n| `name` | `*const c_char` | 服务名，NUL 结尾 UTF-8 |","table":"table-2"},"603":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型    | 含义                   |\n| --------- | ----- | -------------------- |\n| `version` | `u32` | 提供方填的协议版本（协商用，宿主不校验） |","table":"table-2"},"604":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段     | 类型    | 含义                           |\n| ------ | ----- | ---------------------------- |\n| `size` | `u32` | `size_of::<ServiceVTable>()` |","table":"table-2"},"605":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型            | 含义                    |\n| --------- | ------------- | --------------------- |\n| `context` | `*mut c_void` | 提供方的实例数据，**原样传给每个方法** |","table":"table-2"},"606":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段        | 类型                     | 含义                        |\n| --------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `methods` | `*const ServiceMethod` | 指向 `method_count` 个连续的方法项 |","table":"table-2"},"607":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"| 字段             | 类型      | 含义    |\n| -------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| `method_count` | `usize` | 方法项个数 |","table":"table-2"},"608":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#服务的形状servicevtable","content":"每个方法项是 `{ name: *const c_char, func: ServiceMethodFn }`，\n`ServiceMethodFn = fn(context: *mut c_void, input_json: *const c_char) -> *const c_char`。"},"609":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"Rust 侧有现成封装 `HostApi::call_service(name, method, input_json)`："},"610":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"服务不存在 / 没这个方法 / `func` 是 `None` → 返回错误；"},"611":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"调 `func(context, input_json)`，入参是方法的 JSON 负载字符串；"},"612":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"返回 `NULL` = 成功但没有输出（宿主内部约定），调用方得到空字符串；"},"613":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"返回非 `NULL` = **提供方持有的** NUL 字符串，立刻拷走——它只在本次调用返回\n后、下一次宿主函数调用之前有效（与 `list_tools` / `get_config` 同一套线程局部缓冲）。"},"614":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#怎么调方法","content":"C / Go 侧没有封装，就手动做同一件事：`get_service` 拿表 → 按 `method_count` 扫\n`methods[i]` 比名字 → 调 `func(context, input_json)`。脚本插件（Python / JS）的\n`call_service` / `callService` 就是这条路径的薄封装，见脚本插件 API。"},"615":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"宿主在根上预置了三个服务，任何插件沿父链都看得见，直接 `call_service` 就行："},"616":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                    | 方法       | 协议                                                                                                                                               |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `fuyubot.host.plugins` | `report` | 无参 → `{\"plugins\":[{name, state, …}]}`，进程内插件快照；`state` ∈ `active` / `pending` / `failed` / `activating`，`pending` 带 `missing`、`failed` 带 `reason` |","table":"table-3"},"617":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                     | 方法          | 协议                                                                                |\n| ----------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.identity` | `usernames` | 无参 → `[\"FuyuBot\"]`，自身全部活跃用户名（`usernames.active_usernames`）；没登录 / 没接 TDLib 时是 `[]` |","table":"table-3"},"618":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法   | 协议                                       |\n| --- | ---- | ---------------------------------------- |\n|     | `me` | 无参 → `getMe` 的原始 `user` JSON；没登录时 `null` |","table":"table-3"},"619":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名                  | 方法             | 协议                            |\n| -------------------- | -------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot.host.scope` | `scope_create` | `{}` → `{\"handle\":N}`，开一个子作用域 |","table":"table-3"},"620":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法            | 协议                                          |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `scope_enter` | `{\"handle\":N}`；成功 `null`，失败 `{\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-3"},"621":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法            | 协议           |\n| --- | ------------- | ------------ |\n|     | `scope_leave` | 忽略入参；离开当前作用域 |","table":"table-3"},"622":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"| 服务名 | 方法           | 协议                                          |\n| --- | ------------ | ------------------------------------------- |\n|     | `scope_drop` | `{\"handle\":N}`；成功 `null`，失败 `{\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-3"},"623":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"`fuyubot.host.plugins` 与 ABI 第 8 项 `list_plugins` 同源，只是多一条走服务这条路\n（内置 `/plugins` 插件就是这么读「进程里真在跑的」插件清单的）。`fuyubot.host.identity`\n是「我是谁」：宿主登录成功拿到 `getMe` 之后写进去，之后**每条 `updateUser`（id 是自己那条）\n都会刷新它**，所以改名字 / 改用户名之后读到的就是新值。`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `on_command`\n靠它把「点名给别人的命令」挡在插件外面——纯内存读取，不是 TDLib 请求，\n**在命令回调里调它不会卡接收循环**。面板与 `fuyubot status` 显示的账户行也来自同一份数据\n（经 `.fuyubot/status` 跨进程过去）。\n`fuyubot.host.scope` 是中间插件批量托管脚本时开子作用域用的，见架构。"},"624":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#宿主预置的服务","content":"句柄类型（`SubscriptionHandle` / `ToolHandle` / `ServiceHandle` / `MiddlewareHandle` / `RequestId`）\n都是 `#[repr(C)]` + 单个 `u64`（断言钉住 `size_of == size_of::<u64>()`）；\n`LogLevel` = 1..5（`Error` / `Warn` / `Info` / `Debug` / `Trace`），`Stage` = 0..5；\n`WaitHandle` = `{ id: u64, matched: u32, _reserved: u32, payload_json: *const c_char }`。"},"625":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**谁分配谁释放**。插件通过 `plugin_init` 返回的 `name`、以及插件自己分配的任何字符串，\n都由插件持有；宿主**绝不** free 它们。插件要给宿主一个需要接管的临时字符串，只能走\n`plugin_free_string` 那套约定。"},"626":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**宿主返回的字符串是线程局部缓冲**。`list_tools`、`get_config`、`WaitHandle::payload_json`\n指向宿主的一块复用缓冲（`thread_local! HOST_STRING`），**只在下一次调用宿主函数之前有效**。\n要留着就当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**——VTable 里没有 host 侧的 free 函数，这是设计不是遗漏。"},"627":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#内存所有权三条硬规矩","content":"**`ServiceMethodFn` 的返回值由提供方持有**，调用方读完即弃。"},"628":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比           | 不匹配的后果 |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------ |\n| `ABI_VERSION`（当前 `5`） | 编译期常量，两侧共同引用 | —      |","table":"table-4"},"629":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                       | 谁比                      | 不匹配的后果                      |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::version` | 插件侧 `HostApi::from_raw` | `AbiError::VersionMismatch` |","table":"table-4"},"630":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                    | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                     |\n| --------------------- | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `HostApiVTable::size` | 同上  | `AbiError::VTableTooSmall` |","table":"table-4"},"631":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置             | 谁比  | 不匹配的后果                               |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 某个函数指针是 `NULL` | 同上  | `AbiError::MissingFunction(\"<字段名>\")` |","table":"table-4"},"632":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"| 位置                          | 谁比                 | 不匹配的后果                 |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| `PluginHandle::abi_version` | 宿主侧 `PluginLoader` | `AbiMismatch`：**拒绝加载** |","table":"table-4"},"633":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不能**调 `plugin_stop`——那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。v4 起插件可以\n导出 `plugin_free_handle`，让宿主在版本不匹配时释放 `plugin_init` 分配的状态；老插件没有\n这个符号，那部分内存仍然回收不了。字段只增不改，新增一律追加在尾部。"},"634":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 2 的改动**：尾部追加了 `td_execute`（同步执行，见上表第 13 项）。"},"635":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 3 的改动**：尾部追加了 `get_config` / `set_config`（第 18 / 19 项），让插件能读全局配置、\n写自己的段。"},"636":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 5 的改动**：尾部追加 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（第 21 / 22 项），\n把 `fuyubot-simplify` 的语义下沉到宿主——**所有语言**的插件都能用「发消息等结局 / 超时撤回 /\nbot 与用户号挑不同反应方法 / Markdown → entities / 富消息本地块树」，不再只有 Rust 有。\n详见「simplify 操作表」。`ABI_VERSION` 跳到 5，旧插件重新编一次即可。"},"637":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"**版本 4 的改动**："},"638":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"`register_tool` 增加 `handler` / `user_data`，工具终于能真的执行；"},"639":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `call_tool_result`（同步拿工具结果）与 `list_plugins`（插件报告）；"},"640":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"尾部追加 `provide_service_shared`（第 20 项）：服务默认按插件作用域隔离，要共享得显式走它；"},"641":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"新增静态导出 `plugin_free_handle` / `fuyubot_abi_version` / `plugin_manifest`。"},"642":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#版本协商","content":"追加字段本身不破坏老插件（它们先比 `size`），但按契约「改 ABI 就加版本号」，\n`ABI_VERSION` 一起跳到 4——**用旧版本编出来的插件会被宿主拒绝加载**，重新编一次即可\n（仓库里所有插件与模板都从 `ABI_VERSION` 取值）。"},"643":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"`simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 收的是一张**操作表**而不是「一个方法一个函数指针」："},"644":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#simplify-操作表","content":"**为什么不是 22 个函数指针**：那样以后每加一个方法都要升一次 ABI 版本、三个仓库一起动。\n一张表之后，**加操作不动 ABI**。"},"645":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`simplify_invoke` 返回 `RequestId`，结果走**既有的** `\"response\"` 通道回到发起插件——\nJS/TS 的 `invokeAsync`、Python 的 `invoke_async`、Go 的 channel、Rust 的 `ResponseRouter`\n全都原样接住，没有新的回投机制。负载长这样（成功失败同形状，只看 `ok`）："},"646":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#结果怎么回来","content":"`error.code` 是稳定的英文代号，可以拿它分支：`timeout` / `send_failed` / `tdlib` /\n`missing_field` / `bad_args` / `unknown_op` / `async_op` / `host` / `missing_op`\n（`op` JSON 缺字符串字段 `op`）/ `simplify`（`SimplifyError` 里没单独归类的兜底）。"},"647":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`args` 基本就是对应 TDLib 方法的参数（键名以 `td_api.tl` 为准），**认不出的键原样透传**\n（宿主照 schema 只警告不拦，TDLib 升版加了新参数也不用等 ABI）。外加两个统一项："},"648":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"`timeout_ms`（默认 30 000）：整次操作共用的等待预算；"},"649":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#入参的形状","content":"文本字段（`text` / `caption`）可以是字符串（按纯文本），也可以是\n`{\"text\":\"…\",\"parse_mode\":\"markdown|markdown_v2|html\"}`——宿主替你走 `parseTextEntities`\n换成 `formattedText`。已经是 `formattedText` 就原样放过。"},"650":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"同步（不碰网络，`simplify_invoke_result` 也能跑，回调里安全）："},"651":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                    | args                  | 返回              |\n| --------------------- | --------------------- | --------------- |\n| `parse_text_entities` | `text` / `parse_mode` | `formattedText` |","table":"table-5"},"652":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | args                                              | 返回                                                                     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `rich_from_markdown` | `markdown` / `is_rtl` / `detect_automatic_blocks` | `inputMessageRichText`（可直接塞进 `send_message` 的 `input_message_content`） |","table":"table-5"},"653":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op         | args | 返回                         |\n| ---------- | ---- | -------------------------- |\n| `list_ops` | —    | `{\"sync\":[…],\"async\":[…]}` |","table":"table-5"},"654":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"异步（要等 TDLib 应答，只能走 `simplify_invoke`）："},"655":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op             | 语义                                                       |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `send_message` | 发 → 等响应拿临时消息 → 等**发送结局**；超时先 `deleteMessages(revoke)` 撤回 |","table":"table-6"},"656":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                   | 语义                    |\n| -------------------- | --------------------- |\n| `send_message_album` | 整组一个预算，逐项等结局，任一项失败即返回 |","table":"table-6"},"657":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                                                                | 语义                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `edit_message_text` / `edit_message_caption` / `edit_message_media` / `edit_message_reply_markup` | 等响应（`edit_message_reply_markup` 不给 `reply_markup` = 移除键盘） |","table":"table-6"},"658":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                | 语义                                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `delete_messages` | `chat_id` / `message_ids` / `revoke` |","table":"table-6"},"659":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                      | 语义                  |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `answer_callback_query` | 点了内联按钮必须回，否则客户端一直转圈 |","table":"table-6"},"660":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                 | 语义                               |\n| ------------------ | -------------------------------- |\n| `forward_messages` | `message_ids` 排序去重、最多 100 条；只等响应 |","table":"table-6"},"661":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                  | 语义                                                                      |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `react` / `unreact` | **自动挑方法**：bot 只能 `setMessageReactions`，用户号用 `add/removeMessageReaction` |","table":"table-6"},"662":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                               | 语义                   |\n| -------------------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `add_reaction` / `set_reactions` | 显式走某一条路（省一次 `getMe`） |","table":"table-6"},"663":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                        | 语义  |\n| ------------------------- | --- |\n| `me` / `my_id` / `is_bot` | 身份  |","table":"table-6"},"664":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op                                                  | 语义                                                                    |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member` / `is_chat_admin` / `am_i_chat_admin` | 管理权（`right` 是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名，如 `can_delete_messages`） |","table":"table-6"},"665":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op              | 语义                                 |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `download_file` | 等到 `updateFile` 报下载完成，返回最终的 `file` |","table":"table-6"},"666":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"| op       | 语义                                                |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke` | 逃生舱：`args.request` 是**完整**的 TDLib 请求 JSON，发 + 等响应 |","table":"table-6"},"667":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#操作清单","content":"操作表可以问出来：`{\"op\":\"list_ops\"}`。"},"668":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"Rust 的 `extern \"C\" fn(.., ...)` 确实稳定（能写、cbindgen 也能生成），但**本 ABI 一个都没用**，\n理由只有一条：`...` 会把**参数类型和个数校验全部丢掉**。VTable 里 22 个函数的参数都是固定的，\n用 `...` 只会让 C 侧传错参数从编译错误降级成运行期 UB。"},"669":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"将来真要加，正确的声明形状是（C 侧）："},"670":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"两条必须知道的事："},"671":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"变参部分**不能**是唯一的参数——C 要求 `...` 之前至少有一个具名参数。"},"672":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#为什么本-abi-一个可变参数函数指针都没有","content":"**变参函数指针跨不了 ABI 的 `Option` 优化**：`Option<fn(..., ...)>` 不是 niche 优化，占**两个指针宽**，\n必须显式判空。本 crate 里那条\n`size_of::<Option<unsafe extern \"C\" fn()>>() == size_of::<*const c_void>()` 断言只对**非变参**函数指针\n成立；普通函数指针字段能享受 niche 优化（`NULL` 就是 `None`），这也是「整个 VTable 所有字段都能是\n`Option<...>` 且不撑大布局」的前提之一。"},"673":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                                              | 值   | 怎么生效                                                                      |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| C   | 头文件 `fuyubot_plugin.h` 里的 `#define ABI_VERSION 5` | 5   | 模板里写 `if (host == NULL \\|\\| host->version != ABI_VERSION) return failed;` |","table":"table-7"},"674":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-157","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言  | 声明在哪                   | 值   | 怎么生效                   |\n| --- | ---------------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| C++ | 同一份 `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 5   | 同上（导出符号放 `extern \"C\"`） |","table":"table-7"},"675":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-158","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言   | 声明在哪                                                                                   | 值   | 怎么生效                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `fuyubot_plugin_api::SDK_ABI_VERSION`、`COMPATIBLE_HOST_ABI_VERSIONS`、`is_compatible()` | 5   | `define_plugin!` 把它填进 `PluginHandle::abi_version` |","table":"table-7"},"676":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-159","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言     | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                                                              |\n| ------ | ------------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Python | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 由中间插件 `fuyubot_python_host` 承载（标准 ABI v5 cdylib），`abi_version` 它填 |","table":"table-7"},"677":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-160","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"| 语言      | 声明在哪          | 值   | 怎么生效                      |\n| ------- | ------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| JS / TS | **脚本不接触 ABI** | —   | 同上，由 `fuyubot_js_host` 承载 |","table":"table-7"},"678":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-161","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#五种语言各自声明的兼容-abi-版本","content":"脚本插件走的是薄 SDK（`fuyubot.py` / `fuyubot.ts`）→ 原生桥 → 中间插件这条路，\n**作者永远不碰 C ABI**；ABI 版本由承载它的那份 cdylib 声明。Python 与 JS 的中间插件\n是同一套机制的两份实现，「两门语言对 ABI 的理解」不可能漂移。"},"679":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-162","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`EventCallbackFn` 与 `MiddlewareCallbackFn` 都是 `unsafe extern \"C-unwind\" fn(...)`。\n`extern \"C\"` 边界上逃出去的 panic 会直接 **abort 整个进程**，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind`；\n`C-unwind` 允许 unwind 穿过边界，宿主就能接住、记一条日志、继续跑下一条更新。\n对 C/C++ 而言两者 ABI 完全一致；C++ 异常同样会穿过这个边界，**请自己在回调内处理完**。"},"680":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-163","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"`define_plugin!` 生成的三个导出函数还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——两层都要。"},"681":{"id":"/docs/plugin/abi-164","page_id":"/docs/plugin/abi","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/abi#回调为什么是-c-unwind","content":"版本不兼容时宿主**不会**调 `plugin_stop`：那是对一个不认识的 ABI 下手。字段只增不改，\n新增一律追加在尾部；改动必须同时抬 `ABI_VERSION`。"},"682":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"page","content":"异步等待（await）","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async"},"683":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"Rust / JS / TS / Python 里可 await 的请求与更新等待"},"684":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"Rust：`ResponseRouter`"},"685":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"JS / TS：`invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`"},"686":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"Python：`run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async`"},"687":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.py`"},"688":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"托管路径：`fuyubot.js`"},"689":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"选哪个"},"690":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具结果"},"691":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"`wait_for_update` 是**阻塞**原语：调用线程停下来等。要 JS `async/await` 那种语义，\n用下面这层**不阻塞**的封装——任务挂起，事件到了再唤醒。"},"692":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async","content":"> ⚠️ 这里有两套脚本 SDK，先确认你在哪一套：\n>\n> | 路径 | 入口 | 本文的 await |\n> | --- | --- | --- |\n> | `script_plugin!` 内嵌脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-script`） | `fuyubot_plugin.py` / `fuyubot_plugin.js` | ✅ 有 |\n> | `fuyubot-python-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.py` | ✅ 有（`run_async`） |\n> | `fuyubot-js-host` 托管脚本（`fuyubot-sdk-native`） | `fuyubot.js` | ✅ 有（`runAsync`） |\n>\n> 选错文件会出现「方法不存在」——先看插件目录里拷的是哪一个。"},"693":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`fuyubot-plugin-api` 从 ABI v4 起重导出 `ResponseRouter` / `ResponseFuture` / `UpdateFuture`："},"694":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"要点："},"695":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"**必须在插件自己的 executor 上 await**，别在宿主事件回调里 await（那是接收线程）。"},"696":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"`router.invoke*` 从插件自己的线程发请求时会用 scope service 把归属切回插件，\n响应不会丢；不需要手动 `scope_enter`。"},"697":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"取消 = `drop(fut)`；关闭 = drop router（所有 pending 立刻 `RouterClosed`）。"},"698":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#rustresponserouter","content":"超时不内建，用 `tokio::time::timeout` 或你运行时的等价物。"},"699":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.js`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）在回调协议上包了 Promise："},"700":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"TDLib 业务错误（`@type: \"error\"`）也 **resolve**；只有宿主拒绝请求才 reject。"},"701":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"`waitAsync` 超时/取消返回 `null`。"},"702":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#js--tsinvokeasync--waitasync","content":"老的 `invoke(..., onResponse)` / `waitForUpdate(..., onMatch)` 是底层/兼容 API。"},"703":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`fuyubot_plugin.py`（`script_plugin!` 内嵌路径）提供 asyncio 版，**不改老的 `run()`**："},"704":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`run_async` 建 asyncio 事件循环，后台线程读 stdin；`main` 在 `ready` 之后作为任务启动。"},"705":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`invoke_async` 的业务错误也 resolve，宿主拒绝请求才抛异常。"},"706":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"`wait_async` 超时/取消返回 `None`。"},"707":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#pythonrun_async--invoke_async--wait_async","content":"**仍然可以用 `run()`**：同步循环、没有事件循环，`invoke_async` 会直接报错。"},"708":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`fuyubot-python-host` 用 `uv run` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.py`（ctypes 原生桥），\nAPI 名字一样，只是 `import` 不同："},"709":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`run_async` 把原生桥的阻塞 `run()` 放到后台线程，主线程跑 asyncio 循环。"},"710":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`invoke_async` 的回调从原生桥线程 `call_soon_threadsafe` 回事件循环。"},"711":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"`wait_async` 是**一次性** `on(\"update\", ...)` 订阅，命中/超时后自动退订；\n`timeout_ms=0` 表示一直等。"},"712":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotpy","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., on_response)` 原样保留。"},"713":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`fuyubot-js-host` 用 `bun` 起的脚本，导入的是 `fuyubot.ts` / `fuyubot.js`："},"714":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`runAsync` 把原生桥的 stdin 读取放后台线程，但**回调在主线程的 `step()` 里分发**\n（bun 的 JSCallback 不能跨线程调用）；`main` 与 step 循环并行跑。"},"715":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"`invokeAsync` 仍走 `invoke` 的 request/response 配对；`waitAsync` 是一次性\n`on(\"update\", ...)`，超时/命中后自动退订。"},"716":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#托管路径fuyubotjs","content":"老的 `run()` / `invoke(..., onResponse)` 原样保留。"},"717":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                  | 用什么                   |\n| ------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 同步代码 / 宿主内部 / 登录状态机 | `wait_for_update`（阻塞） |","table":"table-0"},"718":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                         | 用什么                     |\n| -------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| Rust 插件、有 tokio 等 executor | `ResponseRouter`（await） |","table":"table-0"},"719":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景         | 用什么                         |\n| ---------- | --------------------------- |\n| JS/TS 内嵌脚本 | `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync` |","table":"table-0"},"720":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景          | 用什么                                         |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Python 内嵌脚本 | `run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async` |","table":"table-0"},"721":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                           | 用什么                                         |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| Python 托管脚本（`fuyubot.py`，uv） | `run_async` + `invoke_async` / `wait_async` |","table":"table-0"},"722":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景                        | 用什么                                      |\n| ------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| JS 托管脚本（`fuyubot.js`，bun） | `runAsync` + `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync` |","table":"table-0"},"723":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#选哪个","content":"| 场景           | 用什么                 |\n| ------------ | ------------------- |\n| C / C++ / Go | 回调 `on`（语言没有 await） |","table":"table-0"},"724":{"id":"/docs/plugin/async-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/async","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/async#工具结果","content":"工具调用没有“等响应”这一层：ABI v4 的 `call_tool_result` / `callTool` 是**同步**返回结果的。\n详见 工具与中间件。"},"725":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"page","content":"插件分发格式 v1","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle"},"726":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"plugins/<id>/plugin.json、静态探测、CLI 安装与商店索引契约"},"727":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#1-目标","content":"1. 目标"},"728":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"2. 目录布局"},"729":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"3. `plugin.json`"},"730":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#4-fuyubot-loader-公开-api新增","content":"4. `fuyubot-loader` 公开 API（新增）"},"731":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"5. Probe / 加载语义"},"732":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#6-cli-行为","content":"6. CLI 行为"},"733":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"`fuyubot plugin list`"},"734":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"`fuyubot plugin install <路径>`"},"735":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-uninstall-名字","content":"`fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字>`"},"736":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"`fuyubot plugin migrate [--dry-run]`"},"737":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"7. 商城索引（TUI 商店消费的契约）"},"738":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"8. 约束"},"739":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle","content":"> 状态：**已落地**（2026-11-03）。这份文件是并行开发的**接口契约**：\n> `fuyubot-loader` 与 `fuyubot-cli` 两侧按它实现，任何偏离先改这份文件。\n>\n> 非目标（**加载器 / 运行时**不做）：商店索引 / 网络下载 / zip 解压 / 签名 / `plugins.lock`。\n> 这些只在 CLI 的 TUI 商店（`crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs`）里；商城后端属于 P1，\n> 见 插件商店与分发。"},"740":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#1-目标","content":"一个插件 = 一个目录，目录里有 `plugin.json`（静态元数据）。"},"741":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#1-目标","content":"宿主**不 dlopen** 就能列举、校验、排序插件。"},"742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#1-目标","content":"旧形态（平铺 `*.dll` / `plugins/scripts/<name>/`）继续可用，给 `plugin migrate` 迁移。"},"743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#1-目标","content":"**ABI 不变**（仍是 v5，四个导出符号与 VTable 一个都不动）。"},"744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"规则："},"745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"原生包扫描 `plugins/*/plugin.json`（**只下一层**，不递归）。"},"746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"脚本包扫描 `plugins/scripts/*/plugin.json`（同样只下一层），**只用于列举**；\n真正的发现/启停仍由 SDK 的 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host` 负责。"},"747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"以 `.` 开头的目录（`.disabled` / `.staging` / `.cache`）一律跳过。"},"748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"名字以 `.disable` 结尾的目录也跳过（旧面板把目录改名禁用留下的历史形态）。"},"749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"目录名**必须等于** `plugin.json` 的 `id`；不一致时以 `id` 为准并告警。"},"750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#2-目录布局","content":"禁用 = 整个目录挪到 `plugins/.disabled/<id>/`，不写第二份清单。"},"751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"字段："},"752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                                |\n| -------- | --- | --------------------------------- |\n| `schema` | 是   | 目前只认 `1`；更大 → `UnsupportedSchema` |","table":"table-0"},"753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段   | 必填  | 说明                                                  |\n| ---- | --- | --------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id` | 是   | `[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*`，≤128，不含路径分隔符，不以 `.` 开头 |","table":"table-0"},"754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 说明       |\n| ------ | --- | -------- |\n| `name` | 是   | 展示名（可中文） |","table":"table-0"},"755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明                                            |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `version` | 是   | 非空；只允许 `[0-9A-Za-z.+-]`（不强制 semver 解析，商店阶段再严） |","table":"table-0"},"756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 说明                         |\n| ------ | --- | -------------------------- |\n| `kind` | 是   | `native` / `python` / `js` |","table":"table-0"},"757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段      | 必填  | 说明                                   |\n| ------- | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `entry` | 是   | 相对包根；禁止绝对路径、`..`、反斜杠开头；解析后必须仍在包内且是文件 |","table":"table-0"},"758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段    | 必填        | 说明                                            |\n| ----- | --------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `abi` | native 建议 | 静态预检用的**建议值**，真值以 `plugin_init` 返回的 handle 为准 |","table":"table-0"},"759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段          | 必填  | 说明                                              |\n| ----------- | --- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `platforms` | 否   | 空 = 全平台；`any` 也等于全平台；否则必须含 `current_platform()` |","table":"table-0"},"760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 说明                    |\n| --------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `depends` | 否   | 硬依赖（服务名，进内核 `inject`） |","table":"table-0"},"761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段                 | 必填  | 说明                   |\n| ------------------ | --- | -------------------- |\n| `optional_depends` | 否   | 软依赖（进 `soft_inject`） |","table":"table-0"},"762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 说明                    |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `provides` | 否   | 本插件提供的服务名（静态预检/商店展示用） |","table":"table-0"},"763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 说明                 |\n| -------- | --- | ------------------ |\n| `config` | 否   | 默认配置相对路径；P0 只解析不合并 |","table":"table-0"},"764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"| 字段  | 必填  | 说明               |\n| --- | --- | ---------------- |\n| 其余  | 否   | 未知字段**忽略**（向前兼容） |","table":"table-0"},"765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#3-pluginjson","content":"`current_platform()` 返回 `windows-x86_64` / `linux-x86_64` / `macos-aarch64` 这类串，\n与发布资产命名一致。"},"766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#4-fuyubot-loader-公开-api新增","content":"新模块 `crates/fuyubot-loader/src/bundle.rs`，`lib.rs` 里 `pub use`。\n类型/签名如下（可以加私有辅助，公开面不要漂）："},"767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#4-fuyubot-loader-公开-api新增","content":"`plugin_entries` 的顺序：**bundle 按 id 字典序在前，legacy 按文件名在后**；\nGo 的“最后加载”由调用方（`fuyubot-app` / CLI）按 `Probe.go_runtime` 分区，不在这个函数里做。\n目录不存在时返回 `Ok(vec![])` 还是 `Err`？**与现有 `plugin_files` 一致**：不存在返回 `Err`\n（调用方本来就按错误处理）；空目录返回 `Ok(vec![])`。"},"768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`PluginLoader` 新增："},"769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`probe_bundle`：读 `plugin.json` → 校验 → `entry_path` → 读文件魔数判 Go →\n返回 `Probe`。**不调用 `open_library` / `plugin_init`**。"},"770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`probe`（旧）：先 `looks_like_go_binary`，**是 Go 就返回新错误\n`LoadError::GoRequiresManifest { path }`，不 dlopen**；否则维持现状。"},"771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`DylibPlugin::probe(loader, path, config)`：`path.is_dir()` → `probe_bundle`，否则 → `probe`。"},"772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`DylibPlugin::apply` 用 `self.entry`（不是 `self.path`）去 `start_library`。"},"773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`DylibPlugin::abi_version()` 返回 `Probe.abi_version`（bundle 可能是 0，表示“装完才知道”）。"},"774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`LoadError` 新增："},"775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#5-probe--加载语义","content":"`scan_dir` / `load_dir` 改为走 `plugin_entries` + `probe_entry`，保持现有返回类型。"},"776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"**不再 dlopen / 不再创建 Kernel。** 输出四段："},"777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"原生包：`<id>\\t<version>\\tABI <n|?>\\t<kind>\\t<path>`"},"778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"旧形态 dll：`<文件名>\\tlegacy\\t<path>`（读不了元数据，直说）"},"779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"脚本包：`scripts/<dir>` 有 `plugin.json` 就按它列；没有就按 `package.json` / `pyproject.toml` 列"},"780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-list","content":"禁用项：`.disabled/<id>/` 与 `*.disable`"},"781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"目录 + `plugin.json`："},"782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"`kind = native` → 复制到 `plugins/<id>/`"},"783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"`kind = python/js` → 复制到 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`"},"784":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"目标存在 → 报错（不覆盖）"},"785":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"目录无 `plugin.json` 但 `is_script_plugin_dir` → 旧行为（`scripts/<目录名>/`），\n顺手把从 package.json/pyproject 生成的 `plugin.json` 写进目标（失败不致命）。"},"786":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"文件 dll → 旧行为；**Go 且无 sidecar → 报错并指路 `plugin migrate`**。"},"787":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-install-路径","content":"其它（zip / tar 等归档）→ CLI **不处理**，明确报错并指路：\n「用 TUI 插件商店安装，或手动解压到 `plugins/<id>/`」。"},"788":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-uninstall-名字","content":"按顺序找：`plugins/<id>/` → `plugins/scripts/<id>/` → `.disabled/` 下两处 →\n旧形态 dll（带不带 `lib` 前缀、带不带 `.disable`）。找到就整个目录删。"},"789":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"平铺 dll：**这里允许 dlopen 一次**（用户显式触发，进程即将退出）拿\nname/version/deps → 建 `plugins/<id>/bin/` → 移动 dll + 同主干同伴脚本\n（`.py/.js/.ts/.pyi`）→ 写 `plugin.json`。"},"790":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"`id` 取 `plugin_init` 的名字；非法 id（含 `/` 等）→ 报错跳过。"},"791":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"目标已存在 → 报错跳过，不合并。"},"792":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"Go：允许，但打一条「已永久映射，仅本次迁移进程」的说明。"},"793":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"`scripts/<dir>` 无 `plugin.json`：从 package.json / pyproject.toml 合成\n`id/name/version/kind/entry` 写入（entry 默认 `index.ts`→`index.js` / `main.py`），\n不移动目录。"},"794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"`--dry-run` 只打印计划。"},"795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#fuyubot-plugin-migrate---dry-run","content":"幂等：已有 `plugin.json` 的直接跳过。"},"796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"索引 URL 来自 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugins].registry_url`（或环境变量\n`FUYUBOT_REGISTRY_URL`）。索引是**静态 JSON**，由外部商城托管；本仓只消费，不生成。"},"797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"规则："},"798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"`schema` 只认 `1`；未知字段忽略。"},"799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"资产按 `current_platform()` 精确匹配，找不到再取 `any`；都没有 = 该平台不可用。"},"800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"`sha256` **必填**（大小写不敏感）；`size` 可选，只做显示/预检。"},"801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"`yanked: true` 的版本不参与选择。"},"802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"`api` 是**宿主 `fuyubot` 的语义版本区间**（不是 ABI、也不是 plugin-api 的版本）；\nP0 的 TUI 商店只做展示/提示，**不**据此拒绝安装——真正的兼容性以 `abi` 与运行时校验为准。"},"803":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"`abi` 大于宿主 `ABI_VERSION` → 明确报「需要更新的宿主」，不下载。"},"804":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"下载 URL 只允许 `https`；解压时必须防 zip-slip / 符号链接 / zip bomb\n（单包 ≤ 50MB、解压后 ≤ 200MB、文件数 ≤ 2000）。"},"805":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#7-商城索引tui-商店消费的契约","content":"解压后必须用 `BundleManifest` 再校验一次 `id` / `version` / `entry` / 平台。"},"806":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"**不改 ABI**：`fuyubot-abi` 一行不动。"},"807":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"**不递归扫描**：`node_modules` / `.venv` 绝不能进扫描。"},"808":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"**不改脚本插件根**：`plugins/scripts/` 保持，SDK 中间插件不动。"},"809":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"路径一律 `Path`，不拼字符串；Windows 反斜杠要兼容。"},"810":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"测试临时目录用 `target/test-tmp/...`（仓库约定），不要用系统 TEMP。"},"811":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"所有新增公开项要有 rustdoc；错误信息要能指导用户下一步。"},"812":{"id":"/docs/plugin/bundle-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/bundle","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/bundle#8-约束","content":"改动后至少 `cargo test -p fuyubot-loader --offline` /\n`cargo test -p fuyubot-cli --offline` / `cargo fmt --all --check` 通过。"},"813":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"page","content":"订阅与事件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events"},"814":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"on/off/emit、过滤器、双通道与归属"},"815":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"双通道：具体 `@type` 与兜底 `update`"},"816":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"过滤器"},"817":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"归属：`emit` 不是广播"},"818":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"Rust"},"819":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"Python / JS（薄 SDK）"},"820":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events","content":"事件总线是插件拿到 TDLib 更新的唯一入口，也是插件之间说话的方式。三个动作：\n`on` 订阅（返回句柄）、`off` 退订（或让句柄 drop）、`emit` 发自定义事件。"},"821":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新会被**同时**发到两条通道上："},"822":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道                                | 谁收         | 什么时候用    |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 具体的 `@type`（`updateNewMessage` 等） | 精确订阅了它的监听器 | 你只关心一种更新 |","table":"table-0"},"823":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道         | 谁收           | 什么时候用                 |\n| ---------- | ------------ | --------------------- |\n| `\"update\"` | 订阅兜底通道的所有监听器 | 你要看全部，或不想追 TDLib 的类型名 |","table":"table-0"},"824":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"| 通道           | 谁收               | 什么时候用              |\n| ------------ | ---------------- | ------------------ |\n| `\"response\"` | **只发给发起那个请求的插件** | 收 `td_invoke*` 的结果 |","table":"table-0"},"825":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"`\"update\"` 与 `\"response\"` 是 ABI 常量（`UPDATE_EVENT` / `RESPONSE_EVENT`），别自己拼字符串。"},"826":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条更新从进来到落到你的回调，中间是这样走的："},"827":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"更新分发：穿过管线后同时发到两条通道"},"828":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TDLib 的更新经接收循环交给 UpdatePipeline，穿过 PreUpdate、PreRoute、InPlugin、PostResponse 四个阶段后，被同时发到具体 @type 通道与兜底 update 通道，分别落到精确订阅的插件与订阅兜底的插件。"},"829":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"TdClient 接收循环"},"830":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"一条原始 JSON 更新进来"},"831":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"UpdatePipeline::process_value"},"832":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"六阶段，实跑 4 个"},"833":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreUpdate"},"834":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"0 · 刚进来"},"835":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PreRoute"},"836":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"1 · 解析 @type"},"837":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"InPlugin"},"838":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"2 · 可改负载"},"839":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"PostResponse"},"840":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"3 · 收尾"},"841":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"中间件挂在阶段上；一条更新只跑一遍，不是每个监听器一遍"},"842":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"同时发两条"},"843":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"具体 @type 通道"},"844":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"updateNewMessage、……"},"845":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"兜底 update 通道"},"846":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"每条更新都发一份"},"847":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 A"},"848":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"精确订阅 updateNewMessage"},"849":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"插件 B"},"850":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"订阅兜底 update，或带过滤器"},"851":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#双通道具体-type-与兜底-update","content":"**两条通道是「同时」，不是「二选一」**：一条 `updateNewMessage` 既会敲精确订阅它的监听器，也会敲所有\n订阅了 `\"update\"` 的监听器。过滤器在两个通道上各判一次，所以订阅兜底又写了过滤器的那一侧不会因为\n「没命中精确通道」而漏掉。"},"852":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"`on` 的第三个参数是一份过滤器 JSON：**点分路径 → 期望值**。"},"853":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则                       | 说明                                                                |\n| ------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `event_type` 键只用来**选通道** | `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}` 表示等 5 号响应；它**不参与负载匹配** |","table":"table-1"},"854":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则           | 说明                                                            |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 其余键做负载字段相等匹配 | 字段位置随更新类型变：`updateNewMessage` 的 `chat_id` 在 `message.chat_id` |","table":"table-1"},"855":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"| 规则              | 说明    |\n| --------------- | ----- |\n| 空 / `null` / 不传 | 该通道全收 |","table":"table-1"},"856":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#过滤器","content":"同一个事件可以订阅**多次**、各带各的过滤器。脚本侧按订阅号 `handle` 分发，所以不该响的回调不会响。"},"857":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"插件里调 `emit` 走的是 `emit_scoped(自己, …)`：只送给**该插件自己 + 全局订阅者**。\n归属的语义是「**额外定向**」而不是「排除广播」——宿主 `emit` 的更新照旧发给所有订阅者，\n`emit_scoped(owner, …)` 只是在那份收件人之外**再加**上 `owner` 自己的订阅。"},"858":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发             | 谁收得到     |\n| -------------- | -------- |\n| 宿主发更新 / `emit` | 所有匹配的订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"859":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发                | 谁收得到              |\n| ----------------- | ----------------- |\n| 插件 `emit(\"x\", …)` | 该插件自己的订阅者 + 全局订阅者 |","table":"table-2"},"860":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"| 谁发    | 谁收得到                                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 宿主的响应 | `emit_scoped(发起者, \"response\", …)`：全局 + 发起者 |","table":"table-2"},"861":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"要让别的插件收到你的事件，**让对方订阅全局事件**，不要指望你的 `emit` 是一次广播。"},"862":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#归属emit-不是广播","content":"订阅句柄必须活着。Rust 侧 `HostExt::subscribe_json` 返回的是 `#[must_use]` 的\n`Subscription`，**drop 就是退订**；`let _ = …` 会立刻退订。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，\n但那已经是另一回事了。"},"863":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#rust","content":"回调用 `extern \"C-unwind\" fn(user_data, payload) -> i32`，返回 `0` 表示成功；`payload` 是宿主临时的\nNUL 结尾字符串，要留就当场拷走（`parse_payload` 已经替你解析成 `serde_json::Value`）。"},"864":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"脚本侧的订阅**没有退订接口**——注册后一直有效，随插件停止一起撤。\n方法的逐个说明见 Python 插件 / JS 与 TS 插件。"},"865":{"id":"/docs/plugin/events-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/events","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/events#python--js薄-sdk","content":"要按固定次数等一条更新（阻塞式），用 `wait_for_update`，见 调用 TDLib。\n要改流经管线的负载，用中间件，见 工具与中间件。"},"866":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"page","content":"外部仓库插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external"},"867":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"不进本体 workspace 的原生插件，怎么接依赖、怎么拿插件目录"},"868":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"依赖：只能走 path"},"869":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件目录：别自己算"},"870":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"线程：回调里不能做慢事"},"871":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"装与验"},"872":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"一个真实例子"},"873":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"下一步"},"874":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"内置插件（`/start`、`/help`、`/plugins`）跟着发布包走，**第三方插件不必**：\n它们自己一个仓库、`cargo build` 出一个 cdylib，用 `fuyubot plugin install` 装进项目。"},"875":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external","content":"形态和内置插件完全一样（同一个 `define_plugin!`、同一张 `HostApiVTable`），\n差别只在三件事：**依赖怎么接**、**插件目录在哪**、**运行时库能不能从 crates.io 拿**。"},"876":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"运行时仓库只往 crates.io 发两个 crate：`fuyubot-abi` 和 `fuyubot-tdlib-sys`。\n**`fuyubot-simplify` 是 `publish = false`**——它不在 crates.io 上。"},"877":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"把它写成 `fuyubot-simplify = \"0.1\"` 会**编不过**（crates.io 上没有这个版本）。\n等它发版之后换成一行版本号就行。"},"878":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#依赖只能走-path","content":"`fuyubot-simplify` 在这里只当「人话参数 → TDLib 请求体」的构造器库用：\n`SendMessageParams` / `Media` / `Text` / `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_*_params`。\n「发出去并等结局」那一步走 ABI v5 的 op JSON 分发——\n和 Python / JS / Go 插件同一条路。"},"879":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"插件是宿主进程 `dlopen` 出来的动态库，`std::env::current_exe()` 拿到的是 **`fuyubot.exe`**，\n不是插件自己的目录——插件算不出自己旁边有什么文件。"},"880":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"要读同目录的静态资源（cookie、词表、模板），让宿主告诉你：\n`plugin_start` 的 `config_json` 里带着 `plugins_dir`（绝对路径）。"},"881":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#插件目录别自己算","content":"内置 `manage` 插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"882":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"`updateNewMessage` 的回调跑在**宿主的接收循环线程**上。解析网页、调外部 API、\n等 TDLib 应答——任何一件在这里同步做，都会把整个宿主堵死（同进程所有插件一起卡）。"},"883":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#线程回调里不能做慢事","content":"⚠️ 那个 `JoinHandle` **必须存进插件状态并在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**：\n宿主卸载动态库之后，线程还在跑库里的代码就是**未定义行为**。"},"884":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#装与验","content":"`--replay-wait` 给插件的静默窗口：要发慢速网络请求时调大，否则进程可能在请求发出前就退了\n（默认原生插件只有 150 ms）。见 离线回放。"},"885":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"FuyuBot-Douyin——抖音解析插件，\n`/dy <链接>` + 消息里自动识别抖音链接。它演示了本文全部三件事：\npath 依赖、靠 `plugins_dir` 读 cookie、回调里 spawn 工作线程。"},"886":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#一个真实例子","content":"同类做法另见 `XQAnimeBot-Rust`（把 MongoDB / qBittorrent / ffmpeg 各自拆成一个插件，\n业务插件按服务名取用）。"},"887":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"888":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"889":{"id":"/docs/plugin/external-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/external","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/external#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"890":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"page","content":"Go 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go"},"891":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"cgo 编 c-shared，逻辑用 Go 写、ABI 用一层 C 薄壳"},"892":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"结构：Go 写逻辑，C 写壳"},"893":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调：在 `plugin.c` 里加桥"},"894":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"895":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"编译"},"896":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"一个宿主行为要记住：Go 库不会被卸载"},"897":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"验证"},"898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"相关"},"899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"Go 也能写插件：`go build -buildmode=c-shared` 出来的就是标准动态库，宿主只要看到七个导出符号\n就认它。完整可跑的示例在 `examples/go-ping`。"},"900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go","content":"目前**没有** `fuyubot-sdk init --lang go` 模板——Go 这条路线是「自己搭工程」：\n抄 `examples/go-ping`，或者照下面这两段写。C 头文件仍然用\n`fuyubot-sdk codegen --lang c --dir <工程目录>` 生成，不要手抄。"},"901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件        | 作用                               |\n| --------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `main.go` | 逻辑：解析更新 JSON、拼 `sendMessage`、打日志 |","table":"table-0"},"902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件         | 作用                                                                              |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.c` | 四个 ABI 符号：`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_free_string` |","table":"table-0"},"903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"| 文件                 | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_plugin.h` | 生成物（`codegen --lang c` 落的），**不提交** |","table":"table-0"},"904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"为什么不直接 `//export plugin_init`：`PluginHandle` 是**按值返回**的结构体，由 C 侧构造最稳；\n也避免把宿主 VTable 的函数指针搬进 Go。C 侧只做转发："},"905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"Go 侧通过两个 C 小桥访问宿主（这样 Go 里不用碰函数指针）："},"906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#结构go-写逻辑c-写壳","content":"`fy_log` / `fy_invoke` 在 `plugin.c` 里实现，就是 `g_host->log` / `g_host->td_invoke_simplified` 的转发。"},"907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"`examples/go-ping` 只带了两个桥（`fy_log` / `fy_invoke`）。要用别的 ABI 函数就照同样形状加——\n**每个桥一行转发**，Go 侧不碰函数指针："},"908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"Go 侧声明 + 包一层："},"909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"三条 cgo 侧的硬规则："},"910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"传给 C 的字符串用 `C.CString` + `defer C.free`；漏了就是泄漏。"},"911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"桥返回的 `const char *` 是**宿主缓冲**：`C.GoString` 立刻拷贝，**不要**把 `*C.char` 存下来，\n也**不要** free 它。"},"912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#常用-abi-怎么调在-pluginc-里加桥","content":"订阅句柄留在 C 侧（`plugin_start` 里 `g_host->on(...)` 存进静态变量），Go 侧不持有——\ndrop 即退订，交到 Go 手里容易漏。"},"913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ⚠️ Go 没有 `fuyubot-sdk init --lang go` 模板（见页首），但可以直接调 VTable 上的\n> `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `invoke(sendMessage, …)`。"},"914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：在 `plugin.c` 里加一座 `simplify_invoke` 桥（和 `fy_invoke` 同形状），Go 侧就能像\n调普通函数一样发 op——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"`\n通道回投（带 `request_id`，与 `fy_invoke` 的响应同一个 `on` 通道）："},"915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `invoke(\"sendMessage\", …)` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                               |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText` |","table":"table-1"},"917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                  |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | 先 `fy_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就查：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"cgo 需要 C 编译器：Linux / macOS 用 `cc`，Windows 用 mingw-w64（如\nw64devkit）。"},"924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#编译","content":"Windows 上没装 mingw 时报 `gcc: executable file not found` 或\n`cannot open file 'mingwex.lib'`——那是缺 C 工具链，不是插件代码的问题。\nMSVC 的 `cl` 不能直接给 cgo 用（Go 的 Windows 外部链接器要 GCC 那一套）。"},"925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"Go 的 `c-shared` 运行时有线程与信号处理器，`FreeLibrary` / `dlclose` 之后进程会直接\naccess violation（`0xC0000005`）。"},"926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"所以 `fuyubot-loader` 会识别 Go 产物（文件里的 `\\xff Go buildinf:` 魔数），\n**故意不卸载**这类库：`plugin_stop` 照跑、注册照回滚，只是那几 MB 库内存留到进程退出。\n普通 Rust / C / C++ 插件不受影响，仍是 drop 即卸载。"},"927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#一个宿主行为要记住go-库不会被卸载","content":"这也意味着：**别在同一个进程里反复加载同一个 Go 插件**（热重载路径别指望它）。\n先 `fuyubot stop` 再 `run`，行为是干净的。"},"928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#验证","content":"回放输出里应能看到 `go-ping 插件：回了 pong` 和一条\n`sendMessage {\"chat_id\":…,\"input_message_content\":{\"@type\":\"inputMessageText\",…}}`。"},"929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"ABI 细节（2 个 u32 + `host_ctx` + 22 个函数指针、内存所有权、版本协商）：ABI 契约"},"930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"C / C++ 的写法（同一份头文件）：C 与 C++ 插件"},"931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/go-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/go","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/go#相关","content":"订阅与过滤器：订阅与事件"},"932":{"id":"/docs/plugin","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"page","content":"插件总览","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin"},"933":{"id":"/docs/plugin-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"原生插件（一个 cdylib）与脚本插件（一个目录），以及四种导出符号"},"934":{"id":"/docs/plugin-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"原生插件：七个导出符号"},"935":{"id":"/docs/plugin-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"最小闭环（原生插件）"},"936":{"id":"/docs/plugin-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"写原生插件要知道的六件事"},"937":{"id":"/docs/plugin-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"声明依赖：`inject` 与 `soft_inject`"},"938":{"id":"/docs/plugin-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"按语言看"},"939":{"id":"/docs/plugin-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"按能力看"},"940":{"id":"/docs/plugin-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名与目录"},"941":{"id":"/docs/plugin-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**插件有两种形态**，按需求选："},"942":{"id":"/docs/plugin-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件           | 脚本插件             |\n| --- | -------------- | ---------------- |\n| 语言  | Rust / C / C++ | Python / JS / TS |","table":"table-0"},"943":{"id":"/docs/plugin-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                 | 脚本插件                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| 形态  | 一个 cdylib（`.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib`） | 一个目录（manifest + 脚本 + 薄 SDK） |","table":"table-0"},"944":{"id":"/docs/plugin-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件              | 脚本插件         |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------ |\n| 边界  | 与宿主同进程，C ABI 函数调用 | 一个脚本一个解释器子进程 |","table":"table-0"},"945":{"id":"/docs/plugin-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件 | 脚本插件          |\n| --- | ---- | ------------- |\n| 崩溃  | 拖垮宿主 | 只有子进程死，宿主记一条错 |","table":"table-0"},"946":{"id":"/docs/plugin-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|      | 原生插件        | 脚本插件    |\n| ---- | ----------- | ------- |\n| 要编译吗 | 要（用你自己的工具链） | 不要，装上就跑 |","table":"table-0"},"947":{"id":"/docs/plugin-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"|     | 原生插件                                | 脚本插件   |\n| --- | ----------------------------------- | ------ |\n| 起步  | `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` | 看 脚本插件 |","table":"table-0"},"948":{"id":"/docs/plugin-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin","content":"**只想写脚本？** 看 脚本插件：一个目录就是一个插件，\n不编译、不碰 ABI，`fuyubot plugin install` 装上就跑。"},"949":{"id":"/docs/plugin-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"一个原生插件 = 一个 cdylib。宿主 `dlopen` 它，只认这七个导出符号，\n其余全部能力都经 `HostApiVTable` 回调宿主。插件不认识 Rust 内核，也不需要认识。"},"950":{"id":"/docs/plugin-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 干什么                                               |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 校验 VTable、构造插件状态；返回失败句柄（`abi_version == 0`）= 拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"951":{"id":"/docs/plugin-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 干什么                       |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 拿到配置 JSON，注册订阅 / 工具 / 中间件 |","table":"table-1"},"952":{"id":"/docs/plugin-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 干什么            |\n| ------------- | --- | -------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 卸载前调一次，回收自己的状态 |","table":"table-1"},"953":{"id":"/docs/plugin-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 干什么                               |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放**插件自己**分配的字符串（宿主从不 free 插件的指针） |","table":"table-1"},"954":{"id":"/docs/plugin-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ----------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`）。宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读它来决定激活顺序 |","table":"table-1"},"955":{"id":"/docs/plugin-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 干什么                                          |\n| --------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回编译期 `ABI_VERSION`，`fuyubot-sdk check` 靠它 |","table":"table-1"},"956":{"id":"/docs/plugin-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 干什么                                                         |\n| -------------------- | ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | 只在 ABI 版本不匹配时被调——那一刻不能调 `plugin_stop`，只能用它把 `init` 分配的状态还回来 |","table":"table-1"},"957":{"id":"/docs/plugin-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#原生插件七个导出符号","content":"契约细节（字段布局、内存所有权、版本协商、服务作用域）见 ABI 契约。"},"958":{"id":"/docs/plugin-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot init` 重复执行会被挡住（不覆盖你改过的配置）；三个键都有默认值，最简可以只有 `[bot]`。"},"959":{"id":"/docs/plugin-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（会拼进源码与 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"960":{"id":"/docs/plugin-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**产物落在哪**：`plugin install <工程目录>` 按 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}` 找产物（两边都有时取较新的）。插件若是**当前 workspace 的成员**，\n`cargo build -p <crate>` 默认把产物放在仓库根的 `target/`，靠最后一档照样能找到，不需要额外参数。"},"961":{"id":"/docs/plugin-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"**SDK 走源码开发时**设 `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` 指向 FuyuBot-SDK 仓库的 `crates/`，生成的插件会写 `path = \"…\"`；\n不设就写 crates.io 版本号。"},"962":{"id":"/docs/plugin-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#最小闭环原生插件","content":"`fuyubot` 管运行，`fuyubot-sdk` 管开发，**两个都不编译插件**：编译是作者自己语言工具链的事\n（`cargo build` / `cl /LD` / `gcc -shared`）。`fuyubot plugin install` 只**复制**已编好的产物。"},"963":{"id":"/docs/plugin-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                       | 说明                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回调是 `extern \"C-unwind\"` | 用 `extern \"C\"` 的话，逃出去的 panic 直接 abort 整个进程，宿主来不及 `catch_unwind` |","table":"table-2"},"964":{"id":"/docs/plugin-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事                               | 说明                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 一个 crate 只展开一次 `define_plugin!` | 七个符号名是 ABI 定死的，展开两次就是重复定义 |","table":"table-2"},"965":{"id":"/docs/plugin-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事             | 说明                                                               |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| ABI 版本目前是 `5` | 不匹配时宿主**拒绝加载**，不能调 `plugin_stop`，但会调 `plugin_free_handle` 把状态还回来 |","table":"table-2"},"966":{"id":"/docs/plugin-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事        | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 订阅句柄必须活着 | Rust 侧是 `#[must_use]` 的守卫，drop 就是退订 |","table":"table-2"},"967":{"id":"/docs/plugin-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事              | 说明                                         |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 插件 `emit` 不是广播 | 只送**自己 + 全局订阅者**（`emit_scoped`），影响别的插件要靠订阅 |","table":"table-2"},"968":{"id":"/docs/plugin-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#写原生插件要知道的六件事","content":"| 事      | 说明                                       |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 谁分配谁释放 | 宿主绝不 free 插件的指针；宿主给的字符串是线程局部缓冲，下次宿主调用前有效 |","table":"table-2"},"969":{"id":"/docs/plugin-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"manifest 里能声明两个列表，它们决定**宿主什么时候让你跑**、以及**跑的顺序**："},"970":{"id":"/docs/plugin-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段       | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                            |\n| -------- | --- | -------------------------------- |\n| `inject` | 硬依赖 | **不激活**。停在 `Pending` 等着，等你缺的东西出现 |","table":"table-3"},"971":{"id":"/docs/plugin-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"| 字段            | 意思  | 缺了会怎样                  |\n| ------------- | --- | ---------------------- |\n| `soft_inject` | 软依赖 | 照常激活，只是排在「软依赖也齐了」的插件后面 |","table":"table-3"},"972":{"id":"/docs/plugin-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"依赖名可以写两种东西，宿主都认："},"973":{"id":"/docs/plugin-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**服务名** —— 比如 `\"storage.mongo\"`，宿主查 `Context` 里有没有这个名字"},"974":{"id":"/docs/plugin-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**插件名** —— 比如 `\"fuyubot.manage\"`，宿主查同名插件是不是 `Active`"},"975":{"id":"/docs/plugin-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"硬依赖决定能不能跑，软依赖只决定排队位置"},"976":{"id":"/docs/plugin-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject 里的名字不齐就不激活，停在 Pending 等着；soft_inject 只影响排序，不齐也照常激活。名字可以是服务名，也可以是插件名。"},"977":{"id":"/docs/plugin-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"inject（硬）"},"978":{"id":"/docs/plugin-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;storage.mongo&quot;]"},"979":{"id":"/docs/plugin-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不齐就不激活"},"980":{"id":"/docs/plugin-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"soft_inject（软）"},"981":{"id":"/docs/plugin-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"[&quot;cache.redis&quot;]"},"982":{"id":"/docs/plugin-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"只影响排队位置"},"983":{"id":"/docs/plugin-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"宿主检查：这个名字在不在？"},"984":{"id":"/docs/plugin-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"服务名或插件名都认"},"985":{"id":"/docs/plugin-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"不在"},"986":{"id":"/docs/plugin-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"在"},"987":{"id":"/docs/plugin-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"Pending"},"988":{"id":"/docs/plugin-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"等着——不是失败"},"989":{"id":"/docs/plugin-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"激活"},"990":{"id":"/docs/plugin-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排在有软依赖的后面"},"991":{"id":"/docs/plugin-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"三件事值得先记住："},"992":{"id":"/docs/plugin-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**`Pending` 不是失败。** 它表示「还没轮到」或「等的东西还没来」。真正的失败只有两种：\n你的 `plugin_start` 报错，或者你依赖的**提供者已经 `Failed`**（那时你也会被级联标成 `Failed`）。"},"993":{"id":"/docs/plugin-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**软依赖不保证顺序。** 它只是排序偏好：软依赖齐的先上，不齐的也照样上，只是排后面。\n要「他必须先于我」就写 `inject`，别用 `soft_inject`。"},"994":{"id":"/docs/plugin-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"**依赖是准入，不是注入。** 宿主不会把那个服务的引用塞给你——你仍然自己去 `get_service`\n拿。`inject` 只保证「轮到我的时候它一定在」。"},"995":{"id":"/docs/plugin-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"排查看 `fuyubot status`：`pending` 那一栏会列出插件名**和它还缺哪些**。"},"996":{"id":"/docs/plugin-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#声明依赖inject-与-soft_inject","content":"完整实例见插件联动：内置 `/help` 用共享服务暴露命令表，\n`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 用 `soft_inject` + `call_service` 把自己的命令登记进去。"},"997":{"id":"/docs/plugin-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Rust 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rust/\" />"},"998":{"id":"/docs/plugin-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"C 与 C++ 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/native/\" />"},"999":{"id":"/docs/plugin-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Go 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/go/\" />"},"1000":{"id":"/docs/plugin-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"Python 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/python/\" />"},"1001":{"id":"/docs/plugin-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按语言看","content":"<Card title=\"JS 与 TypeScript 插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/js-ts/\" />"},"1002":{"id":"/docs/plugin-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"订阅与事件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/events/\" />"},"1003":{"id":"/docs/plugin-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调用 TDLib\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tdlib/\" />"},"1004":{"id":"/docs/plugin-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"简化封装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/simplify/\" />"},"1005":{"id":"/docs/plugin-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"外部仓库插件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/external/\" />"},"1006":{"id":"/docs/plugin-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"富消息\" href=\"/docs/plugin/rich/\" />"},"1007":{"id":"/docs/plugin-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"工具与中间件\" href=\"/docs/plugin/tools/\" />"},"1008":{"id":"/docs/plugin-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"异步等待\" href=\"/docs/plugin/async/\" />"},"1009":{"id":"/docs/plugin-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"ABI 契约\" href=\"/docs/plugin/abi/\" />"},"1010":{"id":"/docs/plugin-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#按能力看","content":"<Card title=\"调试与安装\" href=\"/docs/plugin/testing/\" />"},"1011":{"id":"/docs/plugin-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"插件名只允许字母、数字和 `.` `_` `-`（它会拼进源码和 TOML）；目录名里的 `.` / `-` 换成 `_` 当 crate 名\n（`fuyubot.weather` → `fuyubot_weather`）。"},"1012":{"id":"/docs/plugin-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**原生插件名只有 dlopen 之后才知道**：它来自 `plugin_init` 返回的 `PluginHandle`，所以\n`fuyubot plugin list` 会真的加载一次再看名字。"},"1013":{"id":"/docs/plugin-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin#插件名与目录","content":"**脚本插件的身份在 manifest 里**（Python 的 `[tool.fuyubot]` / JS 的 `\"fuyubot\"` 段），\n目录名是装卸载的单位（`fuyubot plugin install|uninstall <目录>`），见 脚本插件。"},"1014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"page","content":"JS 与 TypeScript 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts"},"1015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"1016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"1020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"1021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"1022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"1023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"1024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"`registerTool` — 登记工具"},"1025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`useMiddleware` — 挂中间件"},"1026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"1027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"JS / TS 插件就是一个目录：`package.json` 写身份，入口文件写逻辑，`fuyubot.ts`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。运行时是 bun，**TS 不需要 `tsc`**。上手三步见\n脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"1031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"本页讲托管路径的 `fuyubot.js` / `fuyubot.ts`（`fuyubot-js-host`），它也支持\n`runAsync` / `invokeAsync` / `waitAsync`。`script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.js` 有同名 API，见 异步等待。"},"1032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `index.ts`）："},"1033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 22 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"1034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                            | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| ----------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter?)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"1035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么    |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅 |","table":"table-0"},"1036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `invoke(method, params?, onResponse?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `onResponse` 就在响应回来时调（按 `request_id` 配对，不用自己记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"1037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么           |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| `invokeAsync(method, params?)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，返回 Promise |","table":"table-0"},"1038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| ----------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload?)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"1039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ------------------------------ | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level = \"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"1040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                   | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `registerTool(name, description = \"\", inputSchema?)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `callTool(name, input?, onResponse?)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `listTools(onTools?)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"1043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `tdExecute(request, onResult?)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"1044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| ------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `useMiddleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；不能单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"1045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `waitForUpdate(filter, timeoutMs?, onMatch?)` | `wait_for_update` | 等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"1046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                              | 走的 ABI            | 干什么            |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------- |\n| `waitAsync(filter, timeoutMs?)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 Promise 版 |","table":"table-0"},"1047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `getService(name, onService?)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `null` |","table":"table-0"},"1048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                             | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `callService(name, method, input?, onResult?)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"1049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"1050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法               | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ---------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `pluginConfig()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"1051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `getConfig(section, key?, onConfig?)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"1052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `setConfig(key, value, onDone?)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"1053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                                |\n| --------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `simplifyInvoke(op, onResponse?)` | `simplify_invoke` | 让宿主跑一个 simplify 操作（发消息等结局、超时撤回、Markdown→entities…）；结果经 `response` 通道回投，整条 `simplifyResult` 交 `onResponse`（不传就只发不收） |","table":"table-0"},"1054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                        | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplifyInvokeAsync(op)` | `simplify_invoke` | 上一条的 Promise 版，`resolve` 整条 `simplifyResult`（`{ok, op, result\\|error}`），自己判 `ok` |","table":"table-0"},"1055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI                   | 干什么                                                                                                                       |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplifyInvokeResult(op, onResult?)` | `simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑不碰网络的 op（`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`），回调收结果；传异步 op 拿到 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-0"},"1056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"1058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`onResponse` / `onResult` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`pluginConfig()` 这种同步的。"},"1059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`tdExecute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"1060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`waitForUpdate` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeoutMs` 省略表示只检查当前状态。"},"1061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `pluginConfig()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"1062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`getConfig`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `null`。"},"1063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`setConfig`）也是异步的，成功后 `onDone(true)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"1064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `onDone`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"1065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`setConfig` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"1066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"1067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"1068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"1069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"1070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"1071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"1072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"1073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"1074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"1075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"1076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"1077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"1078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"1081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"1082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                |\n| --------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的对象，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"1083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"1084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"1085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{ \"点分路径\": 期望值 }`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"1086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `onResponse` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"1087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"**`_` 就是 `\"@type\"`**：`params` 里嵌的 TDLib 对象都可以把判别字段写成 `_`，\n薄 SDK 会在发往宿主之前**递归**换回 `\"@type\"`——嵌套多深、数组里的对象都算。\n两种写法等价，同时写了两个时以 `\"@type\"` 为准："},"1088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"这一层只在 JS / TS 薄 SDK 里做（宿主不会替你补判别字段），而且只作用于要发给\nTDLib 的东西：`emit` 的自定义负载、`callTool` 的参数不过这一步，那里的 `_`\n就是个普通字段。"},"1089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `onResponse` 被调用。\n不传 `onResponse` 就是「发完不管」。"},"1090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"1091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"1092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#registertool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"1093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#usemiddleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"1094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"1095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"1096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"1097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#完整示例","content":"**按聊天计数**——记住状态："},"1098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ✅ **JS / TS 薄封装已经支持** `simplifyInvoke` / `simplifyInvokeAsync` /\n> `simplifyInvokeResult`（见上表）——直接调用即可，不必手写下面这些字段。"},"1099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：用 `simplifyInvokeAsync` 发消息——宿主替你把文本解析成 `formattedText`、\n等到「真发出去」那条 `Message`、超时还会先撤回："},"1100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"只想要同步拿结果（不碰网络的 op）就用 `simplifyInvokeResult`，回调里收整条 `simplifyResult`：\n`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`。传需要等 TDLib 应答的异步 op\n会拿到 `ok:false` / `code:\"async_op\"`。"},"1101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"1103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                        |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `tdExecute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"1104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"1105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"1106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"1107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"1108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                    |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `onResponse` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"1109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"1110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"1111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`bun fuyubot.ts` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"1112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 bun（机器人用 `bun install` 装依赖、`bun` 起脚本）。"},"1113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/js-ts","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/js-ts#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：JS 侧没有 schema，先判空或 `as any` 再取；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"1114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"page","content":"插件联动","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage"},"1115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"用共享服务互相调用、用软依赖排好启动顺序——以内置 /help 的命令注册为例"},"1116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"先选通道"},"1117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"`/help` 的联动结构"},"1118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"提供方：把能力做成服务"},"1119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"1. 写方法"},"1120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"2. 打包 VTable 与它引用的缓冲"},"1121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"3. `start()` 注册，`stop()` 放下"},"1122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"4. 提供方也要能单独活"},"1123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"消费方：按名字调用 + 软依赖"},"1124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"`soft_inject` 做了什么、没做什么"},"1125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"软依赖写服务名还是插件名？"},"1126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"软还是硬？"},"1127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"生命周期与所有权"},"1128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"其它语言"},"1129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"排查"},"1130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"一页检查清单"},"1131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"插件之间没有共享的 Rust 类型，也没有彼此的符号表。原生插件（cdylib）跑在同一个进程里，\n但只通过宿主的 C ABI 打交道。想「A 把自己的能力借给 B 用」，只有宿主提供的那几条通道。"},"1132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage","content":"这篇讲最常用的一条：**命名服务 + 软依赖**。例子就是内置的 `/help`——\n它把命令表暴露成一个进程级服务，`fuyubot.start` 和 `fuyubot.manage` 在启动时把自己的命令登记进去，\n而它们之间没有一行互相 import 的代码。"},"1133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事             | 通道               | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| ---------------- | ---------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 广播「发生了什么」，不关心谁在听 | 事件总线 `emit` / 订阅 | 否    | 否      |","table":"table-0"},"1134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                               | 有返回值        | 对方必须在？   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------- | -------- |\n| 调一个能力，**当场要结果** | 命名服务 `provide_service(_shared)` + `call_service` | 是（JSON 字符串） | 是（调用那一刻） |","table":"table-0"},"1135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事            | 通道                                | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------- | ---- | ------ |\n| 让宿主 / AI 能发现并调用 | 工具表 `register_tool` + `call_tool` | 是    | 是      |","table":"table-0"},"1136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"| 想做的事           | 通道                       | 有返回值 | 对方必须在？ |\n| -------------- | ------------------------ | ---- | ------ |\n| 只要求「我启动时它已经在了」 | `inject` / `soft_inject` | —    | 不负责传值  |","table":"table-0"},"1137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#先选通道","content":"服务适合「一个插件提供能力、其它插件按名字调」：命令注册表、缓存、鉴权、数据源都属于这一类。\n它不替代事件——事件是**通知**，服务是**调用**。两者可以叠：服务方法内部照样能 `emit`。"},"1138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"内置 `/help` 把命令表暴露成进程级服务 `fuyubot.help.commands`，方法有两个："},"1139":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法         | 入参                                      | 返回                                            |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `register` | `{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"开始使用\"}` | `{\"ok\":true}`；坏入参回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}` |","table":"table-1"},"1140":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 方法     | 入参  | 返回                                                          |\n| ------ | --- | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `list` | 忽略  | `[{\"name\":\"start\",\"description\":\"…\"}, …]`，即 `/help` 实际渲染的内容 |","table":"table-1"},"1141":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"服务名建议用反向域名（`fuyubot.help.commands`），方法名用动词；协议字段**只增不改**，\n破坏性改动时把 `ServiceVTable.version` 加一（宿主不校验，但调用方可以据此判断）。\n坏入参不要 panic——回一个带 `error` 的 JSON，调用方才有机会降级。"},"1142":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"三个插件各管一段："},"1143":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件             | 做什么                                                               |\n| --- | -------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 提供方 | `fuyubot.help` | `start()` 里 `provide_service_shared` 注册服务；`/help` 渲染时合并静态基线与动态注册表 |","table":"table-2"},"1144":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件              | 做什么                                                              |\n| --- | --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.start` | `soft_inject` 声明软依赖；`start()` 里 `call_service(…, \"register\", …)` |","table":"table-2"},"1145":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"| 角色  | 插件               | 做什么              |\n| --- | ---------------- | ---------------- |\n| 消费方 | `fuyubot.manage` | 同上，登记 `/plugins` |","table":"table-2"},"1146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"消费方**不链接** help 插件，也不 import 它的任何代码。它只认两个字符串——服务名和方法名——\n外加一份两边都认的 JSON 协议。"},"1147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#help-的联动结构","content":"> 实例源码在运行时仓库的 `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-help`、`plugins/fuyubot-plugin-start`、\n> `plugins/fuyubot-plugin-manage`；这篇只摘和联动有关的部分。"},"1148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#提供方把能力做成服务","content":"下面代码用 `fuyubot-abi` 的类型写（三个内置插件就是这么写的）。外部 Rust 插件把\n`fuyubot_abi` 换成 `fuyubot_plugin_api` 即可：后者把 `ServiceVTable` / `ServiceMethod` /\n`Plugin` / `define_plugin!` 原样重导出，形状完全一样。"},"1149":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"服务方法只有一个签名：收 JSON、回 JSON（或 `NULL` 表示「成功但没输出」）。"},"1150":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"方法跑在**调用方线程**上。消费方若在命令回调（接收循环线程）里调它，这里就不能做慢事——\n否则整个宿主一起卡住。要慢慢做的活，在方法里排个队、立刻返回。"},"1151":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#1-写方法","content":"⚠️ `ServiceMethodFn` 是 `extern \"C\"`，**方法里不能有 panic**：逃出这个边界的 panic 会直接\nabort 整个宿主，不是只挂你的插件。解析失败回 `{\"ok\":false,\"error\":\"…\"}`；确实可能 panic 的\n代码段自己 `catch_unwind`。"},"1152":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`ServiceVTable` 里全是裸指针：`name` 指向服务名，`methods` 指向方法数组，每个方法项又指向\n自己的名字。这些缓冲必须和 VTable **活一样久**，所以打包进同一个结构体，一起放进 `Box`："},"1153":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"这里有几个容易写错的点："},"1154":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`Vec` 的**堆缓冲**在结构体移动时不会跟着搬，所以 `Box::new` 之后 `names[i].as_ptr()` /\n`methods.as_ptr()` 仍然有效。**别在注册之后再 `push`**——重新分配会让宿主手里的指针悬空。"},"1155":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`version` 是提供方自己的协议版本，宿主**不校验**；它只用于调用方自己判断。"},"1156":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#2-打包-vtable-与它引用的缓冲","content":"`context` 会原样传给每个方法。需要实例状态就把 `self` 指针放这里；`/help` 用的是进程级\n`static` 注册表，所以留空。"},"1157":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"**跨插件共享必须用 `provide_service_shared`。** `provide_service` 写的是调用者自己的\n子作用域，兄弟插件沿父链往上看不到它；两个插件各注册一份同名私有服务也不会冲突，\n但也就谈不上联动。`_shared` 写进程级的根表，同名会和别人撞——所以它必须显眼。"},"1158":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#3-start-注册stop-放下","content":"`ServiceHandle` **不是** RAII：它没有 `Drop`，丢在一边不会注销。正常也不需要手动注销——\n插件卸载时宿主按 owner 回滚它注册的一切，共享服务也一样（写在根表也记得 owner）。\n这里的 `Option<Box<HelpService>>` 只是为了**保活 VTable**，不是为了「用句柄控制注册」。"},"1159":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"`/help` 的静态基线 `BUILTIN_COMMANDS` 始终包含 `start` / `help` / `plugins` 三个命令；\n动态注册表只是叠加，渲染时按名字去重。所以："},"1160":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"没有消费方登记命令，`/help` 仍然列得出内置三件套；"},"1161":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"消费方没起来，只是少几条动态说明，不会让 `/help` 整个失效。"},"1162":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#4-提供方也要能单独活","content":"这是可选联动的通用做法：**提供方给自己留一份能独立工作的兜底**，别把「有人来调我」\n当成自己启动的前提。"},"1163":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`fuyubot.start` 的接线只有两段：`start()` 里调服务，`soft_inject()` 里声明排队偏好。"},"1164":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"`call_service` 是普通安全函数，返回 `Result<String, AbiError>`："},"1165":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"服务不存在 / 方法不存在 / 方法指针是 `None` → `Err`；"},"1166":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回 `NULL` → `Ok(String::new())`（「成功但没输出」）；"},"1167":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"方法返回字符串 → 立刻拷成 `String`，调用方拿到的是自己的一份，可以随便留着。"},"1168":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#消费方按名字调用--软依赖","content":"⚠️ 目前错误类型不细分「服务不存在」和「没有这个方法」，都是 `AbiError::BadString`。\n所以日志里要把服务名、方法名一起打出来，否则排查时只看得到一句「失败了」。"},"1169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"宿主在 `plugin_init` **之前**读 `plugin_manifest` 里的依赖列表（`define_plugin!` 会把\n`Plugin::soft_inject()` 写进去）。同步阶段分两轮："},"1170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"先激活「硬依赖齐 **且** 软依赖也齐」的插件；"},"1171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"再激活「只有硬依赖齐」的插件。"},"1172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"所以同一批加载时，只要 help 能正常起来，它一定先于 `/start` 和 `/plugins` 激活——\n不管文件名的字典序怎样。"},"1173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"但它**不是**「提供方一定在」的保证："},"1174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 自己卡在硬依赖上（停在 `Pending`），消费方的软依赖就不算齐，第二轮照样会激活\n消费方。这时 `call_service` 会失败。"},"1175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"如果 help 的 `start()` 报错（`Failed`），软依赖同样不阻塞消费方。"},"1176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"运行期中提供方被卸载，消费方仍然处于 `Active`、不会重新跑 `start()`；之后的每次调用\n都要自己处理错误。"},"1177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#soft_inject-做了什么没做什么","content":"一句话：**软依赖管排队，不管可用性**。所以上面的 `match` 分支不是客套，是必须的。"},"1178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"`inject` / `soft_inject` 里的名字，宿主认两种："},"1179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                             | 宿主查什么                    | 什么时候用                 |\n| ------------------------------ | ------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 服务名（`\"fuyubot.help.commands\"`） | 根作用域的 `Context` 里有没有这个名字 | 推荐。换一个插件提供同名服务，排序仍然成立 |","table":"table-3"},"1180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"| 写法                    | 宿主查什么              | 什么时候用               |\n| --------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------- |\n| 插件名（`\"fuyubot.help\"`） | 有没有同名插件处于 `Active` | 只关心「那个插件」而不是「那个能力」时 |","table":"table-3"},"1181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软依赖写服务名还是插件名","content":"⚠️ 软依赖写**私有**服务名是排不上序的：兄弟插件看不到它，管理器在根作用域里也查不到。\n跨插件的能力一律走 `provide_service_shared`，依赖也写同一个服务名。"},"1182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                      | 选择                    |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------- |\n| 没有 `/help` 也要能跑，只是少一条登记 | `soft_inject` + 运行期降级 |","table":"table-4"},"1183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                     | 选择            |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- |\n| 没有数据库 / 鉴权就完全没意义，宁可别启动 | `inject`（硬依赖） |","table":"table-4"},"1184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景                 | 选择                 |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ |\n| 只要求「它先起来」，不直接调它的服务 | `soft_inject` 写插件名 |","table":"table-4"},"1185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"| 场景             | 选择                 |\n| -------------- | ------------------ |\n| 能力名稳定、可能有替代提供者 | `soft_inject` 写服务名 |","table":"table-4"},"1186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"硬依赖的语义是**准入**：缺了就不激活，停在 `Pending` 等；如果提供它的插件已经 `Failed`，\n依赖方会被级联标成 `Failed`，而不是永远假装在等。但它也不传值——到了 `start()` 里，\n你仍然要自己 `get_service` / `call_service`。"},"1187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#软还是硬","content":"依赖声明不要写进配置：manifest 是权威来源，`define_plugin!` 从 trait 自动生成。\n只有没有 `plugin_manifest` 的 v3 老插件，宿主才回退到 `[plugin.<名字>].inject` /\n`.soft_inject`（manifest 该侧非空时**覆盖**配置，不是合并）。见插件总览。"},"1188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                      |\n| ------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候注册 | `start()`。`init()` 阶段插件还没被准入，别在那时对外暴露能力 |","table":"table-5"},"1189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事         | 规则                                       |\n| --------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| 注册进宿主的是什么 | 裸指针，**不复制**。VTable 和它引用的字符串 / 方法数组必须一直活着 |","table":"table-5"},"1190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事      | 规则                                                                |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 什么时候释放 | `plugin_stop` 先跑，然后宿主 `rollback_owner` 撤销注册。`stop()` 里放下 `Box` 即可 |","table":"table-5"},"1191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事    | 规则                                                                 |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 同名冲突 | `provide_service_shared` 返回无效句柄，宿主只打一条 `warn`；调用方必须检查 `is_valid()` |","table":"table-5"},"1192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                       |\n| ----- | ------------------------ |\n| 方法返回值 | 提供方持有，宿主当场拷走；不要跨调用保存那个指针 |","table":"table-5"},"1193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事                 | 规则                         |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `get_service` 的指针 | 同样是借的。别长期缓存——提供方一旦卸载，指针就悬空 |","table":"table-5"},"1194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                   |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 方法在哪跑 | 调用方线程，同步执行。命令回调里调服务 = 在接收循环线程上跑，不能阻塞 |","table":"table-5"},"1195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#生命周期与所有权","content":"| 事     | 规则                                               |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 输入可信吗 | 共享服务任何插件都能调。方法里自己校验 JSON、限制大小、别信 `context` 之外的东西 |","table":"table-5"},"1196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言   | 提供方                                          | 消费方                                     |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| Rust | `provide_service` / `provide_service_shared` | `call_service`，或 `get_service` + 自己扫方法表 |","table":"table-6"},"1197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言      | 提供方                | 消费方                                             |\n| ------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| C / C++ | VTable 里第 9 / 20 项 | `get_service` + 按 `method_count` 扫 `methods[i]` |","table":"table-6"},"1198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言  | 提供方                       | 消费方 |\n| --- | ------------------------- | --- |\n| Go  | 同上（c-shared 不能卸载，见 ABI 页） | 同上  |","table":"table-6"},"1199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"| 语言               | 提供方            | 消费方                                  |\n| ---------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| Python / JS / TS | 薄 SDK 目前只暴露调用侧 | `call_service` / `callService`，见脚本插件 |","table":"table-6"},"1200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#其它语言","content":"C 侧的字段布局与调用示例见 插件 ABI 和\n原生插件；脚本侧的同步封装见 Python / JS / TS。"},"1201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"`/help` 里少了一条命令：先看 `start` / `manage` 的日志有没有\n`… 已向 /help 注册命令：{\"ok\":true}`；失败那条会带 `call_service` 的错误。"},"1202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"服务注册失败：宿主日志里有一行 `注册共享服务 … 失败: 命名服务 … 已经注册过了`\n（或「收到了空 vtable」）。"},"1203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"谁在跑、谁在等：`/plugins` 走宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.plugins` 服务，会列出\n`active` / `pending`（带 `missing`）/ `failed`（带 `reason`）；`fuyubot status` 读的是\n实例发布的同一份快照（摘要 + pending / failed 明细）。"},"1204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#排查","content":"依赖声明从哪来：`plugin_manifest`。激活时日志里那行\n`激活 <名字> v<版本>（硬依赖 N、软依赖 M）` 就是宿主实际读到的数量；`status` 里的\n`pending` / `missing` 也是按它算的。别只改配置——manifest 非空时配置那份会被覆盖。"},"1205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"提供方用 `provide_service_shared`，方法名和 JSON 协议写进文档。"},"1206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"VTable、方法数组、名字缓冲装在同一个 `Box` 里，注册后不再扩容。"},"1207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"检查 `ServiceHandle::is_valid()`；`stop()` 里放下持有物，不手动 free 宿主的东西。"},"1208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"消费方对 `call_service` 的失败有降级分支，不 `unwrap`。"},"1209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"可选联动用 `soft_inject`，并接受「提供方可能不在」；缺了就活不了才用 `inject`。"},"1210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/linkage-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/linkage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/linkage#一页检查清单","content":"方法里不做慢活、不阻塞调用方线程；也不让 panic 逃出 `extern \"C\"` 边界。"},"1211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"page","content":"插件迁移","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration"},"1212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"旧形态 dll / 脚本目录迁移到 bundle 的步骤与排错"},"1213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"1. 一页对照"},"1214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#2-用户迁移","content":"2. 用户迁移"},"1215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#21-动手前停机--备份","content":"2.1 动手前：停机 + 备份"},"1216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"2.2 看计划：`--dry-run`"},"1217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#23-执行","content":"2.3 执行"},"1218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#24-复核--重启","content":"2.4 复核 + 重启"},"1219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"2.5 失败怎么办"},"1220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#26-回滚","content":"2.6 回滚"},"1221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"2.7 手工迁移（命令不可用时）"},"1222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#3-作者迁移给插件补-pluginjson","content":"3. 作者迁移：给插件补 `plugin.json`"},"1223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"3.1 通用规则（五种语言都适用）"},"1224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#32-rust","content":"3.2 Rust"},"1225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"3.3 Go"},"1226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#34-c--c","content":"3.4 C / C++"},"1227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"3.5 Python / JavaScript"},"1228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"3.6 打 zip（发布用）"},"1229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"4. 兼容期行为"},"1230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"5. 常见错误排查"},"1231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"6. FAQ"},"1232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"7. P0 / P1 边界"},"1233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/migration#相关文档","content":"相关文档"},"1234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration","content":"> 读者：**用插件的人**（第 2、4、5、6 节）与**写插件的人**（第 3 节）。\n> 状态：分发 P0 的格式契约已冻结（插件分发格式 v1），\n> 代码在并行落地。**命令以 `fuyubot plugin --help` 的实际输出为准**——\n> 如果你敲 `fuyubot plugin migrate` 得到「未知子命令」，说明手上的版本还没带上它，\n> 按 §2.7 手工做，效果一样。\n>\n> 装**新**插件有两条路，迁移只处理「已经躺在 `plugins/` 里的旧形态」：\n>\n> 1. **TUI 商店**（`fuyubot run --tui` → 商店页）：搜索、看详情、下载、sha256 校验、解压、安装一条龙（分发 P0）；\n> 2. **手动**：从作者 release 或商城下载 zip → 解压到 `plugins/<id>/` → 重启。"},"1235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|      | 旧形态                       | 新形态（bundle）                                                          |\n| ---- | ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 原生插件 | `plugins/weather.dll`（平铺） | `plugins/com.example.weather/``├── plugin.json``└── bin/weather.dll` |","table":"table-0"},"1236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|      | 旧形态                            | 新形态（bundle）                                           |\n| ---- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件 | `plugins/scripts/weather-bot/` | **分发 P0 不变**；可加一个可选的 `plugin.json` 供 `plugin list` 展示 |","table":"table-0"},"1237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|       | 旧形态                       | 新形态（bundle）                |\n| ----- | ------------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 身份从哪来 | `dlopen` 后问 `plugin_init` | `plugin.json` 的 `id`（静态可读） |","table":"table-0"},"1238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|             | 旧形态                      | 新形态（bundle）           |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | --------------------- |\n| 探测会不会执行插件代码 | **会**（必须 `dlopen` 才知道是谁） | **不会**（读 JSON + 文件魔数） |","table":"table-0"},"1239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|      | 旧形态                                          | 新形态（bundle）                                                    |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 依赖声明 | `plugin_manifest` 导出，或 `[plugin.<名>].inject` | `plugin.json` 的 `depends` / `optional_depends`（合成进内核 `inject`） |","table":"table-0"},"1240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|     | 旧形态                                      | 新形态（bundle）                                     |\n| --- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 禁用  | 改名 `weather.dll` → `weather.dll.disable` | 整个目录挪进 `plugins/.disabled/com.example.weather/` |","table":"table-0"},"1241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|     | 旧形态            | 新形态（bundle） |\n| --- | -------------- | ----------- |\n| 卸载  | 删 dll + 同名同伴脚本 | 删整个目录       |","table":"table-0"},"1242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|       | 旧形态                    | 新形态（bundle）                                        |\n| ----- | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| Go 插件 | 能加载，但**永不卸载**、且探测即永久映射 | **必须有 `plugin.json`**，否则直接拒绝（`GoRequiresManifest`） |","table":"table-0"},"1243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|       | 旧形态                | 新形态（bundle）                                                           |\n| ----- | ------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 装一个插件 | 拷 dll 进 `plugins/` | TUI 商店一键装；或下载 zip 解压到 `plugins/<id>/`；或 `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` |","table":"table-0"},"1244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|          | 旧形态 | 新形态（bundle）                                |\n| -------- | --- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| zip 谁来解压 | —   | TUI 商店（内置下载 + 校验 + 解压）；CLI 子命令**永远不吃 zip** |","table":"table-0"},"1245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"|     | 旧形态               | 新形态（bundle）                      |\n| --- | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 多平台 | 一个 dll 一个平台，靠文件名猜 | `plugin.json` 的 `platforms` 显式声明 |","table":"table-0"},"1246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#1-一页对照","content":"一句话：**从「一堆文件」变成「一个带身份证的目录」**。宿主不执行代码就能知道它是谁、要什么、能不能在这台机器上跑。"},"1247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#21-动手前停机--备份","content":"**一定要停**。宿主机在跑的时候，`migrate` 移动 dll 会失败（`拒绝访问` / sharing violation），\n而且失败信息看起来像「权限问题」，很容易误判。"},"1248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#21-动手前停机--备份","content":"备份整个 `plugins/` 是最省事的回滚手段（§2.6）。"},"1249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#21-动手前停机--备份","content":"顺手记一下现在能用的插件：`fuyubot plugin list`。"},"1250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"它**只打印计划、不动文件**。示例（`[dry-run]` 前缀是实际格式）："},"1251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"看三件事："},"1252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"**id 对不对**（迁移后的目录名、`[plugin.<id>]` 配置段名都跟着它走）；"},"1253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"**同伴文件有没有带上**（`.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi`）；"},"1254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#22-看计划--dry-run","content":"**有没有「跳过」**，以及原因。"},"1255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#23-执行","content":"逐项进行，**一个失败不影响其它**；每项打印一行「已迁移 / 跳过 / 失败」。"},"1256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#23-执行","content":"它对每个平铺 dll 做的事："},"1257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#23-执行","content":"对 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`：只**补一个 `plugin.json`**（从 `package.json` / `pyproject.toml`\n合成 `id` / `name` / `version` / `kind` / `entry`），**不移动目录**。"},"1258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#23-执行","content":"对 Go 插件：允许迁移，但会打一条说明——它一旦被映射就永久留在进程里，迁移只是把「元数据」补上。"},"1259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#24-复核--重启","content":"启动日志里每个插件应该有一条加载记录；`跳过插件 <路径>：<原因>` 是要处理的。"},"1260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#24-复核--重启","content":"以后装**新**插件就不用再碰文件了：`fuyubot run --tui` → 商店页，搜索 → 详情 → 安装。\n迁移只是把**已有的**旧形态整理成 bundle，两者互不影响。"},"1261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象                         | 原因            | 处理                 |\n| -------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ |\n| `拒绝访问` / sharing violation | 宿主还在跑，dll 被映射 | `fuyubot stop` 后重跑 |","table":"table-1"},"1262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象         | 原因                                  | 处理                                                                             |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `id 非法` 跳过 | `plugin_init` 的名字含 `/`、空格、或以 `.` 开头 | `id` 来自 `plugin_init`，改名得作者改代码——**不能靠改目录名绕过**（改了会变成「名字对不上」直接拒绝加载）。这类插件只能继续用旧形态 |","table":"table-1"},"1263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象         | 原因                                  | 处理                          |\n| ---------- | ----------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| `目标已存在` 跳过 | `plugins/<id>/` 已经有东西（迁移过一次 / 手工建过） | 不合并是故意的。确认旧的那份没用后，删掉目标目录再重跑 |","table":"table-1"},"1264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象                      | 原因                                   | 处理                        |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| 迁移成功但启动报 `EntryMissing` | 产物名与 `entry` 不一致（Linux 上忘了 `lib` 前缀） | 改 `plugin.json` 的 `entry` |","table":"table-1"},"1265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象          | 原因                                | 处理                      |\n| ----------- | --------------------------------- | ----------------------- |\n| 迁移成功但命令回了两次 | 平铺 dll 没删干净，legacy + bundle 各加载一次 | 删掉 `plugins/` 下那个平铺 dll |","table":"table-1"},"1266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"| 现象                     | 原因                                  | 处理                             |\n| ---------------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `plugin.json` 写出来但依赖丢了 | 老插件没有 `plugin_manifest`（ABI v3 及以前） | 手工把 `depends` 补进 `plugin.json` |","table":"table-1"},"1267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#25-失败怎么办","content":"失败项**保留原样**（平铺 dll 不动），所以「迁移了一半」也能照常启动——只是那部分还是旧形态。"},"1268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#26-回滚","content":"迁移是「移动」，所以回滚就是反着移："},"1269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#26-回滚","content":"注意：**先停宿主**再动，理由同 §2.1。"},"1270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"和 `migrate` 做的一样，只是手动："},"1271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"停宿主；"},"1272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"建 `plugins\\<id>\\bin\\`，把 dll（和同伴 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi`）移进去；"},"1273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"在 `plugins\\<id>\\plugin.json` 写："},"1274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"**删掉平铺的那份 dll**（不删会被加载两次）；"},"1275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"`fuyubot plugin list` 复核 → `fuyubot run`。"},"1276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#27-手工迁移命令不可用时","content":"`<id>` 用插件自报的名字（就是 `[plugin.<名>]` 那个名字），不要用文件名。"},"1277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段   | 怎么填                                                                                                             |\n| ---- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id` | 插件在宿主里的名字（`define_plugin!` / `plugin_init` 报的那个），**不是**文件名、**不是** crate 名；**必须与 `plugin_init` 报的名字完全一致**，否则拒绝加载 |","table":"table-2"},"1278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段      | 怎么填                                          |\n| ------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `entry` | 相对包根的**真实文件**路径，必须在 `bin/` 下；大小写、`lib` 前缀都要对 |","table":"table-2"},"1279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段    | 怎么填                                               |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `abi` | `5`（当前 ABI）；它只是预检，真值以 `plugin_init` 返回的 handle 为准 |","table":"table-2"},"1280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段        | 怎么填                                                       |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `depends` | **服务名**（内核 `inject` 用的名字，如 `fuyubot.help.commands`），不是插件名 |","table":"table-2"},"1281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段                 | 怎么填               |\n| ------------------ | ----------------- |\n| `optional_depends` | 软依赖：缺了也能起，有了优先排前面 |","table":"table-2"},"1282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段         | 怎么填                                        |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `provides` | 你 `provide_service` 出来的服务名（目前只用于列举 / 商城展示） |","table":"table-2"},"1283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段          | 怎么填                                  |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `platforms` | 你实际编了哪些平台就写哪些；空 = 全平台（**多平台产物不要写空**） |","table":"table-2"},"1284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#31-通用规则五种语言都适用","content":"| 字段       | 怎么填                                          |\n| -------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `config` | 有默认配置就写 `config.default.toml`（分发 P0 只解析，不合并） |","table":"table-2"},"1285":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#32-rust","content":"Windows 产物：`fuyubot_plugin_weather.dll`；Linux / macOS：`libfuyubot_plugin_weather.so` / `.dylib`\n——**`entry` 要写平台对应的名字**，所以「一个 `plugin.json` 通吃全平台」只在产物同名时成立，\n否则一个平台一个包（§3.6）。"},"1286":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#32-rust","content":"`version` 与 `Cargo.toml` 的 `version` 保持一致：`plugin_manifest` 报的是 `CARGO_PKG_VERSION`。\n对不上时不会拒绝加载，但 `plugin list` / 商店按 `plugin.json` 展示，日志里那份会显得对不上。"},"1287":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#32-rust","content":"依赖本来就写在 `define_plugin!` 的 `inject` 里？可以继续留着。bundle 里以 `plugin.json` 的\n`depends` 为准（宿主把它合成进内核 `inject`，**覆盖** `[plugin.<名>].inject`，逐侧判定，约束 53）。\n两份写一样最省心。"},"1288":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"**Go 是唯一「没有 `plugin.json` 就完全不能加载」的语言**，原因是硬的："},"1289":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"c-shared 的 Go runtime 起自己的线程，**不能 `dlclose`**，所以宿主识别出 Go 就故意不卸载（`AGENTS.md` 约束 50）；"},"1290":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"于是「先 `dlopen` 看看它是谁」对 Go 是**不可逆**的：一次探测 = 永久映射；"},"1291":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"所以顺序只能是「先有静态元数据，才允许加载」。"},"1292":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"宿主给的错误会直接说明："},"1293":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"另外两条要记住："},"1294":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"**更新 Go 插件 = 重启进程**。同一进程里重复加载不可靠，别承诺热更新；"},"1295":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#33-go","content":"`platforms` 一定要写：Go 产物是平台相关的，写空会被当成「全平台」，然后在别的平台上装上去起不来。"},"1296":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#34-c--c","content":"四个导出符号（`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_manifest`），\n外加可选的 `plugin_free_string` / `plugin_free_handle`。`plugin.json` 与 Rust 完全一样："},"1297":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#34-c--c","content":"头文件是**产物**，权威副本是 `fuyubot_abi::PLUGIN_HEADER`；用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen --lang c --dir <工程>` 落盘，\n别从别的插件抄一份旧的。"},"1298":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#34-c--c","content":"手编时容易漏掉 `plugin_manifest`：没有它不影响加载，但依赖声明就只能靠 `[plugin.<名>].inject`，\n换台机器忘了抄就是**静默的加载顺序错误**。"},"1299":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#34-c--c","content":"兄弟库（`bin/` 里其它 dll）可以带，但宿主只 `dlopen` `entry` 那一个；\n兄弟库靠「库自己所在目录优先」的查找规则找到（`AGENTS.md` 约束 30），所以它们必须和 `entry` 同目录。"},"1300":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"分发 P0 **不动**脚本插件的家：仍然是 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`。\n`plugin.json` 是**可选**的，只用于 `plugin list` 静态展示——真正的发现与启停归 SDK 的两个中间插件，\n它们看的是 `pyproject.toml` 的 `[tool.fuyubot]` / `package.json` 的 `fuyubot` 段。"},"1301":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"Python（`plugins/scripts/weather-bot/plugin.json`）："},"1302":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"JavaScript / TypeScript："},"1303":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"`entry` 写**脚本**，不是 dll；`kind` 写 `python` / `js` 而不是 `native`。"},"1304":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"不写 `plugin.json` 也能跑（`plugin list` 会退回 `package.json` / `pyproject.toml` 去列）。"},"1305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#35-python--javascript","content":"目录里的 `node_modules/` / `.venv/` **不要**打进任何发布包：安装期由中间插件 `bun install` / `uv sync` 现装。"},"1306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"> zip 是**发布契约**（插件商店与分发）。\n> 消费它的是 **TUI 商店**（本仓，`panel/store.rs`）和外部商城 / 第三方安装器；\n> **加载器不读 zip**，只读解压后的目录。"},"1307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"规则三条："},"1308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"**根 = 插件目录内容**，不套一层（`plugin.json` 必须在 zip 根）；"},"1309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"不带 `node_modules/` / `.venv/` / `target/` / `__pycache__/` / `.git/` / `dist/`；"},"1310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"命名 `<id>-<version>-<os>-<arch>.zip`（脚本插件用 `-any.zip`）。"},"1311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"发 release 时再附一份 `SHA256SUMS`（GNU `sha256sum` 格式）："},"1312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"检查清单："},"1313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"[ ] `plugin.json` 在 zip 根，`id` / `version` 与 release tag 一致"},"1314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"[ ] `entry` 指向的文件真的在 `bin/` 里，名字带不带 `lib` 前缀与平台一致"},"1315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"[ ] `platforms` 与资产名里的 `<os>-<arch>` 一致"},"1316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"没有 `node_modules` / `.venv` / `target` / 符号链接"},"1317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#36-打-zip发布用","content":"附了 `SHA256SUMS`"},"1318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                   | 现在会怎样                   | 什么时候不能用了    |\n| -------------------- | ----------------------- | ----------- |\n| 平铺 `plugins/foo.dll` | ✅ 继续加载（探测仍 `dlopen` 一次） | 兼容期结束（未定日期） |","table":"table-3"},"1319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                   | 现在会怎样       | 什么时候不能用了 |\n| -------------------- | ----------- | -------- |\n| 平铺 `foo.dll.disable` | ✅ 继续视为「已禁用」 | 同上       |","table":"table-3"},"1320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                         | 现在会怎样                                                  | 什么时候不能用了           |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------ |\n| Go 平铺 dll（无 `plugin.json`） | ❌ **直接拒绝**，错误 `GoRequiresManifest`，指路 `plugin migrate` | 永远（这是安全要求，不是兼容期问题） |","table":"table-3"},"1321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                      | 现在会怎样         | 什么时候不能用了      |\n| ----------------------- | ------------- | ------------- |\n| `plugins/scripts/<目录>/` | ✅ 不变，中间插件照常发现 | 脚本插件不在本次迁移范围内 |","table":"table-3"},"1322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                      | 现在会怎样 | 什么时候不能用了 |\n| ----------------------- | ----- | -------- |\n| `plugins/<id>/`（bundle） | ✅ 新形态 | —        |","table":"table-3"},"1323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                        | 现在会怎样       | 什么时候不能用了 |\n| ------------------------- | ----------- | -------- |\n| `plugins/.disabled/<id>/` | ✅ 视为已禁用，不加载 | —        |","table":"table-3"},"1324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态         | 现在会怎样                    | 什么时候不能用了                      |\n| ---------- | ------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| 目录名 ≠ `id` | ⚠️ 告警，**按 `id` 加载**（不拒绝） | 建议改对，否则 `uninstall <名字>` 会找不到 |","table":"table-3"},"1325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"| 形态                        | 现在会怎样                         | 什么时候不能用了          |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_init` 报的名字 ≠ `id` | ❌ **拒绝加载**（`AGENTS.md` 约束 59） | 清单写错了或包装错了，必须改到一致 |","table":"table-3"},"1326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"两条容易踩的："},"1327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"**平铺 dll 与 bundle 同时存在 = 同一个插件加载两次**。迁移是「移动」，正常不会两份；\n手工迁移时忘了删平铺那份，症状是「命令回了两次」「服务注册冲突」。"},"1328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#4-兼容期行为","content":"**禁用语义变了但并存**：平铺是改名（`.disable`），bundle 是挪目录（`.disabled/`）。\n别把 bundle 目录改名成 `foo.disabled`——那不是禁用，是变成一个「没有 `plugin.json` 的普通目录」，会被跳过且不解释。"},"1329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象       | 含义                               | 怎么改                                                    |\n| ------------- | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `BadId`：id 非法 | 含 `/`、`\\`、空格，或以 `.` 开头，或超 128 字符 | 用 `[A-Za-z0-9._-]`，以字母数字开头；`plugin_init` 里那个名字也要改（作者侧） |","table":"table-4"},"1330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象             | 含义                 | 怎么改                   |\n| ------------------- | ------------------ | --------------------- |\n| `BadEntry`：entry 非法 | 绝对路径、含 `..`、以反斜杠开头 | 写成相对包根的 `bin/xxx.dll` |","table":"table-4"},"1331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象                  | 含义                                     | 怎么改                                  |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `EntryMissing`：entry 不存在 | 路径写错，或 Linux 上产物带 `lib` 前缀而 `entry` 没写 | `ls plugins/<id>/bin/` 看真名，改 `entry` |","table":"table-4"},"1332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象                   | 含义                | 怎么改                  |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------- |\n| `EntryEscapes`：entry 跑出包外 | `..` 或符号链接把路径指到包外 | 别用符号链接；`entry` 必须在包内 |","table":"table-4"},"1333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象               | 含义               | 怎么改                                                                                  |\n| --------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `UnsupportedPlatform` | `platforms` 不含本机 | 常见是写成 `windows-x64` / `win-x86_64`；必须是 `windows-x86_64` 这种 `<os>-<arch>`（与资产名同一套字面量） |","table":"table-4"},"1334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象             | 含义            | 怎么改              |\n| ------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| `UnsupportedSchema` | `schema` 大于 1 | 改成 `1`；更大的版本要新宿主 |","table":"table-4"},"1335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象       | 含义                                          | 怎么改                                       |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `AbiMismatch` | `plugin_init` 返回的 ABI ≠ 宿主 ABI（现在是**精确相等**） | 用对应版本的工具链重编；`plugin.json` 的 `abi` 写对也不能绕过 |","table":"table-4"},"1336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象        | 含义                            | 怎么改                                             |\n| -------------- | ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| 目录名 ≠ `id` 的告警 | 目录名与 `plugin.json` 的 `id` 不一致 | 以 `id` 为准加载；把目录改成 `id`，否则 `uninstall` 要用 `id` 找 |","table":"table-4"},"1337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象                 | 含义                | 怎么改                               |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_init` 名字 ≠ `id` | 运行时报的名字与清单 id 不一致 | **拒绝加载**，不是告警：清单写错了或包装错了，改到一致（§4） |","table":"table-4"},"1338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象              | 含义                    | 怎么改                                 |\n| -------------------- | --------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `GoRequiresManifest` | Go 插件没有 `plugin.json` | 补 `plugin.json`（§3.3）；这是唯一不能靠兼容期绕过的 |","table":"table-4"},"1339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象           | 含义          | 怎么改                    |\n| ----------------- | ----------- | ---------------------- |\n| TUI 商店：sha256 不匹配 | 下载到的字节与索引不符 | 拒绝安装；换网络 / 换镜像重试，别手工绕过 |","table":"table-4"},"1340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象                 | 含义            | 怎么改                               |\n| ----------------------- | ------------- | --------------------------------- |\n| TUI 商店：替换原生 dll 报「拒绝访问」 | 实例在跑、dll 正被映射 | `fuyubot stop` 后重试；装新插件、卸脚本插件不受影响 |","table":"table-4"},"1341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象      | 含义        | 怎么改                   |\n| ------------ | --------- | --------------------- |\n| TUI 商店：索引拉不到 | 网络 / 商城挂了 | 显示缓存索引并标「离线」；已装插件照常可用 |","table":"table-4"},"1342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象          | 含义          | 怎么改                            |\n| ---------------- | ----------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `跳过插件 <路径>：<原因>` | 探测失败，只跳过这一个 | 看原因；`--log-level debug` 拿更细的日志 |","table":"table-4"},"1343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象   | 含义                             | 怎么改                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | -------------------------------------- |\n| 插件加载了但没反应 | 依赖没满足（`inject` 的服务没人提供），内核没激活它 | `fuyubot plugin list` 看依赖；确认提供方也在、且名字对 |","table":"table-4"},"1344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"| 报错 / 现象     | 含义                            | 怎么改                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ----------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 插件加载了但配置读不到 | `[plugin.<名>]` 的段名与插件自报的名字不一致 | 段名 = `plugin_init` 的名字，点分就嵌套（`fuyubot.manage` → `[plugin.fuyubot.manage]`） |","table":"table-4"},"1345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"定位手法："},"1346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#5-常见错误排查","content":"`--replay` 那条特别有用：不需要账号、不连 Telegram，把一批更新灌进管线就能看插件有没有反应。"},"1347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：能热更新吗？**\nA：**原生插件不行**（分发 P0）。两个原因叠在一起：Windows 上已映射的 dll 删不掉/改不了名，\n宿主也没有运行时重新加载的入口（插件只在启动时扫一次）。装完**重启生效**。\n脚本插件是例外——中间插件的 watch 会热加载，但那是 SDK 侧行为，与 bundle 无关。\nGo 插件更严格：同一进程里不能「卸载再加载」，更新只能重启。"},"1348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：迁移会不会丢配置？**\nA：不会。迁移只移动 dll / 目录，`fuyubot.toml` 一个字都不改。配置在 `[plugin.<id>]` 下，\n段名跟着插件自报的名字走——**如果迁移后插件名没变（正常都不会变），配置照常读到**。\n唯一要注意的是：你手工把 `id` 改成了别的名字，那配置段也要跟着改。"},"1349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：卸载会不会删我的数据？**\nA：不会。`plugin uninstall` 只删插件目录（`plugins/<id>/` 或 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`），\n不删 `fuyubot.toml` 里的配置段，也不删插件自己写的数据。\n反过来说，**它也不会帮你清理**——想彻底清干净得自己删配置段和插件的数据目录。"},"1350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：zip 安装什么时候有？**\nA：**已经有了，在 TUI 商店里**（`fuyubot run --tui` → 商店页）：搜索、详情、下载、sha256 校验、解压、安装一条龙。\nCLI 的 `fuyubot plugin install` **永远不吃 zip**，它只接受已经解压好的目录——这是刻意的分工：\n网络与解压只在商店层，加载器不知道有 zip 这回事。\n不想用商店也可以手动：**下载 zip → 解压到 `plugins/<id>/`（解压工具不限）→ 重启**。"},"1351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：商店会不会偷偷装东西 / 自动更新？**\nA：不会。商店只在你点「安装」时才下载，**不自动更新**（只提示有新版本）；\n每个包都校验 sha256，未签名的包会显式标注；只有**替换正在被加载的原生 dll** 时才需要先停实例\n（装新插件、卸脚本插件随时可以做，重启后生效）。\n它只写 `plugins/<id>/`（以及 `.staging` / `.trash` / `.cache` 三个临时目录），别的地方不碰。"},"1352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：目录名必须等于 id 吗？**\nA：必须（契约要求）。不一致时宿主会告警并**按 `id` 加载**，不会拒绝——但\n`plugin uninstall <名字>` 是按目录名/id 顺序找的，目录名不对会让卸载变麻烦。\n一句话：改对，别依赖告警。"},"1353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：能不能同时留新旧两份？**\nA：不能。平铺 dll 与 bundle 同时存在 = 同一个插件被加载两次，\n症状是命令回两次、服务注册冲突、日志重复。迁移是「移动」，正常情况下不会出现；\n手工迁移时记得删平铺那份。"},"1354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：脚本插件也要迁到 `plugins/<id>/` 吗？**\nA：分发 P0 不需要，也不会自动迁。脚本插件的家仍是 `plugins/scripts/<目录>/`，\n只是可以加一个可选的 `plugin.json` 让 `plugin list` 展示得更清楚。\n目录统一是以后的事（插件商店与分发）。"},"1355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#6-faq","content":"**Q：我在 APK / 别的宿主里也用这套格式吗？**\nA：可以。bundle 格式是**给任何安装器消费的契约**，与宿主是不是本仓无关；\n那些宿主自己的商店怎么做，本仓不管，只要求它们产出的目录符合\n目录布局 与 `plugin.json`。"},"1356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                                            | 阶段     | 在哪                 |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------ | ------------------ |\n| `plugins/<id>/` + `plugin.json` + `bin/` 目录格式 | **P0** | 本仓（已落地，2026-11-03） |","table":"table-5"},"1357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                                             | 阶段     | 在哪  |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | ------ | --- |\n| 静态 `probe`（不 `dlopen`）、Go 无 sidecar 拒绝、Go 最后加载 | **P0** | 本仓  |","table":"table-5"},"1358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                                                       | 阶段     | 在哪  |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------ | --- |\n| `plugin list` / `install <目录>` / `uninstall` / `migrate` | **P0** | 本仓  |","table":"table-5"},"1359":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力        | 阶段     | 在哪      |\n| --------- | ------ | ------- |\n| 平铺 dll 兼容 | **P0** | 本仓（兼容期） |","table":"table-5"},"1360":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                                        | 阶段     | 在哪                                         |\n| ----------------------------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| **TUI 商店**：拉索引、搜索、详情、下载、sha256、解压、安装 / 卸载 | **P0** | 本仓 `crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs` |","table":"table-5"},"1361":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                   | 阶段     | 在哪              |\n| -------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| 插件索引托管 / 商城站点 / 收录审核 | **P1** | **不在本仓**（独立商城仓） |","table":"table-5"},"1362":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                 | 阶段         | 在哪       |\n| ------------------ | ---------- | -------- |\n| 锁文件 `plugins.lock` | **P1（可选）** | **不在本仓** |","table":"table-5"},"1363":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                              | 阶段         | 在哪       |\n| ------------------------------- | ---------- | -------- |\n| 签名（`SHA256SUMS.minisig` / 索引签名） | **P1（可选）** | **不在本仓** |","table":"table-5"},"1364":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"| 能力                           | 阶段      | 在哪                             |\n| ---------------------------- | ------- | ------------------------------ |\n| CLI 的 `plugin install <zip>` | **不存在** | 本仓不提供：zip 只在 TUI 商店（或用户手动解压）消费 |","table":"table-5"},"1365":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#7-p0--p1-边界","content":"**记住这一条就不会错**：**加载器只吃目录，从不吃 zip**；zip 的唯一入口是 TUI 商店（或手动解压）。"},"1366":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#相关文档","content":"插件分发格式 v1：分发 P0 的权威契约（`plugin.json` 字段与校验规则）"},"1367":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#相关文档","content":"插件商店与分发：目录布局、加载语义、发布与打包规范、商城契约"},"1368":{"id":"/docs/plugin/migration-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/migration","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/migration#相关文档","content":"`docs/design-script-plugin-v2.md`：脚本插件为什么还是「一脚本一进程」"},"1369":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"page","content":"C 与 C++ 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native"},"1370":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"同一份头文件、extern \"C\"、用你自己的工具链编译"},"1371":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"七个符号"},"1372":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"C"},"1373":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"C++"},"1374":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"常用 ABI 怎么调（C / C++ 同一套）"},"1375":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编译（你自己的工具链）"},"1376":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1377":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1378":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"注意"},"1379":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C 与 C++ 用**同一份头文件** `fuyubot_plugin.h`，差别只有两条：导出符号要不要放进 `extern \"C\"`，\n以及用什么拼 JSON。头文件是**产物**，不是源码——它由 cbindgen 从 Rust 定义生成，\n用 `fuyubot-sdk codegen` 落盘，别手改（改了下次就被覆盖）。"},"1380":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native","content":"C / C++ / Go 没有 async 运行时：请求与更新用回调（`on`），工具结果用\n`call_tool_result` 同步拿。可 await 的版本只在 Rust / JS / TS / Python 的脚本 SDK 里，\n见 异步等待。"},"1381":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"v3 是四件套，v4 又加了三个（都可以不写，但写了才有对应能力）。"},"1382":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗    | 说明                                                           |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin_init` | **必须** | 比 `host->version != ABI_VERSION`，存下 VTable，返回 `PluginHandle` |","table":"table-0"},"1383":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号             | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| -------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_start` | 可选  | 订阅/注册；返回 `0` 表示成功 |","table":"table-0"},"1384":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号            | 必须吗 | 说明                |\n| ------------- | --- | ----------------- |\n| `plugin_stop` | 可选  | 清状态；只登记元数据的插件可以不写 |","table":"table-0"},"1385":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗    | 说明                                                |\n| -------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_string` | **必须** | 释放本插件 `malloc` 出来的字符串（`plugin_manifest` 返回的那块也走它） |","table":"table-0"},"1386":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                | 必须吗   | 说明                                                            |\n| ----------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_manifest` | v4 可选 | 返回自描述 JSON（名字 / 版本 / `inject` / `soft_inject`），宿主在 `init` 之前读 |","table":"table-0"},"1387":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                    | 必须吗   | 说明                                            |\n| --------------------- | ----- | --------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot_abi_version` | v4 可选 | 静态返回 `ABI_VERSION`，`fuyubot-sdk check` 用它判断版本 |","table":"table-0"},"1388":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"| 符号                   | 必须吗   | 说明                                                 |\n| -------------------- | ----- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_free_handle` | v4 可选 | ABI 版本不匹配时宿主靠它回收 `init` 分配的状态（那时不能调 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-0"},"1389":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#七个符号","content":"`PluginHandle` 的判据是「`abi_version != 0` **且** `context` 非空」，所以 `context` 不能给 `NULL`。\n版本不对就返回全零句柄，宿主会把它当成拒绝加载。"},"1390":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c","content":"`ABI_VERSION` 与 `FUYUBOT_EXPORT` 都来自头文件，不要自己写死。"},"1391":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"同 C，**唯一的硬差别**是七个导出符号必须在 `extern \"C\"` 里——C++ 会改函数名（mangling），\n宿主按 ABI 定死的名字 `dlsym`，改了就找不到。"},"1392":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#c-1","content":"`C-unwind` 对 C/C++ 而言与普通 C 调用**ABI 一致**，但 C++ 的异常照样能穿过这个边界——\n逃到宿主那边的异常是未定义行为。**在回调内部把异常处理完再返回**。"},"1393":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"每个函数第一个参数都是 `g_host->host_ctx`。下面把常用的走了一遍："},"1394":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"⚠️ 三条所有权规则（跨界最容易出事的地方）："},"1395":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`td_execute` / `get_config` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` / `list_plugins` 返回的\n`const char *` 是**宿主线程局部缓冲**，下一次宿主调用之前有效——要留就当场 `strdup`，\n**不要 free 它**。"},"1396":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"反过来，只有 `plugin_manifest` 返回的那块是**你自己 malloc 的**，宿主读完用\n`plugin_free_string` 还给你（所以必须真能 free，别返回静态字符串）。"},"1397":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#常用-abi-怎么调c--c-同一套","content":"`on` 的 `filter_json` 里 `event_type` 键只用来**选通道**，不参与负载匹配。"},"1398":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"`/utf-8` 省掉的后果很难看：中文注释被按系统代码页拆坏，编译器报的是「注释提前结束、后面全是语法错误」。"},"1399":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#编译你自己的工具链","content":"编完装进插件目录："},"1400":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（见配置文件）。\nC 侧直接调 VTable 上那两个函数："},"1401":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#读--写配置","content":"两点与其它函数一致：**返回值是宿主线程局部缓冲**（读完即弃，别 free）；`set_config`\n**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，所以插件无法伪造写别人的段。"},"1402":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> C / C++ **不需要** SDK 薄封装——直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` /\n> `simplify_invoke_result`（见下），或者照下面手写 `sendMessage`。"},"1403":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：直接调 VTable 上的 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你解析文本、等到真发出去、\n超时先撤回；结果经已有的 `\"response\"` 事件回投（带 `request_id`，与你收 TDLib 响应是同一个 `on` 通道）："},"1404":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"`on_update` 里按 `request_id == rid` 配对，就能从那条 `response` 事件里取出 `simplifyResult` JSON\n（和 `td_invoke_simplified` 的响应是同一个 `on` 通道，逻辑完全复用）。"},"1405":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1406":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                    |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，`text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-1"},"1407":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                              |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2），把返回的 `formattedText` 原样塞进去 |","table":"table-1"},"1408":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1409":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                            |\n| ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}` |","table":"table-1"},"1410":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；callback 的 `data` 是 **base64** |","table":"table-1"},"1411":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                 |\n| --------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"1412":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                      |\n| -------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | 请求号只到**临时消息**；要最终 `Message` 得再等 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-1"},"1413":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"要 Markdown 就分两步：先 `td_execute` 拿 `parseTextEntities` 的结果（一个 `formattedText`），\n把它的 `text` 与 `entities` 拼进上面的 `input_message_content`。方法名拿不准时用\n`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage` 查真签名。"},"1414":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"模板里的 JSON 取值是**朴素查找**（`strstr`），不处理转义、不处理同名嵌套键；认真写就引一个 JSON 库。"},"1415":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"宿主返回的字符串是**线程局部缓冲**，只在下一次宿主调用之前有效——当场拷走，并且**不要试图释放它**。"},"1416":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`，手写注释会丢（见上面「读 / 写配置」）。"},"1417":{"id":"/docs/plugin/native-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/native","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/native#注意","content":"想少拼 JSON，可以只发 `td_invoke_simplified` 需要的参数对象（`@type` 由宿主补），见 调用 TDLib。"},"1418":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"page","content":"Python 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python"},"1419":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"薄 SDK 全部方法的用法、事件怎么触发、可抄的例子"},"1420":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"方法一览"},"1421":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1422":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1423":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么触发"},"1424":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"`on` — 订阅事件"},"1425":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` — 调 TDLib 接口"},"1426":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"`emit` — 发自定义事件"},"1427":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`log` — 打日志"},"1428":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"`register_tool` — 登记工具"},"1429":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`use_middleware` — 挂中间件"},"1430":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"`run` — 启动"},"1431":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"完整示例"},"1432":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"发消息：手写 `sendMessage`（或者用 `simplify_invoke`）"},"1433":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"常见问题"},"1434":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"Python 插件就是一个目录：`pyproject.toml` 写身份，`main.py` 写逻辑，`fuyubot.py`（单文件薄 SDK）\n管通信。上手三步见 脚本插件。本页是**方法手册 + 示例**。"},"1435":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"本页的 `fuyubot.py`（`fuyubot-python-host`）和 `script_plugin!` 内嵌的\n`fuyubot_plugin.py` 都支持 `run_async` / `invoke_async` / `wait_async`，\n见 异步等待。"},"1436":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python","content":"manifest 长这样（`entry` 不写就默认 `main.py`）："},"1437":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"薄 SDK 把 VTable 那 22 个函数包成了这些（`run()` 之前只能调同步的那几个）："},"1438":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                | 走的 ABI | 干什么             |\n| --------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |\n| `on(event, handler, filter=None)` | `on`   | 订阅事件：事件来了就调你的函数 |","table":"table-0"},"1439":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                    | 走的 ABI | 干什么                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------ |\n| `off(event, handler)` | `off`  | 退订一个订阅（脚本订阅也能按事件 + 处理器退） |","table":"table-0"},"1440":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                                                |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke(method, params=None, on_response=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 调一次 TDLib 接口；给了 `on_response` 就在响应回来时回调（按 `request_id` 配对，你不用记请求号） |","table":"table-0"},"1441":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                  | 走的 ABI                 | 干什么                                              |\n| ----------------------------------- | ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| `invoke_async(method, params=None)` | `td_invoke_simplified` | 同上，但返回可 `await` 的 future（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1442":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI | 干什么                    |\n| --------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------- |\n| `emit(event, payload=None)` | `emit` | 发一条自定义事件（自己 + 全局订阅者收到） |","table":"table-0"},"1443":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                           | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                      |\n| ---------------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `log(message, level=\"info\")` | `log`  | 打日志（`debug` / `info` / `warn` / `error`） |","table":"table-0"},"1444":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI                    | 干什么                            |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| `register_tool(name, description=\"\", input_schema=None)` | `register_tool`（`meta` 版） | 登记工具**元数据**——脚本不能交函数指针，所以没有处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"1445":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                              | 走的 ABI             | 干什么                                  |\n| ----------------------------------------------- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `call_tool(name, input=None, on_response=None)` | `call_tool_result` | 调用一个工具，**同步**拿输出（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"1446":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI       | 干什么          |\n| --------------------------- | ------------ | ------------ |\n| `list_tools(on_tools=None)` | `list_tools` | 同步列出全部工具的元数据 |","table":"table-0"},"1447":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                    | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                                        |\n| ------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute(request, on_result=None)` | `td_execute` | **同步**执行不碰网络的 TDLib 方法（`parseTextEntities` 之类），发消息**不能**走它 |","table":"table-0"},"1448":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                               | 走的 ABI           | 干什么                                  |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `use_middleware(stage, handler)` | `use_middleware` | 挂中间件（`stage` 是 0..5）；无法单独注销，随插件停止一起撤 |","table":"table-0"},"1449":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                     | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                              |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `wait_for_update(filter, timeout_ms=0, on_match=None)` | `wait_for_update` | 阻塞等一条匹配的更新（在宿主侧独立线程里等），超时 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1450":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                 | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                    |\n| ---------------------------------- | ----------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `wait_async(filter, timeout_ms=0)` | `wait_for_update` | 上一条的 `await` 版（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1451":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                   | 走的 ABI        | 干什么                       |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `get_service(name, on_service=None)` | `get_service` | 读一个服务的元数据；不存在时回调收到 `None` |","table":"table-0"},"1452":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                                       | 走的 ABI        | 干什么         |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ----------- |\n| `call_service(name, method, input=None, on_result=None)` | `get_service` | 同步调用服务的某个方法 |","table":"table-0"},"1453":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法         | 走的 ABI | 干什么                          |\n| ---------- | ------ | ---------------------------- |\n| `config()` | —      | `plugin_start` 传进来的那份配置 JSON |","table":"table-0"},"1454":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                |\n| ----------------- | ------ | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin_config()` | —      | **同步**读**自己**那一段配置（`[plugin.<插件名>]`）；`run()` 之前也能用 |","table":"table-0"},"1455":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                            | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key=\"\", on_config=None)` | `get_config` | 读**任意**插件段（异步，回调在 `run()` 之后） |","table":"table-0"},"1456":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                     | 走的 ABI       | 干什么                                |\n| -------------------------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value, on_done=None)` | `set_config` | 写**自己**那一段配置（成功后回写 `fuyubot.toml`） |","table":"table-0"},"1457":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                      | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                                 |\n| --------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke(op, on_response=None)` | `simplify_invoke` | 让宿主跑一个 simplify 操作（发消息等结局、超时撤回、Markdown→entities…）；结果经 `response` 通道回投，整条 `simplifyResult` 交 `on_response`（不传就只发不收） |","table":"table-0"},"1458":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                          | 走的 ABI            | 干什么                                                                                                     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke_async(op)` | `simplify_invoke` | 上一条的 future 版，`resolve` 整条 `simplifyResult`（`{ok, op, result\\|error}`），自己判 `ok`（**只能**在 `run_async` 里用） |","table":"table-0"},"1459":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                                           | 走的 ABI                   | 干什么                                                                                                                       |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `simplify_invoke_result(op, on_result=None)` | `simplify_invoke_result` | **同步**跑不碰网络的 op（`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`），回调收结果；传异步 op 拿到 `ok:False` / `code:\"async_op\"` |","table":"table-0"},"1460":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法      | 走的 ABI | 干什么                   |\n| ------- | ------ | --------------------- |\n| `run()` | —      | 握手并开始收事件——**永远是最后一行** |","table":"table-0"},"1461":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#方法一览","content":"| 方法                     | 走的 ABI | 干什么                                                  |\n| ---------------------- | ------ | ---------------------------------------------------- |\n| `run_async(main=None)` | —      | 同上，但跑 asyncio 事件循环，`invoke_async` / `wait_async` 要用它 |","table":"table-0"},"1462":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"三条容易踩的："},"1463":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`on_response` / `on_result` 这类回调**只在 `run()` 之后才有**——宿主得先握手；模块顶层只能调\n`plugin_config()` 这种同步的。"},"1464":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`td_execute` 只给不碰网络的方法用，拿它发消息会失败。"},"1465":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`wait_for_update` 是在**宿主侧**线程里等的，脚本这边不阻塞；`timeout_ms=0` 表示只检查当前状态。"},"1466":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"`fuyubot.toml` 里每个插件有自己的段（见配置文件）。读**自己**那段\n用 `plugin_config()`——它是**同步**的，宿主在启动脚本时就把这段塞进了 `argv[2]`，所以\n`run()` 之前（模块顶层）就能用："},"1467":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**读别人的段**（`get_config`）是**异步**的：回执要等 `run()` 之后才有，所以只能在事件/中间件\n回调里用。段或键不存在时回调收到 `None`。"},"1468":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"**写自己的段**（`set_config`）也是异步的，成功后 `on_done(True)`，宿主会**回写\n`fuyubot.toml`**。⚠️ 回写是**全量重写**，你手写的注释会丢。"},"1469":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"写失败（越权 / 值不是合法 JSON / 写盘失败）时宿主只发一条 error 日志、**不会**调 `on_done`\n——别把「没收到回调」当成成功。"},"1470":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#读--写配置","content":"脚本插件只能写**自己**的段：`set_config` 没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定归属，\n所以改不到别的插件那一段（会被拒）。这是 ABI 层面的硬约束，不是薄 SDK 的限制。"},"1471":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"你的函数只有**被事件触发**才会跑。事件有两个来源："},"1472":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**TDLib 更新**：来一条消息、消息发送成功……每种更新是一个事件，**事件名就是更新的 `@type`**\n（`updateNewMessage`、`updateMessageSendSucceeded` ……）。每条更新会同时发到两个通道：\n具体的 `@type` 事件，和兜底的 `\"update\"` 事件（订阅它可以看全部）。"},"1473":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"**你自己发的事件**：`emit(\"job_done\", …)` 发出的自定义事件（细节见\n订阅与事件）。"},"1474":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"事件怎么到你手上"},"1475":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 的更新按 @type 分发到具体订阅，没有具体订阅时落到 update 兜底通道；插件自己 emit 的事件直接送给对应订阅者。"},"1476":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"TDLib 更新"},"1477":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"按 @type 分发"},"1478":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"PreRoute 之后"},"1479":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;updateNewMessage&apos;)"},"1480":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"具体类型"},"1481":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;update&apos;)"},"1482":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"兜底通道"},"1483":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-64","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"emit(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1484":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-65","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"on(&apos;job_done&apos;)"},"1485":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-66","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#事件怎么触发","content":"自己 emit 的事件不走 @type 分发，直接送到同名订阅者——所以插件之间的通信不必绕 TDLib。"},"1486":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数      | 说明                                       |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------- |\n| `event` | 事件名：更新的 `@type`、`\"update\"`（全部更新）或你自定义的名字 |","table":"table-1"},"1487":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数        | 说明                                     |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| `handler` | 回调函数，收到一个 `payload`（解析好的 `dict`，直接取字段） |","table":"table-1"},"1488":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"| 参数       | 说明                                  |\n| -------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `filter` | 可选。只收负载里**指定字段等于指定值**的事件（点分路径写法，见下） |","table":"table-1"},"1489":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**是两参数函数，不是装饰器**——`@on(...)` 会报错，老老实实 `on(事件, 函数)`。\n同一个事件可以订阅多次，各带各的过滤器。"},"1490":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#on--订阅事件","content":"**过滤器**：`{\"点分路径\": 期望值}`，负载里那个字段**等于**期望值才触发："},"1491":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"发一个 TDLib 请求。方法名与参数名**以 TDLib 为准**（不是 Bot API），查法见\n调用 TDLib。给了 `on_response` 时回调按 `request_id` **自动配对**，\n不用自己记请求号。"},"1492":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#invoke--调-tdlib-接口","content":"`invoke` **不阻塞**、立即返回。响应回来时你的 `on_response` 被调用。\n不传 `on_response` 就是「发完不管」。"},"1493":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#emit--发自定义事件","content":"给**自己 + 全局订阅者**发一条自定义事件（不是广播给所有插件，见 订阅与事件）。\n适合在自己内部做「任务完成」之类的信号："},"1494":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#log--打日志","content":"`level`：`error` / `warn` / `info` / `debug` / `trace`。排查问题时把配置里\n`[plugins].log_level` 调成 `\"debug\"`（见配置文件）。"},"1495":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#register_tool--登记工具","content":"只登记**元数据**（名字、说明、参数的 JSON Schema），让宿主知道有这个工具；\n调用分发看 工具与中间件。"},"1496":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#use_middleware--挂中间件","content":"`handler(stage, payload)` 在更新流经管线时被调用，可以检查或改写负载。\n`stage` 是阶段号；细节看 工具与中间件。"},"1497":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#run--启动","content":"发就绪握手、开始收事件，**阻塞到进程结束**。**必须是最后一行**——它提前返回 = 插件加载失败。"},"1498":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**Echo 机器人**——回声复读："},"1499":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**命令处理器**——不同命令各干各的："},"1500":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#完整示例","content":"**看全部流量**——兜底通道记日志："},"1501":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"> ✅ **ABI v5 起，这一节只是「另一条路」，不再是唯一的路。** 宿主从 v5 开始自己跑\n> 同一份 `fuyubot-simplify` 代码，经 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_result` 暴露成一张\n> **op 表**（`{\"op\":\"send_message\",\"args\":{…}}`），所有语言都能用——发消息等结局、超时撤回、\n> bot 与用户号挑不同反应方法、Markdown → entities、富消息本地块树，都不用手写。\n> 见 ABI › simplify 操作表。\n> ✅ Python 薄封装已经支持 `simplify_invoke` / `simplify_invoke_async` / `simplify_invoke_result`\n> （见上表）——直接调用即可，不必手写下面这些字段。"},"1502":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"先来一个能跑的：用 `simplify_invoke` 发消息——宿主替你把文本解析成 `formattedText`、\n等到「真发出去」那条 `Message`、超时还会先撤回（结果经 `response` 通道回投）："},"1503":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"只想要同步拿结果（不碰网络的 op）就用 `simplify_invoke_result`，回调里收整条 `simplifyResult`：\n`parse_text_entities` / `rich_from_markdown` / `list_ops`。传需要等 TDLib 应答的异步 op\n会拿到 `ok:False` / `code:\"async_op\"`。"},"1504":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"手写 `sendMessage` 是**另一条路**——下面这些字段你都得自己拼对："},"1505":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                       |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 纯文本   | `input_message_content` = `inputMessageText`，里面 `text` 是 `formattedText`（`text` + `entities`） |","table":"table-2"},"1506":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果           | 手写的关键字段                                                                                                                         |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Markdown / HTML | **不自己解析**：先 `td_execute` 调 `parseTextEntities`（`version: 2` = MarkdownV2，`textParseModeHTML` = HTML），把返回的 `formattedText` 整个塞进去 |","table":"table-2"},"1507":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                 |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 回复某条  | `reply_to` = `{\"@type\": \"inputMessageReplyToMessage\", \"message_id\": N}` |","table":"table-2"},"1508":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                               |\n| ----- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发到话题  | `topic_id` = `{\"@type\": \"messageTopicForum\", \"forum_topic_id\": N}`（论坛）；非论坛的评论串才是 `messageTopicThread` |","table":"table-2"},"1509":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果 | 手写的关键字段                                                                                             |\n| ----- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 内联按钮  | `reply_markup` = `replyMarkupInlineKeyboard`；⚠️ callback 按钮的 `data` 是 **base64**（TDLib 里它是 `bytes`） |","table":"table-2"},"1510":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果     | 手写的关键字段                                    |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| 静音 / 保护内容 | 都在 `options`（`messageSendOptions`）里，不是顶层字段 |","table":"table-2"},"1511":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"| 想要的效果    | 手写的关键字段                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等到「真发出去」 | `on_response` 只到**临时消息**；要最终那条 `Message` 得再等一条 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` |","table":"table-2"},"1512":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#发消息手写-sendmessage或者用-simplify_invoke","content":"方法名拿不准就问 SDK，它读的是真 `td_api.tl`：`fuyubot-sdk td-method sendMessage`。"},"1513":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**原生桥**：薄 SDK 要加载原生桥（和托管插件同一份库）。查找顺序：脚本同目录 →\n环境变量 `FUYUBOT_NATIVE_LIB` → 当前工作目录。找不到会报\n「找不到 fuyubot 原生桥库」，排法见 脚本插件常见问题。"},"1514":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**自检**：`python fuyubot.py` 验证 API 形状（不碰宿主），输出 `fuyubot: self-test ok`。"},"1515":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**依赖工具**：要装 uv（机器人用 `uv sync` 装依赖、`uv run` 起脚本）。"},"1516":{"id":"/docs/plugin/python-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/python","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/python#常见问题","content":"**payload 取字段**：先判空再取（`dict.get()`），不同更新类型的字段位置不一样；\n`updateNewMessage` 的文本在 `message.content.text.text`。"},"1517":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"page","content":"富消息","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich"},"1518":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"messageRichMessage：块树排版、按钮行与本地 Markdown 转换"},"1519":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"三种源"},"1520":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"发送与编辑"},"1521":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮"},"1522":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"行内富文本：`richtext`"},"1523":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"覆盖靠测试钉着"},"1524":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 的富消息（`messageRichMessage`）是「一页排版」的消息：标题、段落、表格、代码块、\n按钮行……全是一块一块的**页块**（`InputPageBlock`），行内另有独立的富文本（`RichText`）。\nBot API 管它叫 Rich Messages。"},"1525":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"TDLib 里**没有** `sendRichMessage` / `editRichMessage`，也没有自带的 md → 块树转换；\n`fuyubot-simplify` 的 `RichMessage` 把这层补齐了：发送 / 编辑就是\n`sendMessage` / `editMessageText` + `inputMessageRichMessage`，Markdown 转换在**本地**完成。"},"1526":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage：三种构建方式，两个出口"},"1527":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown、服务端 HTML、手拼块树三条路都能产出同一个 RichMessage 类型；它只有两个出口——发送和编辑，各自落到对应的 TDLib 方法。"},"1528":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown"},"1529":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_markdown（本地转）"},"1530":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"Markdown / HTML"},"1531":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"server_markdown / server_html"},"1532":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"块树"},"1533":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"from_blocks（最底层）"},"1534":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"RichMessage"},"1535":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"三种方式产出同一个类型，下游只认它"},"1536":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"send_rich_message"},"1537":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"edit_rich_message"},"1538":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"sendMessage"},"1539":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1540":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"editMessageText"},"1541":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich","content":"+ inputMessageRichMessage"},"1542":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"`RichMessage` 内部是 `RichSource` 三选一："},"1543":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                               | 谁解析                              | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | -------------------------------- | -------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_markdown(md)` | **本地**转换器（对齐官方 Rich Markdown 全表） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1544":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源      | 构造                                 | 谁解析                                | 谁能发  |\n| ------ | ---------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- | ---- |\n| Blocks | `RichMessage::from_blocks(blocks)` | 你给现成块树（每块一条 `InputPageBlock` JSON） | 任何账号 |","table":"table-0"},"1545":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源        | 构造                                 | 谁解析              | 谁能发   |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| Markdown | `RichMessage::server_markdown(md)` | **服务端**（发前拿不到块树） | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1546":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"| 源    | 构造                               | 谁解析     | 谁能发   |\n| ---- | -------------------------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| Html | `RichMessage::server_html(html)` | **服务端** | 仅 bot |","table":"table-0"},"1547":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#三种源","content":"本地转换器对着官方 Rich Markdown 表\n一类一例全覆盖：标题 / 段落 / 围栏代码（含 `math`）/ 引用与可展开引用 / 拉引 / 页脚 /\n列表与任务项 / 表格 / 分割线 / 公式 / 折叠块 / 拼贴与幻灯片 / 媒体（按扩展名猜类型）/\n地图 / 锚点 / 按钮行 / 思考占位 / 脚注；行内粗斜删码、标记、剧透、上下标、行内公式、\n自定义 emoji、时间、`mailto:` / `tel:` / `tg://user` / 锚点链接，以及那批 HTML 标签\n（`<u>` `<details>` `<tg-collage>` `<tg-button-row>` …）。**不认的一律当普通文本**\n（引用式链接、`<table>` 这类 HTML 块不会报错，只是原样保留）。"},"1548":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"参数是 `RichMessageParams`——与 `SendMessageParams` **分开的类型**（那边是「文本 + 媒体」\n二选一，混在一起互斥规则没人记得住）：`message` / `reply_to_message_id` / `topic_id`\n（`Option<Topic>`，见Simplify 封装）/ `reply_markup` /\n`clear_draft` / `timeout_ms`。"},"1549":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"和 `Simplify` 的其它方法一样，**等到结果才返回**（详见调用 TDLib）："},"1550":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                         | 发出的 `@type`   | 等到什么               | 返回                                                    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::send_rich_message(chat_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `sendMessage` | 响应 + 发送结局（成功 / 失败） | 最终 `Message`（⚠️ **阻塞**，回调里用 `send_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1551":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"| 方法                                                                     | 发出的 `@type`       | 等到什么 | 返回                                           |\n| ---------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ---- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `Simplify::edit_rich_message(chat_id, message_id, &RichMessageParams)` | `editMessageText` | 响应   | 改完的 `Message`（回调里用 `edit_rich_message_then`） |","table":"table-1"},"1552":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#发送与编辑","content":"最常用的两条捷径："},"1553":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"按钮在 Markdown 里**没有语法**，一律显式构造：`RichButton::url / callback / user / copy_text`\n（`.style(RichButtonStyle)` 换样式），用 `with_buttons` / `with_button_row` 追加\n`inputPageBlockButtonRow`。"},"1554":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#按钮","content":"`with_buttons` 只对 **Blocks 源**成立——`server_markdown` / `server_html` 的按钮要用\n服务端语法自己写进文本，对它们调 `with_buttons` 会报 `RichSourceNotBlocks`。"},"1555":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"块里的行内内容是独立的 `RichText`（31 个构造器，没有 offset/length）：\nMarkdown 语法能覆盖 21 个，剩下 10 个（`mention` / `hashtag` / `cashtag` /\n`bankCardNumber` / `tonAddress` / `botCommand` / `icon` / `button` / `diff` / `anchor`）\n没有 md 写法，用 `richtext::*` 拼好塞进块（配合 `with_block`）。"},"1556":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#行内富文本richtext","content":"`InputPageBlock` 一共 24 个构造器，本地转换器**全都能产出**（`thinking` 只能出现在草稿消息里，\n结构上仍可构造）；`with_block` 也留给「媒体已上传、要传 `inputPhoto` 句柄」这类 md 表达不了的场景。"},"1557":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"块级语法**一类一例**：`block_syntax_covers_the_official_table`（每块都再走一遍\n`td_api::InputPageBlock` 反序列化）；整段全格式回归闸是内联的 `official_sample_fully_deserializes`。"},"1558":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"加块 / 删块会让 `input_page_block_coverage_is_accounted_for` 失败——24 个构造器的\n分工表就烤在这条测试里。"},"1559":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rich-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rich","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rich#覆盖靠测试钉着","content":"相关：调用 TDLib（`Simplify` 的其余方法）、插件总览。"},"1560":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"page","content":"Rust 插件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust"},"1561":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"fuyubot-plugin-api 与 define_plugin! 的完整写法"},"1562":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"依赖"},"1563":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"最小可用插件"},"1564":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`Plugin` trait"},"1565":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"读 / 写配置"},"1566":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调里带状态"},"1567":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"一次看全：常用 ABI 怎么调"},"1568":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"用封装层发消息：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"1569":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/rust#编译与安装","content":"编译与安装"},"1570":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust","content":"Rust 插件只依赖一个 crate：`fuyubot-plugin-api`。它把 `fuyubot-abi` 的形状转成用着不疼的样子——\n`HostApi`（已解包、调用路径上没有 `Option` 和 panic 分支）、`HostExt` 便利方法、\ndrop 即退订的 `Subscription`、`ResponseRouter`（可 `await` 的请求/更新等待），以及\n`define_plugin!` 宏。异步写法见 异步等待。"},"1571":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#依赖","content":"那个空的 `[workspace]` 不是多余的：没有它，cargo 会一路往上找父目录的 workspace 声明然后报错。"},"1572":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#最小可用插件","content":"这就是 `fuyubot-sdk init demo --lang rust` 生成的模板："},"1573":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                   | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `init(host) -> Result<Self, String>` | `plugin_init` | 构造状态；返回 `Err` = 加载失败 |","table":"table-0"},"1574":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                                                    | 对应符号           | 说明                              |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `start(&mut self, config_json) -> Result<(), String>` | `plugin_start` | 宿主已把 VTable、插件目录都准备好；订阅/注册都写在这里 |","table":"table-0"},"1575":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"| 方法                | 对应符号          | 说明                   |\n| ----------------- | ------------- | -------------------- |\n| `stop(&mut self)` | `plugin_stop` | 可选；宏随后把状态收回 `Box` 释放 |","table":"table-0"},"1576":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#plugin-trait","content":"`define_plugin!` 还会把插件代码包在 `catch_unwind` 里——和 `C-unwind` 是两层，\n**两层都要**：一层防 panic 逃出 ABI，一层防 panic 把宿主线程带走。"},"1577":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"每个插件在 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下有自己的一段配置（详见配置文件）。\n`HostApi` 上两个方法直接读写它："},"1578":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                           | 作用                                                                               |\n| -------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `get_config(section, key) -> Option<String>` | 读**任意**段。`section` 空串读顶层（`[bot]` 等），`key` 空串读整段、否则按点路径取键。返回 JSON 文本，找不到就是 `None` |","table":"table-1"},"1579":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"| 方法                                                    | 作用                                                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `set_config(key, value_json) -> Result<(), AbiError>` | 写**自己**的段。**没有 section 参数**——宿主按调用者身份判定，写不到别人那段。`key` 空串覆盖整段。成功后写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"1580":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#读--写配置","content":"`set_config` 回写是**全量重写** `fuyubot.toml`——你手写在文件里的注释、空行会被 `toml`\n序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是可接受的取舍；要保注释就别让插件运行时去改，\n把值手工维护进文件。"},"1581":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"回调是裸函数指针，没有捕获环境。状态要么放插件字段、经 `user_data` 传进去，要么像\n`examples/rust-echo` 那样把 `Box<HostApi>` 的地址当 `user_data`："},"1582":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`stop` 里用 `Box::from_raw` 收回，只收一次；否则就是内存泄漏（或重复释放）。"},"1583":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#回调里带状态","content":"`Subscription` 是 `#[must_use]`：`let _ = host.subscribe_json(…)` 会**立刻退订**。\n一定要存进插件字段。插件卸载时宿主还会整批回滚，但那时插件自己的状态已经漏了。"},"1584":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"`HostApi` 上是 VTable 那 22 个函数的一对一封装，`HostExt` 另外给了几个「不用自己拼 JSON 字符串」\n的便利方法（`subscribe_json` / `invoke_value` / `call_tool_value` / `config_value` /\n`set_config_value` / `wait_for_update_json` / `info|warn|error`）。下面这段把它们用了一遍\n（省掉了 `user_data` 取 `HostApi` 的样板，见上面「回调里带状态」一节）："},"1585":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么    | 用哪个                                                    |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| 订阅 / 退订 | `subscribe_json`（返回 `Subscription`，drop 即退订）/ 句柄 `off` |","table":"table-2"},"1586":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么       | 用哪个                                                             |\n| ---------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 发 TDLib 请求 | `invoke_value(method, params)`（或底层 `td_invoke_simplified` 吃字符串） |","table":"table-2"},"1587":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                      |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 同步执行 | `td_execute`（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 这类） |","table":"table-2"},"1588":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么         | 用哪个                                                            |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 等一条更新 / 一条响应 | `wait_for_update_json`（阻塞）或 `ResponseRouter` 的 `await` 版，见异步等待 |","table":"table-2"},"1589":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                                      |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 工具   | `register_tool` / `register_tool_meta` / `call_tool` / `call_tool_result` / `list_tools` |","table":"table-2"},"1590":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                    |\n| ---- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 服务   | `provide_service`（自己作用域）/ `provide_service_shared`（进程级）/ `get_service` |","table":"table-2"},"1591":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                                                              |\n| ---- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 配置   | `get_config` / `set_config`（字符串版）、`config_value` / `set_config_value`（`Value` 版） |","table":"table-2"},"1592":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                                              |\n| ---- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| 中间件  | `use_middleware(Stage::X as u32, cb, user_data)` |","table":"table-2"},"1593":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么 | 用哪个                           |\n| ---- | ----------------------------- |\n| 看别人  | `list_tools` / `list_plugins` |","table":"table-2"},"1594":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#一次看全常用-abi-怎么调","content":"| 想干什么        | 用哪个                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 跨语言简化入口（v5） | `simplify_invoke(op_json)` / `simplify_invoke_result(op_json)`——和 JS/TS/Python/Go/C 同一条 op 表（见 ABI › simplify 操作表）；要类型安全的封装仍可用上面的 `fuyubot-simplify` crate |","table":"table-2"},"1595":{"id":"/docs/plugin/rust-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/rust","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/rust#用封装层发消息fuyubot-simplify","content":"上面 ⑦ 那种手写 JSON 能跑，但每个方法都要自己拼嵌套结构、还要自己等「发送结局」。\nRust 