` **同序**的最终消息）。"},"1742":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ medias: { description: '2–10 项，只有音频 / 文档 / 图片 / 视频能混成相册；项数不对直接 AlbumSize，不发请求。', type: 'Vec<Media>…\" />"},"1743":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#4-相册sendalbumparams","content":"⚠️ **相册发的时候带不上键盘**（真签名里没有 `reply_markup`）：先发，再拿返回的消息 id 调\n`edit_message_reply_markup`。"},"1744":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                         | 参数结构体            | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------ | ---------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_text(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditTextParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1745":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                            | 参数结构体               | 返回值           |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_caption(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditCaptionParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1746":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                          | 参数结构体             | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ----------------- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_media(chat_id, msg, &params)` | `EditMediaParams` | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1747":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                           | 参数结构体 | 返回值           |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- | ------------- |\n| `edit_message_reply_markup(chat_id, msg, &rows, timeout_ms)` | —     | 改完的 `Message` |","table":"table-4"},"1748":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                 | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| -------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `delete_message(chat_id, ids, revoke, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1749":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"| 方法                                                              | 参数结构体 | 返回值  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------- | ----- | ---- |\n| `answer_callback_query(query_id, text, show_alert, timeout_ms)` | —     | `()` |","table":"table-4"},"1750":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'EditTextParams.text': { description: '新文本；None 就是「只改键盘」。', type: 'Option<Text>', default: 'None',…\" />"},"1751":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#5-编辑删除与应答","content":"`delete_message` 的 `revoke = true` 表示对所有人撤回；`answer_callback_query` 的 `text` 是 `None` 就发空串\n（`url` / `cache_time` 固定 `\"\"` / `0`）。点了内联按钮之后**必须**应答，否则客户端一直转圈。"},"1752":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ text: { description: '按钮文案。', type: 'String', required: true }, action: { description: '点下去做什么：Cal…\" />"},"1753":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#6-内联键盘replybutton","content":"构造：`ReplyButton::callback(text, data)` / `url` / `user` / `web_app`，再 `.emoji(id)` / `.style(..)`。"},"1754":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"`command_of(update)` 从一条 `updateNewMessage` 里认出命令（只认文本消息，**跳过自己发的**）；\n`on_command(host, handler)` 一次性订阅，`CommandSubscription` **drop 即退订**——把它存进插件状态。"},"1755":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"**点名给别人的命令不会送到 `handler`。** Telegram 的约定是：裸命令（`/start`）所有 bot 都响应，\n带 `@` 的只有被点名的那一方响应。`on_command` 按这条规则过滤，所以插件里不用自己再判断 `@`：\n`/start@别的Bot` 根本到不了你手上。判据来自宿主预置的 `fuyubot.host.identity` 服务：登录时由\n`getMe` 写入，之后每条 `updateUser` 都跟着刷新，所以改用户名之后不会按旧名字判断。\n遇到点名命令时**现问一次**（纯内存读，不是 TDLib 请求，不会卡接收循环）。"},"1756":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ chat_id: { description: '命令所在的会话。', type: 'i64' }, message_id: { description: '这条消息本身（回复 / 编辑直接用它）…\" />"},"1757":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"要看「点名给别人的」那种消息，就别走 `on_command`——自己订阅原始更新\n`host.on(\"updateNewMessage\", None, …)`，再配 `command_of` 解析。判定规则本身也是公开的：\n`command.addressed_to`（`@` 后面的名字）、`command.is_addressed_to(\"FuyuBot\")`、\n`command.is_for(&usernames)`；`my_usernames(&host)` 就是问宿主「我是谁」。"},"1758":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#7-命令与输入","content":"**没登录 / `--no-tdlib` / `--replay` 时身份未知**，这时 `on_command` 不过滤——分不清\n「点名的是别人」还是「我还不知道自己是谁」，宁可多回一句也不吞命令。"},"1759":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法等的是**两件事**——响应只是第一截，箭头指的地方才是它真正返回的位置："},"1760":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"发送类方法的两段时间线"},"1761":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 先发请求；收到响应时拿到的是还没发出去的临时消息，再等到发送结局 updateMessageSendSucceeded 或 updateMessageSendFailed 才返回最终 Message；超时则先撤回那条没发出去的消息再返回 Timeout。"},"1762":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"时间去向右"},"1763":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"① 发出请求"},"1764":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"td_invoke sendMessage"},"1765":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"② 收到响应"},"1766":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"临时消息，还没发出去"},"1767":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"③ 收到结局"},"1768":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"Succeeded / Failed"},"1769":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"send_message 在这里返回"},"1770":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"最终 Message"},"1771":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"超时：先撤回那条没发出去的"},"1772":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"deleteMessages(revoke) → Timeout"},"1773":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号；其余方法（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`）\n只等到 ② 就返回了。想自己接原始 JSON，用下面的 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update`。"},"1774":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'UpdateFilter::new(type)': { description: '按「消息包在 message 里」的更新类型过滤，例如 updateNewMessage。', type: '…\" />"},"1775":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#8-等待与订阅","content":"三条提醒：等待靠**更新投递**；`UpdateFilter::to_json()` 里的 `update_type` 是**通道选择**\n（`event_type` 键），不参与负载匹配——详见订阅与事件。"},"1776":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'resolve_entities(ids, timeout_ms)': { description: '并发发 getChat / getUser，再逐个收齐 → EntitiesResolut…\" />"},"1777":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#9-实体与下载","content":"想看实时进度又不想阻塞，就去订阅原始的 `updateFile`——原始更新一直可见，不与简化事件冲突。"},"1778":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#10-富消息","content":"一套独立的参数类型（`RichMessageParams`），是因为它跟「文本 + 媒体」的互斥规则完全不同\n（那边二选一，这边是块树）。API 见富消息，本文不重复。"},"1779":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"TDLib 里 `user` **连 `is_bot` 都没有**（身份在 `user.type`），管理权也不在任何「用户信息」上——\n它只在 `getChatMember` 给的 `ChatMember.status` 里。"},"1780":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'is_chat_admin(chat_id, user_id, right, timeout_ms)': { description: '这个用户在这个聊天里有没有管理权。right: None…\" />"},"1781":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"判定规则（`is_admin_status`）："},"1782":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`       |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusCreator`（群主） | `true`        | `true`——群主拥有一切（唯一例外见下） |","table":"table-5"},"1783":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                  | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)`                             |\n| ------------------------------- | ------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `chatMemberStatusAdministrator` | `true`        | `status.rights.<x>` 必须为 `true`，字段缺失按 `false` |","table":"table-5"},"1784":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"| `status.@type`                                    | `right: None` | `right: Some(x)` |\n| ------------------------------------------------- | ------------- | ---------------- |\n| 其余四种（`member` / `restricted` / `left` / `banned`） | `false`       | `false`          |","table":"table-5"},"1785":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"⚠️ 群主的**匿名**是 `status.is_anonymous`，不在 `rights` 里——所以 `Some(AdminRight::IsAnonymous)`\n对群主读的是前者。`AdminRight` 共 18 项，名字就是 `chatAdministratorRights` 的字段名\n（`can_manage_chat` / `can_delete_messages` / `can_pin_messages` / …），认不出的字段名\n`AdminRight::from_key` 返回 `None`。"},"1786":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#11-管理权adminright","content":"拿不到成员信息（超时 / TDLib 报错 / 不是群聊）一律 `false`：**不确定时说「没有」比说「有」安全**。"},"1787":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"`simplify.forward_messages(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` → `Result<Vec<Value>>`。"},"1788":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ message_ids: { description: '要转发的消息 id。**会排序去重**——TDLib 要求严格递增、最多 100 条。', type: 'Vec<i64>', requi…\" />"},"1789":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"走的是 `forwardMessages`（一次一组，**不是** Bot API 的 `forwardMessage`）。返回的是**还没发完**的临时消息\n——这里只等**响应**，不等发送结局，最终消息照旧经 `updateMessageSendSucceeded` / `updateMessageSendFailed`\n回来。单项没转发成功时 TDLib 在对应位置放 `null`，所以数组长度与排序后的 `message_ids` 一致、\n但元素可能是 `Null`。"},"1790":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#12-转发forwardparams","content":"空列表 → `SimplifyError::EmptyForward`，超过 100 条 → `TooManyForward`，两者都在发请求**之前**挡掉。"},"1791":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"bot 与用户号**不是同一个方法**，这一点没有「通用写法」可言："},"1792":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                                   | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                 | 语义    |\n| ---------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ----- |\n| `react(chat_id, msg, &reaction, is_big, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions`，用户 → `addMessageReaction` | 加一个反应 |","table":"table-6"},"1793":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                                             | 用哪个 TDLib 方法                                                         | 语义   |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| `unreact(chat_id, msg, &reaction, timeout_ms)` | **自动**：bot → `setMessageReactions` 传空列表，用户 → `removeMessageReaction` | 去掉反应 |","table":"table-6"},"1794":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                 | 用哪个 TDLib 方法            | 语义                  |\n| ------------------ | ----------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `add_reaction(..)` | 固定 `addMessageReaction` | 已知自己是用户号时省掉 `getMe` |","table":"table-6"},"1795":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"| 方法                  | 用哪个 TDLib 方法             | 语义                   |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------ | -------------------- |\n| `set_reactions(..)` | 固定 `setMessageReactions` | 已知自己是 bot 时；空切片 = 清空 |","table":"table-6"},"1796":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"自动判定靠 `getMe` 的 `user.type.@type == \"userTypeBot\"`，也就是说 `react` / `unreact` 每次会多一次\n`getMe` 往返（它不碰服务器，TDLib 本地应答）。⚠️ bot 侧没有「删一个」的说法，只能整组覆盖——\n所以 **bot 的 `unreact` 会忽略 `reaction` 参数**，直接清空。"},"1797":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#13-表情反应reaction","content":"`Reaction::emoji(\"👍\")` → `reactionTypeEmoji`；`Reaction::custom_emoji(id)` → `reactionTypeCustomEmoji`。\n付费反应（`reactionTypePaid`）不在这套里。"},"1798":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"TDLib **没有** `getConnectionState`——连接状态只以 `updateConnectionState` 的形式出现，\n所以「现在连上了吗」只能自己订阅并记住最新那条。"},"1799":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"<TypeTable type=\"{ 'track_connection_state()': { description: '订阅并记住最新一条 updateConnectionState → ConnectionTracker（dr…\" />"},"1800":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"两个坑："},"1801":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"**订阅之前推过的更新补不回来**（TDLib 的状态更新不重放），所以在插件 `start` 里尽早调；\n晚订阅只会漏掉开头的 `Connecting` / `Updating`。"},"1802":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#14-连接状态connectiontracker","content":"这是**连接**状态（到 Telegram 的链路），**不是**授权状态（`updateAuthorizationState`，登录那一套）。\n两者独立：`connectionStateReady` 也可能还没登录。"},"1803":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"纯函数，随手支配——想绕过某些方法的等待语义、自己拼请求时尤其有用："},"1804":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                                                       | 作用                          |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --------------------------- |\n| `send_params` / `album_params` / `edit_text_params` / `edit_caption_params` / `edit_media_params` / `edit_markup_params` | 组装参数（**不含 `@type`**，那是宿主补的） |","table":"table-7"},"1805":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                                        | 作用                                                    |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `chat_member_params(chat_id, user_id)` / `forward_params(chat_id, from_chat_id, &params)` | 管理权 / 转发的参数（含 `MessageTopic` 与 `MessageSender` 的嵌套形状） |","table":"table-7"},"1806":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                    | 作用                           |\n| --------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| `reaction_params` / `set_reactions_params` / `remove_reaction_params` | 三种反应请求的参数（user 分支与 bot 分支分开） |","table":"table-7"},"1807":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                | 作用                                 |\n| --------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `is_admin_status(&status, right)` | 判一份 `ChatMemberStatus` 有没有管理权，不发请求 |","table":"table-7"},"1808":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                             | 作用                         |\n| ------------------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| `content_json(&Media, render)` | 媒体 → `InputMessageContent` |","table":"table-7"},"1809":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                          | 作用                                        |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `parse_text_request(&Text)` | `parseTextEntities` 的请求；`Plain` 返回 `None` |","table":"table-7"},"1810":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                                                                | 作用                            |\n| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------- |\n| `formatted_from(&Text, Option<&Value>)` / `is_formatted_text(..)` | 响应 → `formattedText`；拿不到退回纯文本 |","table":"table-7"},"1811":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `plain_text(&Text)` | 纯文本 → `formattedText`（不花往返），也是默认渲染器 |","table":"table-7"},"1812":{"id":"/docs/plugin/simplify-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/simplify","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/simplify#15-不挂在-simplify-上的公开函数","content":"| 函数           