lugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#135-zip-的入口只有一个","content":"13.5 zip 的入口只有一个"},"1898":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-67","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#136-pluginslock-归属","content":"13.6 `plugins.lock` 归属"},"1899":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-68","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#137-卸载是否保留数据","content":"13.7 卸载是否保留数据"},"1900":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-69","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"13.8 其它小项"},"1901":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-70","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"附录 A：本仓落点"},"1902":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-71","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/store#相关文档","content":"相关文档"},"1903":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-72","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store","content":"> 读者：本仓维护者 + 商城后端实现者。\n> 本文定义**契约**（目录格式、静态元数据、加载语义、发布与打包规范、索引格式），\n> 并划清三件事的边界：**加载器不碰网络**、**商店客户端只在 TUI 里**、**商城后端不在本仓**。\n> 代码落点见附录 A。\n>\n> 状态标注：\n>\n> | 标记 | 含义 |\n> | --- | --- |\n> | ✅ | **已实现**：本仓当前代码就有（P0 全部落地，2026-11-03） |\n> | 🟡 | **P0 契约已冻结、实施中**：历史标记，当前已无此项 |\n> | ⬜ P0 | **P0 范围内、本仓、还没落地** |\n> | ⬜ P1 | **不在本仓**：外部商城 / 索引托管，本文只给契约与建议 |\n> | 💭 | **待拍板**：见 §13 |\n>\n> **阶段划分**（与本文其余部分一致）：\n>\n> - **分发 P0** = bundle 格式 + 加载器 + CLI 迁移 + **TUI 商店**（都在本仓）\n> - **分发 P1** = 外部商城与索引托管（独立仓库 / 站点，**不在本仓**）\n>\n> ⚠️ **名字撞车**：`docs/ROADMAP.md` 里的 P0 / P1 / P2 指的是**内核 Fiber、`Context` 作用域链、观测性**那三件，\n> 与本文的「分发 P0 / P1」不是一回事。本文一律写「分发 P0」「分发 P1」，避免再混。"},"1904":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-73","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#0-一句话","content":"宿主只吃一种东西：**一个已经解压好的插件目录**。"},"1905":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-74","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#0-一句话","content":"这个目录可以从任何地方来——TUI 商店下载解压、作者 release 手动解压、`plugin install` 复制、\n`plugin migrate` 迁移。**加载器只认目录，永远不碰网络与 zip。**"},"1906":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-75","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#0-一句话","content":"**商店后端**（索引托管、收录审核、站点）：独立仓库 / 站点，不在本仓（分发 P1）。"},"1907":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-76","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#0-一句话","content":"**商店客户端**（拉索引、搜索、下载、校验、解压、安装）：在本仓，但只活在\n`crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs` 这一个模块里（分发 P0 增量）。"},"1908":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-77","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#0-一句话","content":"分界就一句：**网络与 zip 只出现在 `panel/store.rs`，`fuyubot-loader` 不知道有网络这回事。**"},"1909":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-78","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                                                      | 谁做                  | 在本仓？   |\n| ------------------------------------------------------ | ------------------- | ------ |\n| 定义 bundle 格式（`plugins/<id>/` + `plugin.json` + `bin/`） | 本仓 `fuyubot-loader` | ✅ / 🟡 |","table":"table-0"},"1910":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-79","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                      | 谁做                  | 在本仓？ |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------- | ---- |\n| 静态探测（不 dlopen 就能列举、校验） | 本仓 `fuyubot-loader` | 🟡   |","table":"table-0"},"1911":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-80","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                          | 谁做  | 在本仓？   |\n| -------------------------- | --- | ------ |\n| 加载 / 激活 / 卸载语义（含 Go 的特殊处理） | 本仓  | ✅ / 🟡 |","table":"table-0"},"1912":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-81","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                                                        | 谁做     | 在本仓？           |\n| -------------------------------------------------------- | ------ | -------------- |\n| `plugin list` / `install <目录>` / `uninstall` / `migrate` | 本仓 CLI | 🟡（现状是 dll 形态） |","table":"table-0"},"1913":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-82","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                                            | 谁做                                              | 在本仓？ |\n| -------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| **TUI 商店客户端**：拉索引、搜索、详情、下载、sha256、解压、安装 / 卸载 | 本仓 CLI（`crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs`） | ⬜ P0 |","table":"table-0"},"1914":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-83","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                   | 谁做        | 在本仓？ |\n| ------------------- | --------- | ---- |\n| 插件索引的**托管**、收录审核、站点 | **独立商城仓** | ⬜ P1 |","table":"table-0"},"1915":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-84","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事      | 谁做       | 在本仓？       |\n| ------ | -------- | ---------- |\n| zip 打包 | **插件作者** | 契约（本仓只给规范） |","table":"table-0"},"1916":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-85","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事               | 谁做                           | 在本仓？       |\n| --------------- | ---------------------------- | ---------- |\n| Release 托管与资产命名 | **作者 / 商城**（GitHub Releases） | 契约（本仓只给规范） |","table":"table-0"},"1917":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-86","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"| 事                | 谁做        | 在本仓？                 |\n| ---------------- | --------- | -------------------- |\n| 其它宿主（APK 等）自己的商店 | **各宿主自己** | ❌（消费同一份 bundle 契约即可） |","table":"table-0"},"1918":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-87","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-本仓做什么不做什么","content":"一句话的分界：**本仓保证「解压好的目录能被正确加载」，也提供一条「把 zip 变成这个目录」的官方路径\n（TUI 商店）；但这条路只在 `panel/store.rs` 里，加载器不知道它的存在。**"},"1919":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-88","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"把「插件」拆成四层，商店只影响后三层，ABI 一层不动："},"1920":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-89","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"| 层         | 内容                                                                                                           | 谁拥有 | 变动成本                     |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- | ------------------------ |\n| **ABI 层** | `fuyubot-abi` v5：四个导出符号（`plugin_init` / `plugin_start` / `plugin_stop` / `plugin_manifest`）+ `HostApiVTable` | 本仓  | **最高**：一动全部插件重编（见 §13.1） |","table":"table-1"},"1921":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-90","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"| 层        | 内容                                                                           | 谁拥有            | 变动成本     |\n| -------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- | -------- |\n| **分发单元** | 一个目录 = 一个插件：`plugin.json` + `bin/`（+ `src/` `assets/` `config.default.toml`） | 本仓定义格式，任何安装器消费 | 中：改格式要迁移 |","table":"table-1"},"1922":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-91","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"| 层         | 内容                                                           | 谁拥有    | 变动成本      |\n| --------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ | ------ | --------- |\n| **静态元数据** | `plugin.json`（作者声明）、`index.json`（商城推荐）、`plugins.lock`（安装器账本） | 三方各写一份 | 低：加字段向后兼容 |","table":"table-1"},"1923":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-92","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"| 层       | 内容                                                        | 谁拥有 | 变动成本                 |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------------- | --- | -------------------- |\n| **运行时** | `dlopen` → `plugin_init` → 内核 activation → `plugin_start` | 本仓  | 低：入口从 dll 变成 `entry` |","table":"table-1"},"1924":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-93","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-四层哪一层动哪一层不许动","content":"关键结论：**商店的复杂度不应该渗进 ABI。** 一个插件能装、能更新、能被索引，\n靠的是「目录里有静态元数据」，不是「ABI 多几个函数」。"},"1925":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-94","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                           | 层   | 状态          |\n| --------------------------- | --- | ----------- |\n| ABI v5（四符号 + VTable，精确版本校验） | ABI | ✅ 已实现，本文不动它 |","table":"table-2"},"1926":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-95","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                   | 层        | 状态       |\n| ----------------------------------- | -------- | -------- |\n| 平铺 `plugins/*.dll` 发现 + `dlopen` 探测 | 运行时（兼容期） | ✅ 已实现，保留 |","table":"table-2"},"1927":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-96","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                              | 层   | 状态                                           |\n| ------------------------------ | --- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| Go 插件**最后**加载（`unloadable` 分区） | 运行时 | ✅ 已实现（`crates/fuyubot-app/src/app.rs` 的加载队列） |","table":"table-2"},"1928":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-97","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                  | 层   | 状态                                                        |\n| ---------------------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Go 无 `plugin.json` → 拒绝，不 `dlopen` | 运行时 | ✅ `PluginLoader::probe` 读魔数即拒；`probe_for_migration` 是唯一例外 |","table":"table-2"},"1929":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-98","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                           | 层    | 状态                                 |\n| ------------------------------------------- | ---- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `plugins/<id>/` + `plugin.json` + `bin/` 布局 | 分发单元 | ✅ 落地（脚本仍在 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`） |","table":"table-2"},"1930":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-99","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                                                                           | 层   | 状态                                             |\n| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `BundleManifest` / `plugin_entries` / `probe_bundle`（`crates/fuyubot-loader/src/bundle.rs`） | 运行时 | ✅ 落地（`cargo test -p fuyubot-loader` 89 + 17 绿） |","table":"table-2"},"1931":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-100","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                        | 层   | 状态           |\n| ------------------------ | --- | ------------ |\n| `plugin list` 不 `dlopen` | CLI | ✅ 落地（四段静态输出） |","table":"table-2"},"1932":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-101","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                        | 层   | 状态              |\n| ---------------------------------------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `plugin install <目录>` 装到 `plugins/<id>/` | CLI | ✅ 落地（按 kind 路由） |","table":"table-2"},"1933":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-102","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                            | 层   | 状态                             |\n| ---------------------------- | --- | ------------------------------ |\n| `plugin migrate [--dry-run]` | CLI | ✅ 落地（`fuyubot plugin migrate`） |","table":"table-2"},"1934":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-103","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                              | 层    | 状态             |\n| ------------------------------ | ---- | -------------- |\n| 脚本插件仍在 `plugins/scripts/<id>/` | 分发单元 | ✅ 已实现，分发 P0 不动 |","table":"table-2"},"1935":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-104","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                                             | 层           | 状态                                |\n| --------------------------------------------- | ----------- | --------------------------------- |\n| TUI 商店（拉索引 / 搜索 / 下载 / sha256 / 解压 / 安装 / 卸载） | CLI `panel` | ✅ 落地（`panel/store.rs`，21 条单测；§12） |","table":"table-2"},"1936":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-105","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                  | 层   | 状态            |\n| ------------------ | --- | ------------- |\n| 商城后端（索引托管、收录审核、站点） | —   | ⬜ P1，**不在本仓** |","table":"table-2"},"1937":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-106","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项            | 层   | 状态                                   |\n| ------------ | --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 签名（minisign） | —   | ⬜ P1（P0 只做 sha256（索引没有签名字段，不显示签名状态）） |","table":"table-2"},"1938":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-107","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                | 层   | 状态              |\n| ---------------- | --- | --------------- |\n| 静态 `provides` 排序 | 运行时 | ⬜ P0，未排期（§13.4） |","table":"table-2"},"1939":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-108","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"| 项                         | 层   | 状态        |\n| ------------------------- | --- | --------- |\n| `data/plugins/<id>/` 数据目录 | 运行时 | 💭 未定（§9） |","table":"table-2"},"1940":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-109","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#13-状态总表","content":"> P0 已全部落地（2026-11-03）：契约见 插件分发格式 v1，\n> 验证命令 `cargo test -p fuyubot-loader` / `cargo test -p fuyubot-cli` / `cargo build --workspace`。"},"1941":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-110","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"商店生态里最容易出的错是**把某一方的话当成事实**。四份数据各有权威边界："},"1942":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-111","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"| 数据            | 谁写   | 它是什么                | 本仓怎么用                                                        |\n| ------------- | ---- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `plugin.json` | 插件作者 | 作者的**声明**，可能过期、可能写错 | `probe` 读它；`abi` 只是**预检建议值**，真值以 `plugin_init` 返回的 handle 为准 |","table":"table-3"},"1943":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-112","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"| 数据           | 谁写    | 它是什么               | 本仓怎么用                                |\n| ------------ | ----- | ------------------ | ------------------------------------ |\n| `index.json` | 商城 CI | 商城对外的**推荐**，不是本地事实 | **加载路径不读**；TUI 商店读它，但装完仍以本地目录为准（§12） |","table":"table-3"},"1944":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-113","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"| 数据                   | 谁写                  | 它是什么     | 本仓怎么用     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| 已解压的 `plugins/<id>/` | TUI 商店 / 外部安装器 / 用户 | **本地事实** | 本仓唯一信任的东西 |","table":"table-3"},"1945":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-114","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"| 数据             | 谁写        | 它是什么 | 本仓怎么用    |\n| -------------- | --------- | ---- | -------- |\n| `plugins.lock` | 外部安装器（可选） | 复现凭据 | **本仓不读** |","table":"table-3"},"1946":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-115","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"推论（写进契约，别在实现里让步）："},"1947":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-116","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"**索引说 `abi: 5` 不代表真能加载**。宿主必须按真实 handle 判定，装前预检只是「明显不匹配就别装」。"},"1948":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-117","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"**商城挂了不影响宿主启动**。本仓的**加载路径**只读本地目录、零网络（§5.4）。"},"1949":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-118","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#14-谁写谁读信谁","content":"**锁文件不是事实来源**，是「上次装了什么」的备忘；与磁盘不一致时以磁盘为准并提示重建。"},"1950":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-119","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"规则（全部是**本仓读**的规则；写这些目录的只有 `install` / `migrate` 这两个用户显式动作）："},"1951":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-120","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"原生包扫描 `plugins/*/plugin.json`，**只下一层，不递归**。"},"1952":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-121","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"脚本包扫描 `plugins/scripts/*/plugin.json`，同样只下一层，**只用于列举**；\n真正的发现 / 启停仍归 SDK 的 `fuyubot_python_host` / `fuyubot_js_host`。"},"1953":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-122","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"**以 `.` 开头的目录一律跳过**（`.disabled` / `.staging` / `.trash` / `.cache` / `.git`）。"},"1954":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-123","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"目录名**必须等于** `plugin.json` 的 `id`；不一致时**以 `id` 为准并告警**（不拒绝加载）。"},"1955":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-124","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"禁用 = 整个目录挪进 `plugins/.disabled/<id>/`，**不写第二份清单**。\n旧形态的禁用仍是改名 `foo.dll` → `foo.dll.disable`，两种并存到兼容期结束。"},"1956":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-125","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#2-目录布局分发-p0","content":"扫描顺序：bundle 按 `id` 字典序在前，legacy 按文件名在后（`plugin_entries` 的契约）。"},"1957":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-126","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#21-为什么脚本插件不在分发-p0-搬家","content":"脚本插件的「家」目前是 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`，而**认领它的是两个中间插件**（SDK 仓），\n扫描根写死在 SDK 侧。把脚本包挪到 `plugins/<id>/` 意味着跨仓改契约（`AGENTS.md` 约束 51 的发布顺序也要跟着动），\n收益只是「目录树更整齐」。所以分发 P0 明确不动，把统一时机留给 §13.2。"},"1958":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-127","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 语义   | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）        |\n| -------- | --- | ---- | ------------------------------- |\n| `schema` | 是   | 格式版本 | 只认 `1`；更大 → `UnsupportedSchema` |","table":"table-4"},"1959":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-128","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段   | 必填  | 语义           | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                                         |\n| ---- | --- | ------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `id` | 是   | 全局唯一标识，也是目录名 | `[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9._-]*`，≤128，不含路径分隔符，不以 `.` 开头 → 否则 `BadId` |","table":"table-4"},"1960":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-129","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 语义       | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| ------ | --- | -------- | ------------------------ |\n| `name` | 是   | 展示名（可中文） | 非空                       |","table":"table-4"},"1961":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-130","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 语义    | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                                  |\n| --------- | --- | ----- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `version` | 是   | 作者版本号 | 非空，只允许 `[0-9A-Za-z.+-]`；P0 **不强制 semver**（商城阶段建议强制，§13.8） |","table":"table-4"},"1962":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-131","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段     | 必填  | 语义                         | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| ------ | --- | -------------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `kind` | 是   | `native` / `python` / `js` | 枚举外 → 解析失败               |","table":"table-4"},"1963":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-132","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段      | 必填  | 语义        | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                                                      |\n| ------- | --- | --------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `entry` | 是   | 相对包根的真实入口 | 禁绝对路径、`..`、反斜杠开头；解析后必须仍在包内且是文件 → `BadEntry` / `EntryMissing` / `EntryEscapes` |","table":"table-4"},"1964":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-133","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段    | 必填        | 语义            | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                              |\n| ----- | --------- | ------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| `abi` | native 建议 | 静态预检用的**建议值** | 缺失 = 未知（`Probe.abi_version` 为 0，`plugin list` 显示 `?`） |","table":"table-4"},"1965":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-134","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段          | 必填  | 语义              | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                           |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `platforms` | 否   | 空 / `any` = 全平台 | 否则必须含 `current_platform()` → `UnsupportedPlatform` |","table":"table-4"},"1966":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-135","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段        | 必填  | 语义                       | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| --------- | --- | ------------------------ | ------------------------ |\n| `depends` | 否   | 硬依赖：**服务名**，进内核 `inject` | 空字符串忽略                   |","table":"table-4"},"1967":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-136","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段                 | 必填  | 语义                  | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| ------------------ | --- | ------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `optional_depends` | 否   | 软依赖：进 `soft_inject` | 同上                       |","table":"table-4"},"1968":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-137","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段         | 必填  | 语义        | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| ---------- | --- | --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `provides` | 否   | 本插件提供的服务名 | 目前**只用于列举 / 商城展示**（§4.4） |","table":"table-4"},"1969":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-138","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段       | 必填  | 语义       | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| -------- | --- | -------- | ------------------------ |\n| `config` | 否   | 默认配置相对路径 | P0 **只解析、不合并**（§9）       |","table":"table-4"},"1970":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-139","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段                                     | 必填  | 语义  | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`） |\n| -------------------------------------- | --- | --- | ------------------------ |\n| `description` / `license` / `homepage` | 否   | 展示用 | 不校验                      |","table":"table-4"},"1971":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-140","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"| 字段  | 必填  | 语义   | 校验（P0，失败即 `BundleError`）                  |\n| --- | --- | ---- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| 其它  | —   | 未知字段 | **忽略**（向前兼容，别在解析器里 `deny_unknown_fields`） |","table":"table-4"},"1972":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-141","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#32-字段语义与校验","content":"`current_platform()` 返回 `windows-x86_64` / `linux-x86_64` / `macos-aarch64` 这类串，\n**与发布资产命名里的 `<os>-<arch>` 完全一致**——这两处一旦漂移，\n`platforms` 写对了也会被判成不匹配（§5 常见错误）。"},"1973":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-142","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#33-商城阶段建议更严不在本仓","content":"商城 CI 可以在收录时加严，宿主侧不加："},"1974":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-143","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#33-商城阶段建议更严不在本仓","content":"`id` 用反向域名（`com.example.weather`），且与商城条目一一对应；"},"1975":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-144","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#33-商城阶段建议更严不在本仓","content":"`version` 强制 semver（索引要排序、要算「有没有新版」）；"},"1976":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-145","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#33-商城阶段建议更严不在本仓","content":"native 的 `entry` 必须在 `bin/` 下（打包规范，§7）；"},"1977":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-146","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#33-商城阶段建议更严不在本仓","content":"`abi` 必填，且必须等于当前宿主 ABI（商城按宿主版本给不同索引，见 §13.1）。"},"1978":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-147","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#41-三个时刻","content":"三条必须守住的性质："},"1979":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-148","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#41-三个时刻","content":"**`probe_bundle` 绝不 `dlopen`**。这不是优化，是语义：\n「不执行就能知道它是谁」是新格式相对平铺 dll 最实质的好处。\n一个装进来的插件不该为了被列举而跑一遍代码。"},"1980":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-149","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#41-三个时刻","content":"**真正 load 只发生在内核 activation**。`DylibPlugin::apply` 用 `self.entry`\n（不是 `self.path`）去 `start_library`——bundle 的 `path` 是目录，`entry` 才是库。"},"1981":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-150","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#41-三个时刻","content":"**单个插件失败不阻断其余**。扫描 / 探测 / 加载逐项独立，\n一个坏目录的后果是「这个插件没起来 + 一条带路径的 warn」，不是「bot 起不来」。"},"1982":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-151","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#42-probe-不-dlopen-的边界","content":"| 形态                      | 探测方式                                      | 会执行插件代码吗 |\n| ----------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | -------- |\n| `plugins/<id>/`（bundle） | 读 `plugin.json` → 校验 → 读 `entry` 文件魔数判 Go | **不会**   |","table":"table-5"},"1983":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-152","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#42-probe-不-dlopen-的边界","content":"| 形态                        | 探测方式                                                                 | 会执行插件代码吗 |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- | -------- |\n| `plugins/foo.dll`（legacy） | 仍然 `dlopen` + `plugin_init` 问名字（探测完立刻 `stop` / `free_handle`，注册整批回滚） | **会**    |","table":"table-5"},"1984":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-153","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#42-probe-不-dlopen-的边界","content":"| 形态                      | 探测方式                                 | 会执行插件代码吗 |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------ | -------- |\n| `plugins/foo.dll` 且是 Go | **不 dlopen**，直接 `GoRequiresManifest` | 不会       |","table":"table-5"},"1985":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-154","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#42-probe-不-dlopen-的边界","content":"legacy 那一行是兼容期的**已知代价**：平铺 dll 的名字只有运行时才知道（文件名与插件名常常不是一回事），\n宿主没有先验手段。这也是「迁移到 bundle」最实在的理由之一——迁移之后探测不再执行代码。"},"1986":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-155","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"Go 的 `-buildmode=c-shared` 有两条硬限制（`AGENTS.md` 约束 50）："},"1987":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-156","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"**不能卸载**：`dlclose` 之后 Go runtime 的线程再跑一步就是访问违例，所以宿主识别出 Go 就**故意泄漏**句柄到进程结束；"},"1988":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-157","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"**同进程重复加载不可靠**：再 `dlopen` 一次拿到的不一定是「新」的那份。"},"1989":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-158","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"于是「先 `dlopen` 看看它是谁」对 Go 是**不可逆**的：一次探测 = 永久映射 + 后续无法重载。\n所以顺序只能是「先有静态元数据，才允许加载」："},"1990":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-159","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"**最后加载**是另一件事：`fuyubot-app` 把 `probe.go_runtime` 为真的插件排到队列末尾，\n让可卸载的先 settle。依赖顺序仍由内核 fiber 决定，这里只保证「不可逆的那一步晚发生」。"},"1991":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-160","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"两条补充（`AGENTS.md` 约束 60）："},"1992":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-161","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"**唯一允许 `dlopen` Go 的例外是 `probe_for_migration`**（`plugin migrate` 用）。理由：迁移是用户显式触发、\n进程马上退出，永久映射没有后果；但调用方**必须**提示「本次迁移进程会永久映射」。"},"1993":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-162","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"同一个进程里**别放多个会装信号处理器的 Go 插件**——它们会互相抢 handler。"},"1994":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-163","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#43-go为什么必须拒绝为什么最后加载","content":"对商店的推论（写进商城文档）：**Go 插件的「更新」等于「重启进程」**，\n安装器不能承诺「装完即生效」，也不能在同一进程里做「先卸再装」。"},"1995":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-164","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#44-inject-是服务名排序要靠-provides","content":"内核的 `inject` / `soft_inject` 收的是**服务名**（`Context` 按名字寻址的服务表），\n不是插件名、不是文件路径、不是包 id。"},"1996":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-165","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#44-inject-是服务名排序要靠-provides","content":"bundle 的 `depends` / `optional_depends` 在 `Probe.manifest` 里合成成\n`Manifest { inject, soft_inject }`——也就是说 **bundle 不引入新的依赖机制**，只是把声明从运行时搬到了静态文件。"},"1997":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-166","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#44-inject-是服务名排序要靠-provides","content":"优先级（`AGENTS.md` 约束 53）：`plugin_manifest` 该侧非空 → 用它；否则回退 `[plugin.<名>].inject`。\nbundle 的 `depends` 非空就**覆盖**配置里那份，逐侧判定。"},"1998":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-167","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#44-inject-是服务名排序要靠-provides","content":"激活顺序由内核 `reconcile` 按「服务是否可用」推进，**不是**按拓扑排序一次性算好；\n`reconcile` 不许在 `apply` 期间递归推进（约束 54）。"},"1999":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-168","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#44-inject-是服务名排序要靠-provides","content":"**`provides` 目前只用于列举与商城展示**，不参与排序。\n「静态排序」（不 `dlopen` 就把加载顺序排出来）需要 `provides` 建图，属于本仓未排期的增量（⬜ P0），\n做法与代价见 §13.4。"},"2000":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-169","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#45-两个名字两道不同的校验","content":"bundle 里同时存在两个「名字」，别混："},"2001":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-170","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#45-两个名字两道不同的校验","content":"| 比较                              | 不一致时                    | 为什么                                              |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |\n| **目录名** vs `plugin.json` 的 `id` | **以 `id` 为准 + 告警**，照常加载 | 目录可以被人手工改名；`id` 才是身份。`uninstall` 按 `id` 找，所以建议改对 |","table":"table-6"},"2002":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-171","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#45-两个名字两道不同的校验","content":"| 比较                                             | 不一致时                        | 为什么                                                                       |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **`plugin_init` 报的名字** vs `plugin.json` 的 `id` | **拒绝加载**（`AGENTS.md` 约束 59） | 静态元数据是依赖、`[plugin.<id>]` 配置、商店记账的共同键；运行时名字对不上，说明包装错了或清单写错了，继续加载会让三样东西全部错位 |","table":"table-6"},"2003":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-172","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#45-两个名字两道不同的校验","content":"第二条是硬拒绝，不是告警：`plugin.json` 说自己是 A、`plugin_init` 说自己是 B，\n无论信哪个都会有一半东西指错。这种包在**安装阶段**就该被 TUI 商店的 `validate` 拦下来\n（§12.3），加载阶段只是最后一道闸。"},"2004":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-173","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#5-商城架构后端在-p1客户端在-p0","content":"> - **后端**（索引托管、收录审核、站点）：独立仓库 / 站点，**不在本仓**（分发 P1）。\n> - **客户端**（拉索引、下载、sha256、解压、安装）：本仓 TUI（分发 P0，`panel/store.rs`，见 §12）。\n>\n> 本节描述**两边共同遵守的数据契约**：两层数据、缓存、限流。"},"2005":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-174","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#51-为什么数据分两层","content":"| 层       | 放什么                                         | 为什么不能合并                |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------- | ---------------------- |\n| **索引层** | `index.json`：谁存在、有哪些版本、每个版本的资产 URL 与 sha256 | 一个文件就能「浏览全市场」，不必逐个仓库去问 |","table":"table-7"},"2006":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-175","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#51-为什么数据分两层","content":"| 层       | 放什么                                                 | 为什么不能合并                                           |\n| ------- | --------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| **资产层** | GitHub Releases 上的 `<id>-<version>-<os>-<arch>.zip` | 二进制体积大、要 CDN、要长期不变；Releases 的资产 URL 是**稳定精确 URL** |","table":"table-7"},"2007":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-176","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#51-为什么数据分两层","content":"合并成一层（比如「索引里直接塞 zip」）会立刻撞上仓库体积与 CDN 成本；\n合并成「客户端去查 GitHub API」会撞上限流（§5.4）。"},"2008":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-177","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#52-索引层","content":"托管：GitHub Pages（`https://<org>.github.io/<repo>/index.json`）为主，`raw.githubusercontent.com` 为备。"},"2009":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-178","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#52-索引层","content":"缓存：**ETag + TTL**（建议 6 小时）+ 本地缓存；`304` 直接用缓存，不重复解析。**这是 P1 的目标**；\nP0 的 TUI 商店只在内存里拉一次（进商店页 / 按 `r`），不落盘。"},"2010":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-179","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#52-索引层","content":"索引是**纯元数据**：不含插件源码、不含 zip 本体、不含 `releases/latest` 这类会变的链接。"},"2011":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-180","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#52-索引层","content":"索引挂了 / 拉不到 / 解析失败 → TUI 商店保留旧索引、显示「r 重试」，**不报致命错误**。"},"2012":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-181","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#53-资产层","content":"每个版本每个平台一个 zip，URL 形如\n`https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/download/<tag>/<asset>`；"},"2013":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-182","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#53-资产层","content":"索引里存**精确 URL + sha256 + size**，不存「仓库名 + 让我去查最新 release」；"},"2014":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-183","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#53-资产层","content":"`size` 用于下载前预检与进度显示；`sha256` 是**唯一**的完整性依据（见 §7.4）。"},"2015":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-184","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#54-为什么客户端绝不打-github-api","content":"GitHub REST API 未认证是 **60 次/小时/IP**。一个「刷新索引」按钮在 NAT 后面被点几次就 403，\n而用户看到的是「商店坏了」。所以："},"2016":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-185","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#54-为什么客户端绝不打-github-api","content":"索引走 Pages / raw（CDN，无此限流）；"},"2017":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-186","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#54-为什么客户端绝不打-github-api","content":"资产走 `releases/download/<tag>/<asset>`（精确 URL，无 API）；"},"2018":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-187","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#54-为什么客户端绝不打-github-api","content":"**`api.github.com` 只允许出现在商城 CI 里**（发版、生成索引），不出现在任何客户端路径上——\n包括 TUI 商店。"},"2019":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-188","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#55-缓存与失效","content":"| 缓存  | P0 现状                                | 可删？ |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --- |\n| 索引  | **只在内存**（进商店页拉一次、`r` 重拉）；不落盘、不做 ETag | —   |","table":"table-8"},"2020":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-189","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#55-缓存与失效","content":"| 缓存      | P0 现状                          | 可删？ |\n| ------- | ------------------------------ | --- |\n| 下载的 zip | **只在内存**（≤50MB，校验后直接解压）；不落临时文件 | —   |","table":"table-8"},"2021":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-190","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#55-缓存与失效","content":"| 缓存         | P0 现状                           | 可删？ |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------- | --- |\n| 解压 staging | `plugins/.staging/<id>/`（宿主会跳过） | 可以  |","table":"table-8"},"2022":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-191","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#55-缓存与失效","content":"`plugins/.cache/` 是给后续版本（索引 / 资产缓存）预留的，P0 不创建。\n不管谁写缓存，都**别写进 `plugins/<id>/`**——那是只读区（§9.3）。"},"2023":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-192","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#6-release-规范发布契约","content":"> 作者按这一节打包，商城 CI 按这一节校验。本仓不解析这些，只在文档里定义。"},"2024":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-193","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"| 仓库形态     | tag          | 例        |\n| -------- | ------------ | -------- |\n| 一个仓库一个插件 | `v<version>` | `v1.2.0` |","table":"table-9"},"2025":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-194","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"| 仓库形态               | tag               | 例                            |\n| ------------------ | ----------------- | ---------------------------- |\n| 一个仓库多个插件（monorepo） | `<id>-v<version>` | `com.example.weather-v1.2.0` |","table":"table-9"},"2026":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-195","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"规则："},"2027":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-196","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"tag 里的 `<version>` 必须与 zip 内 `plugin.json` 的 `version` **逐字相同**（含 `+build` 元数据）；"},"2028":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-197","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"tag 一旦发布**不许移动**（同一 tag 换资产 = 用户装出来的字节与索引不符）；"},"2029":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-198","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#61-tag","content":"预发布用 GitHub 的 prerelease 标记，索引默认不收录 prerelease。"},"2030":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-199","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#62-资产命名","content":"例："},"2031":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-200","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#62-资产命名","content":"`<os>-<arch>` 与 `plugin.json` 的 `platforms`、宿主的 `current_platform()` **同一套字面量**；"},"2032":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-201","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#62-资产命名","content":"一个 release 可以带多个平台资产，**不要**打「全平台一个 zip 里塞三个 dll」；"},"2033":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-202","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#62-资产命名","content":"zip 文件名里的 `<id>` 必须等于 `plugin.json` 的 `id`（商城 CI 校验，防「文件名钓鱼」）。"},"2034":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-203","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#63-sha256sums","content":"每个 release 附一份 `SHA256SUMS`，**GNU `sha256sum` 格式**（`<hex>  <文件名>`，两个空格）："},"2035":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-204","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#63-sha256sums","content":"理由：本仓 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib-sys/src/build_support.rs` 的 `digest_for` 已经在解析这种格式\n（TDLib 资产的 `SHA256SUMS`），商城 CI 可以复用同一套口径，不必发明第二种校验表。"},"2036":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-205","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#63-sha256sums","content":"> ⚠️ **校验不许静默退化**：索引 / `SHA256SUMS` 缺失或格式不对时，\n> 商店 / 安装器要**拒绝安装并说明原因**，不能像旧的 `<资产>.sha256` 侧车那样「找不到就跳过校验」\n> （`docs/pitfalls.md` 坑 97 记的就是这个）。"},"2037":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-206","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#64-可选-minisign","content":"`SHA256SUMS.minisig`：对 `SHA256SUMS` 的 detached 签名；"},"2038":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-207","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#64-可选-minisign","content":"公钥由商城 / 宿主**预置**（配置可覆盖），**不从被签名的同一来源取**；"},"2039":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-208","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#64-可选-minisign","content":"没有签名时，商店 / 安装器至少要显示**来源 URL**；P0 索引没有签名字段，不要显示成「已校验」。"},"2040":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-209","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#64-可选-minisign","content":"签名**怎么做、要不要在 TUI 商店里强制**见 §13.3；\n本节只定「资产旁边该有什么」。"},"2041":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-210","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#71-布局根--插件目录内容","content":"**不套一层**：解压出来就是 `plugins/<id>/` 的内容。这条与发行包\n（`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`，解压即本体，`AGENTS.md` 约束 49）是同一个规矩——\n生态里「有的包套一层、有的不套」是最烦人的那类不一致。"},"2042":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-211","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#71-布局根--插件目录内容","content":"脚本插件的 zip 额外允许 `src/`、`package.json` / `pyproject.toml` 与 lock 文件，\n但**仍然不许**带 `node_modules` / `.venv`（安装期由中间插件现装）。"},"2043":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-212","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许                  | 禁止                                                                |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `plugin.json`（根，必需） | `node_modules/`、`.venv/`、`target/`、`__pycache__/`、`.git/`、`dist/` |","table":"table-10"},"2044":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-213","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许                | 禁止                         |\n| ----------------- | -------------------------- |\n| `bin/`（动态库 + 兄弟库） | 符号链接（`unix mode 0o120000`） |","table":"table-10"},"2045":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-214","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许               | 禁止                                   |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `src/`、`assets/` | 绝对路径、`..` 路径段、盘符（`C:`）、NTFS ADS（`:`） |","table":"table-10"},"2046":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-215","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许                    | 禁止                                                                 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `config.default.toml` | Windows 保留名（`CON` / `PRN` / `AUX` / `NUL` / `COM1..9` / `LPT1..9`） |","table":"table-10"},"2047":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-216","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许                                | 禁止             |\n| --------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| `README*`、`LICENSE*`、`CHANGELOG*` | 尾随空格 / 尾随点的文件名 |","table":"table-10"},"2048":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-217","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"| 允许                                             | 禁止                                     |\n| ---------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件的 `package.json` / `pyproject.toml` / lock | 大小写不同的同名条目（`Bin/X.dll` vs `bin/x.dll`） |","table":"table-10"},"2049":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-218","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#72-允许--禁止清单","content":"最后一条不是洁癖：Windows 文件系统大小写不敏感，两个「不同」条目解压后会互相覆盖，\n装出来的东西与作者本机不一致，且**没有任何报错**。"},"2050":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-219","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"| 项          | 上限    | 说明        |\n| ---------- | ----- | --------- |\n| 单包（zip 本身） | 50 MB | 超了基本是打错了包 |","table":"table-11"},"2051":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-220","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"| 项    | 上限     | 说明  |\n| ---- | ------ | --- |\n| 总解压后 | 200 MB | 同上  |","table":"table-11"},"2052":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-221","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"| 项   | 上限   | 说明            |\n| --- | ---- | ------------- |\n| 条目数 | 2000 | 防「十万个小文件」拖死安装 |","table":"table-11"},"2053":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-222","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"| 项   | 上限         | 说明                             |\n| --- | ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 压缩比 | > 200:1 告警 | 纯文本天然高压缩比，**只告警不拒绝**，真正兜底靠总量上限 |","table":"table-11"},"2054":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-223","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"⚠️ 数字以 插件分发格式 v1 §7 为准，改一处要两处同步。"},"2055":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-224","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#73-限额与契约一致","content":"⚠️ **限额必须在流式解压时边解边算**，不能先信 zip 头里的 `uncompressed_size`——\n那个字段是攻击者可控的，先信它再分配缓冲区就是最经典的 zip bomb 打法。"},"2056":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-225","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"先按 sha256 校验整包，**通过后才解压**；"},"2057":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-226","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"解压到 `plugins/.staging/<id>-<version>-<rand>/`（与目标同卷，后面才能原子 rename）；"},"2058":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-227","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"逐条目检查：路径归一化（`\\` → `/`）、拒绝 `..` / 绝对路径 / 符号链接 / 保留名、大小写折叠查重；"},"2059":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-228","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"解压完用 `BundleManifest` 再校验一次（`id` / `version` / `entry` 存在 / `platforms` / `abi`）；"},"2060":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-229","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"通过后才 `rename` 到 `plugins/<id>/`（§8.3）。"},"2061":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-230","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#74-解压实现要求tui-商店与外部安装器通用","content":"任何一步失败都要**清掉 staging**，不能留下半个 `plugins/<id>/`——\n宿主虽然能容忍（§8.2），但用户会看到一个「有时在有时不在」的插件。"},"2062":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-231","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"| 入口                            | 做什么                                                                           | 不做什么               |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <目录>` | 把**已解压的**目录复制进 `plugins/<id>/`（`kind = python/js` 仍进 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`） | 不下载、不解压、**不认 zip** |","table":"table-12"},"2063":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-232","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"| 入口                              | 做什么                                                                                                   | 不做什么                                      |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin uninstall <名字>` | 按 `plugins/<id>/` → `plugins/scripts/<id>/` → `.disabled/` 两处 → 平铺 dll（带不带 `lib` / `.disable`）顺序找到并删掉 | 不删 `fuyubot.toml` 里的 `[plugin.<id>]`，不删数据 |","table":"table-12"},"2064":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-233","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"| 入口                                   | 做什么                                              | 不做什么        |\n| ------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------- |\n| `fuyubot plugin migrate [--dry-run]` | 把平铺 dll 搬进 `plugins/<id>/bin/` 并生成 `plugin.json` | 不联网、不合并已有目录 |","table":"table-12"},"2065":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-234","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"| 入口                           | 做什么                                        | 不做什么                      |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------- |\n| **TUI 商店**（`panel/store.rs`） | 拉索引 → 搜索 / 详情 → 下载 → sha256 → 解压 → 安装 / 卸载 | 不改加载语义、不把 zip 概念漏给 loader |","table":"table-12"},"2066":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-235","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"四个入口写出来的都是**同一种东西**：`plugins/<id>/`。这就是整个设计的收敛点。"},"2067":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-236","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#81-本仓在分发-p0-有四个入口","content":"`plugin install` 收到 **zip** 时的行为：**明确报错**，指路「TUI 商店（`fuyubot run --tui` 的商店页），\n或先解压再 `plugin install <目录>`」。\n⚠️ 契约原文写的是「zip 安装属于 P1」；按现在划定的范围，zip 的**唯一入口**是 TUI 商店\n（或用户手动解压），CLI 子命令永远不吃 zip（§13.5）。"},"2068":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-237","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"安装可能由别的进程（TUI 商店 / 外部安装器）在做，宿主必须假设目录可能不完整："},"2069":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-238","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"`plugin.json` 缺失 / 解析失败 → 该目录不是 bundle，**跳过并 warn**（不猜它是什么、不拿目录名当 id）；"},"2070":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-239","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"`entry` 不存在 → `EntryMissing`，跳过这一个；"},"2071":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-240","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"目录名 ≠ `id` → 告警后按 `id` 加载；"},"2072":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-241","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"目录里有 `.staging` / `.cache` 残留 → 以 `.` 开头，天然跳过；"},"2073":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-242","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"**一个坏目录不影响其它插件，也不影响启动**（`probe` 失败只 `continue`）。"},"2074":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-243","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#82-宿主对半成品的容错","content":"这条容错是「商店 / 安装器可以随便折腾」的前提，不要为了「严格」把它收紧成「发现坏目录就拒绝启动」。"},"2075":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-244","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#83-安装流水线tui-商店与外部安装器共用","content":"要点："},"2076":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-245","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#83-安装流水线tui-商店与外部安装器共用","content":"**原子落盘靠同卷 `rename`**：所以 staging 必须放在 `plugins/` 下面（跨卷 rename 会退化成复制，不再原子）；"},"2077":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-246","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#83-安装流水线tui-商店与外部安装器共用","content":"**`id` 决定目标目录名**，不是 zip 文件名——zip 名可以被改，`plugin.json` 是内容；"},"2078":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-247","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#83-安装流水线tui-商店与外部安装器共用","content":"**不合并**：目标已存在就**报错**「先卸载旧版本（按 x）」，绝不「解压覆盖到旧目录上」；\nP0 的「更新」= 先卸载再安装（不自动更新，见 §12.8）；`.trash` 是后续版本的预留，P0 商店不创建。"},"2079":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-248","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#84-两条硬边界windows-映射go-不可卸载","content":"| 边界                        | 现象                                           | 正确做法                                                                                  |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **Windows 上已映射的 dll 删不掉** | 删 / 替换正在被加载的 dll 时报「拒绝访问」/ sharing violation | 装新插件、卸脚本插件**可以在运行中做**（重启生效）；只有**替换 / 删除已映射的原生 dll** 必须停机——按报错提示 `fuyubot stop`，别预先一刀切 |","table":"table-13"},"2080":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-249","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#84-两条硬边界windows-映射go-不可卸载","content":"| 边界            | 现象           | 正确做法                          |\n| ------------- | ------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| **Go 插件永不卸载** | 更新后进程里还是旧的那份 | 更新 Go 插件 = 重启进程；商店不能承诺「装完即生效」 |","table":"table-13"},"2081":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-250","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#84-两条硬边界windows-映射go-不可卸载","content":"推论（写进商城 FAQ）：**分发 P0 没有热更新**。原生插件装完必须重启；\n脚本插件由中间插件的 watch 热加载，那是 SDK 侧的行为，与本契约无关。"},"2082":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-251","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#85-可选账本-pluginslock不在本仓","content":"如果安装器想「换台机器装出一模一样的字节」，可以维护一份账本。格式建议 TOML，放项目根（与 `fuyubot.toml` 同级）："},"2083":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-252","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#85-可选账本-pluginslock不在本仓","content":"它是**派生数据**，可随时重建；与磁盘不一致时以磁盘为准；"},"2084":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-253","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#85-可选账本-pluginslock不在本仓","content":"它的价值是「按 sha256 取，不按 latest 取」——所以重装是**可复现**的；"},"2085":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-254","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#85-可选账本-pluginslock不在本仓","content":"本仓不读它，也不校验它（§1.4）。"},"2086":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-255","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#91-数据分四类别混在一起","content":"| 类别       | 位置                        | 谁写  | 随 zip 分发 | 卸载时  |\n| -------- | ------------------------- | --- | -------- | ---- |\n| **默认配置** | `<包>/config.default.toml` | 作者  | ✅        | 随目录删 |","table":"table-14"},"2087":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-256","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#91-数据分四类别混在一起","content":"| 类别       | 位置                               | 谁写                    | 随 zip 分发 | 卸载时    |\n| -------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------- | -------- | ------ |\n| **用户配置** | `fuyubot.toml` 的 `[plugin.<id>]` | 用户 / 插件的 `set_config` | ❌        | **保留** |","table":"table-14"},"2088":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-257","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#91-数据分四类别混在一起","content":"| 类别        | 位置                             | 谁写   | 随 zip 分发 | 卸载时                  |\n| --------- | ------------------------------ | ---- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| **运行时数据** | `data/plugins/<id>/`（💭 未定，见下） | 插件自己 | ❌        | **保留**（`--purge` 才删） |","table":"table-14"},"2089":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-258","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#91-数据分四类别混在一起","content":"| 类别    | 位置                    | 谁写       | 随 zip 分发 | 卸载时  |\n| ----- | --------------------- | -------- | -------- | ---- |\n| 可丢弃缓存 | `plugins/.cache/`（预留） | 宿主 / 安装器 | ❌        | 可随时删 |","table":"table-14"},"2090":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-259","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#91-数据分四类别混在一起","content":"原则：**bundle 只带默认值，不带用户状态。** 装一个插件不该覆盖用户的配置，\n卸一个插件也不该删用户的数据。"},"2091":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-260","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#92-默认配置怎么用p0-只解析","content":"分发 P0 的契约是「`config` 字段只解析、不合并」。往后有两种做法，选一个拍板："},"2092":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-261","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#92-默认配置怎么用p0-只解析","content":"| 方案       | 做法                                | 代价                                                                                     |\n| -------- | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| A 写进用户配置 | 首次安装把默认值补进 `[plugin.<id>]`（只补缺的键） | `set_config` 落盘是 `toml::to_string_pretty` **全量重写**（约束 52），注释会丢；写进去的键用户再也分不清「默认」还是「我设的」 |","table":"table-15"},"2093":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-262","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#92-默认配置怎么用p0-只解析","content":"| 方案      | 做法                                               | 代价                                                               |\n| ------- | ------------------------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| B 运行时兜底 | 默认值留在包里，`get_config` 未命中时宿主查该 owner 的 bundle 默认值 | 宿主要在 `get_config` 里多一次「section → bundle」映射；语义更干净，用户配置里只有用户真正设过的键 |","table":"table-15"},"2094":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-263","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#92-默认配置怎么用p0-只解析","content":"建议 **B**。A 会在用户配置里留下一堆「删不掉的默认值」，而且与「注释会丢」的全量重写叠在一起，\n每次保存都在改写用户的文件。"},"2095":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-264","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#93-插件目录安装后只读","content":"宿主与插件**都不往 `plugins/<id>/` 里写**（日志、缓存、数据库一律不落这里）；"},"2096":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-265","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#93-插件目录安装后只读","content":"想写东西：配置走 `set_config`，数据走 `data/plugins/<id>/`（💭）或用户配置里指定的路径；"},"2097":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-266","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#93-插件目录安装后只读","content":"「只读」目前是**约定**，不是强制（没有 chmod / ACL）。真要强制是另一个量级的改动，\n而且 Windows 上给目录设 ACL 会把「用户想手动改个文件」也一起挡住——先按约定走。"},"2098":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-267","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#93-插件目录安装后只读","content":"⚠️ 现状提醒：今天插件的相对路径落在**项目根**（`run` 在加载插件前切了 `cwd`，\n`crates/fuyubot-cli/src/main.rs`），所以「插件把缓存写到配置文件旁边」是当前的实际行为。\n`data/plugins/<id>/` 还没实现，别在文档里写成既成事实。"},"2099":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-268","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#10-索引条目示例与商城治理分发-p1--后端不在本仓","content":"> 索引的**字段语义以 插件分发格式 v1 §7 为准**（TUI 商店按它消费）；\n> 本节补的是「示例 + 商城怎么产出它」。"},"2100":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-269","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"字段约定（契约 §7 的要点）："},"2101":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-270","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`assets` 是**按平台名做键的对象**，不是数组；平台名与 `current_platform()` 同一套字面量；"},"2102":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-271","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"选择顺序：**精确匹配当前平台 → 回退 `any` → 都没有 = 该平台不可用**；"},"2103":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-272","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`sha256` **必填**（大小写不敏感）；`size` 可选，只做显示与预检；"},"2104":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-273","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`abi` 大于宿主 `ABI_VERSION` → 明确报「需要更新的宿主」，**不下载**；"},"2105":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-274","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`yanked: true` 的版本不参与选择；"},"2106":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-275","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`api` 是版本兼容区间，与 `abi` 不是一回事（`abi` = VTable 版本，加载时精确相等）；"},"2107":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-276","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"下载 URL 只允许 `https`；"},"2108":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-277","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"未知字段忽略 → 商城可以自行加 `generated_at` / `provides` 之类的扩展字段，客户端别依赖它们。"},"2109":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-278","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"商城侧的约定："},"2110":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-279","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`url` 由**商城 CI 生成**，不接受提交者手写（防钓鱼、防写错）；"},"2111":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-280","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`sha256` / `size` 由 CI 下载资产后计算，与作者提交的 `SHA256SUMS` 交叉校验；"},"2112":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-281","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"`latest` 只是展示用，**装哪个版本必须显式指定**（别把 `latest` 当安装依据）；"},"2113":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-282","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#101-indexjson-示例","content":"一个插件一个条目，多版本在 `versions` 里；不同 ABI 的同一版本算**不同条目**（§13.1）。"},"2114":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-283","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#104-签名p1","content":"索引签名（`index.json.minisig`）比资产签名更重要：**索引能改，就能把任何资产换成自己的**；"},"2115":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-284","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#104-签名p1","content":"公钥由宿主 / 商店**预置**，配置可覆盖但**不从索引本身取**；"},"2116":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-285","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#104-签名p1","content":"**P0 不校签名**：TUI 商店只做 sha256 + 「此包未签名」提示（§13.3）；"},"2117":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-286","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#104-签名p1","content":"签名保护的是「下载」这一步，不是「加载」这一步——宿主加载本地目录时不需要它。"},"2118":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-287","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-镜像--离线--可复现","content":"| 需求  | 谁负责                                  | 做法                                            | 注意                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------- |\n| 镜像  | TUI 商店（P0 用 `registry_url`；前缀改写属 P1） | 把 `[plugins].registry_url` 指到镜像的 `index.json` | 索引与资产必须**同源**；只改资产等于让镜像能换字节 |","table":"table-16"},"2119":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-288","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-镜像--离线--可复现","content":"| 需求  | 谁负责         | 做法                                                               | 注意             |\n| --- | ----------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | -------------- |\n| 离线  | 用户 / TUI 商店 | 手动把 zip 拷进来 → 解压到 `plugins/<id>/` → 重启；P0 商店没有落盘索引，离线时只显示错误与已装插件 | 不需要任何命令；解压工具不限 |","table":"table-16"},"2120":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-289","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-镜像--离线--可复现","content":"| 需求  | 谁负责       | 做法                                       | 注意                                  |\n| --- | --------- | ---------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| 可复现 | 外部安装器（可选） | 按 `plugins.lock` 里的 sha256 取，不按 `latest` | 本仓不读 lock；没有 lock 时至少把 sha256 显示给用户 |","table":"table-16"},"2121":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-290","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-镜像--离线--可复现","content":"| 需求  | 谁负责    | 做法                                         | 注意                     |\n| --- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ | ---------------------- |\n| 降级  | TUI 商店 | 索引拉不到 → 显示错误 + 已装插件，标「商店不可用」；**不影响 `run`** | 别把「商店不可用」升级成「bot 不能启动」 |","table":"table-16"},"2122":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-291","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#11-镜像--离线--可复现","content":"安全提醒：在签名（§6.4）落地之前，「索引 + 资产都走镜像」等价于**完全信任镜像**。\n要么接受这一点，要么先做索引签名。"},"2123":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-292","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#12-tui-商店分发-p0","content":"> **位置：`crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs`（单文件模块）。**\n> 不新建 crate、不进 `fuyubot-loader`、不进运行时。这是整个仓库里**唯一**允许出现\n> 「HTTP」和「zip」两个词的地方。\n>\n> 入口：`fuyubot run --tui`（`-t`）→ 商店页。面板本身不接 TDLib、不加载插件（既有约定）。"},"2124":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-293","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#121-职责边界四层不许串味","content":"| 层                      | 能做                                         | 绝对不能做                                             |\n| ---------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `fuyubot-loader` / 运行时 | 读本地 `plugins/<id>/`、`probe`、`dlopen`、激活、回滚 | 网络、zip、解压、写 `plugins/`（`install`/`migrate` 的复制除外） |","table":"table-17"},"2125":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-294","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#121-职责边界四层不许串味","content":"| 层                                                | 能做            | 绝对不能做  |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------- | ------ |\n| CLI 子命令（`plugin list/install/uninstall/migrate`） | 本地目录复制、删目录、迁移 | zip、下载 |","table":"table-17"},"2126":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-295","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#121-职责边界四层不许串味","content":"| 层                            | 能做                             | 绝对不能做                           |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------- |\n| **TUI 商店（`panel/store.rs`）** | 拉索引、搜索、详情、下载、sha256、解压、安装 / 卸载 | 改 ABI、改加载语义、把「zip」这个概念漏给 loader |","table":"table-17"},"2127":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-296","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#121-职责边界四层不许串味","content":"| 层             | 能做           | 绝对不能做      |\n| ------------- | ------------ | ---------- |\n| 外部商城后端（分发 P1） | 索引托管、收录审核、站点 | 决定本仓怎么加载插件 |","table":"table-17"},"2128":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-297","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#121-职责边界四层不许串味","content":"一句话：**网络与解压只活在 `panel/store.rs`；`fuyubot-loader` 永远不知道有网络这回事。**"},"2129":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-298","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么              | 细节                                                    |\n| --- | ---------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 拉索引 | GET `index.json` | 进商店页拉一次、`r` 重拉；失败保留旧索引并显示「r 重试」（P0 不落盘缓存、不做 ETag/TTL） |","table":"table-18"},"2130":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-299","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么                                       | 细节                 |\n| --- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------------ |\n| 搜索  | 本地内存过滤 `id` / `name` / `tags` / `summary` | **不做服务端搜索**，索引就那么大 |","table":"table-18"},"2131":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-300","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么                                  | 细节       |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ | -------- |\n| 详情  | 版本、平台、大小、sha256、依赖、许可证、主页、release 链接 | 全部来自索引条目 |","table":"table-18"},"2132":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-301","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么                                         | 细节                        |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| 安装  | 下载 → sha256 → staging 解压 → 校验 manifest → 落盘 | 目标已存在就报错（先卸载），不覆盖；见 §12.3 |","table":"table-18"},"2133":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-302","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么                                              | 细节                |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------------ | ----------------- |\n| 更新  | **P0 不支持原地更新**：先卸载再装（卸载会删目录，数据在 `data/`/配置里不受影响） | 只提示有新版本，**不自动更新** |","table":"table-18"},"2134":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-303","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#122-功能清单","content":"| 功能  | 做什么               | 细节                       |\n| --- | ----------------- | ------------------------ |\n| 卸载  | 删 `plugins/<id>/` | 删已映射的原生 dll 需先停实例（§12.5） |","table":"table-18"},"2135":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-304","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#123-安装流水线","content":"与 §8.3 是**同一条流水线**：TUI 商店是本仓的实现，外部安装器可以照抄。\n两边必须遵守同一套约束（同卷 rename、id 决定目录名、不合并、目标已存在就报错）。"},"2136":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-305","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#124-依赖账已定","content":"| 需要   | 现状                                                                            | 结论                    |\n| ---- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| HTTP | `ureq` 已在 `[workspace.dependencies]`（原先只被 `fuyubot-tdlib` 当 build-dependency） | ✅ 已加 `fuyubot-cli` 依赖 |","table":"table-19"},"2137":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-306","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#124-依赖账已定","content":"| 需要     | 现状                                  | 结论                    |\n| ------ | ----------------------------------- | --------------------- |\n| sha256 | `sha2` 已在 workspace（原先只服务 vendored） | ✅ 已加 `fuyubot-cli` 依赖 |","table":"table-19"},"2138":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-307","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#124-依赖账已定","content":"| 需要     | 现状             | 结论                                                       |\n| ------ | -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| zip 解压 | 原 workspace 没有 | ✅ 新增 `zip = \"4.6.1\"`（`deflate-flate2-zlib-rs`，纯 Rust 后端） |","table":"table-19"},"2139":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-308","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#124-依赖账已定","content":"| 需要  | 现状  | 结论                                           |\n| --- | --- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| 签名  | 无   | **P1**；P0 只做 sha256（索引没有签名字段，不显示签名状态）（§13.3） |","table":"table-19"},"2140":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-309","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#124-依赖账已定","content":"`AGENTS.md` 约束 9 已补例外：`fuyubot-cli` 的 TUI 商店可以依赖 `ureq` / `sha2` / `zip`，\n它们不在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 normal 树里，不违反「运行时依赖图」那条。"},"2141":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-310","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#125-与实例状态的关系","content":"**不一律拒绝**：装一个新插件目录、卸一个脚本插件目录，实例在跑也允许——只是**原生插件要重启才生效**；"},"2142":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-311","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#125-与实例状态的关系","content":"唯一真会失败的是 **Windows 上删 / 替换正在映射的 dll**（`拒绝访问` / sharing violation）。\n这种情况按报错提示「先 `fuyubot stop`」即可，不要预先一刀切拒绝所有操作；"},"2143":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-312","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#125-与实例状态的关系","content":"TUI 自己 `spawn` 的 `fuyubot run --background` 同样算「在跑」；"},"2144":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-313","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#125-与实例状态的关系","content":"安装成功后**不自动重启**实例：提示「重启生效」。Go 插件更是只能重启（§4.3）。"},"2145":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-314","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#126-安全要求和外部安装器同一套","content":"sha256 不匹配 → 拒绝安装，显示**期望值与实际值**（别只说「校验失败」）；"},"2146":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-315","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#126-安全要求和外部安装器同一套","content":"P0 索引没有签名字段：**不显示「已签名」、也不假装校验过**；信任链（minisign）等 P1，"},"2147":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-316","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#126-安全要求和外部安装器同一套","content":"zip 限额、路径穿越、符号链接、大小写折叠查重全部按 §7.3 / §7.4 执行；"},"2148":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-317","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#126-安全要求和外部安装器同一套","content":"只写 `plugins/.staging/`、`plugins/<id>/`、`plugins/scripts/<id>/` 三个位置，别的地方一个字节都不碰；"},"2149":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-318","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#126-安全要求和外部安装器同一套","content":"失败一律清 staging，不留半个插件目录。"},"2150":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-319","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#127-配置分发-p0","content":"索引地址是**平铺在 `[plugins]` 里**的一个键，与 `dir` / `log_level` 同级："},"2151":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-320","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#127-配置分发-p0","content":"解析顺序：`FUYUBOT_REGISTRY_URL` → `[plugins].registry_url` → **未配置**（商店页空态 + 配置指引）；\n官方商城地址是 `https://catmoecircle.github.io/FuyuBot-plugins/index.json`，但**不硬编码默认值**：\n用户显式配置才联网（模板里给了注释示例）。"},"2152":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-321","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#127-配置分发-p0","content":"**`[plugins.store]` 这种嵌套段属于 P1**（镜像 / TTL / 强制签名），P0 不实现，别照着写配置；"},"2153":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-322","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#127-配置分发-p0","content":"P0 想做镜像就改 `registry_url` 指向镜像的 `index.json`——索引与资产同源，\n顺带避开「只换资产、不换索引」那个信任问题（§11）。"},"2154":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-323","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#128-非目标","content":"不做评分 / 评论 / 账号；"},"2155":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-324","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#128-非目标","content":"不做自动更新（只提示）；"},"2156":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-325","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#128-非目标","content":"不做增量 / 差分更新；"},"2157":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-326","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#128-非目标","content":"不在 TUI 里跑插件、不改插件配置（配置仍归 `fuyubot.toml`）；"},"2158":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-327","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#128-非目标","content":"不做「商城后端」——那是分发 P1、独立仓库。"},"2159":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-328","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#129-其它宿主","content":"`fuyubot-android` 只交付 `libfuyubotjni.so`，不出 APK / UI（`AGENTS.md`）。\nAPK 作者要商店就自己实现一个，**消费同一份 bundle 契约**即可；\n本仓不提供、也不要求任何宿主复用 `panel/store.rs`。"},"2160":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-329","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"**现状**：`load_with_config` / `probe` 里都是 `handle.abi_version != ABI_VERSION` → `AbiMismatch`，\n**精确相等**。`ABI_VERSION = 5`。"},"2161":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-330","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"**为什么商店会放大代价**：每次 ABI bump，索引里所有插件的 `abi` 全部过期，\n用户升级宿主后看到的是「昨天还能用的插件今天全红」，而且没有任何平滑路径。"},"2162":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-331","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"| 方案               | 做法                              | 代价                             |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------ |\n| **A 维持精确相等**（现状） | 索引按 `abi` 分版本；宿主升级时提示「这些插件需要新版」 | 每次 bump = 全量重编 + 索引重发；用户可感知的断裂 |","table":"table-20"},"2163":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-332","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"| 方案               | 做法                                                                             | 代价                                                          |\n| ---------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | ----------------------------------------------------------- |\n| **B 大版本 + 长度协商** | `ABI_VERSION` 拆 `(major, minor)`；VTable 头加 `size`；minor 只追加尾部字段，宿主按 `size` 取交集 | 要改 `HostApiVTable` 布局（**这本身就是破坏性变更**，必须挑一次大版本做，v6）；所有插件重编一次 |","table":"table-20"},"2164":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-333","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"| 方案                | 做法                 | 代价                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------ | -------------------------- |\n| **C 宿主带 N-1 兼容层** | 宿主同时支持 v5 / v6 两套桥 | 桥接代码翻倍、长期不可持续；只在「关键插件」场景值得 |","table":"table-20"},"2165":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-334","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"**建议**：现在走 A（并且把 `abi` 写进索引、安装前预检），把 B 排进 v6 的设计里**一次做完**。\n不要试图「悄悄地」让 v5 插件跑在 v6 宿主上——VTable 大小变了，跑起来是 UB，不是报错。"},"2166":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-335","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#131-abi-兼容策略","content":"**同时要拍板**：索引是否按宿主 ABI 分目录（`/v5/index.json`、`/v6/index.json`）。\n分的话老宿主永远能拉到能用的插件；不分就得靠客户端过滤，容易漏。"},"2167":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-336","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#132-目录统一时机","content":"现状：原生 `plugins/<id>/`，脚本 `plugins/scripts/<id>/`。"},"2168":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-337","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#132-目录统一时机","content":"| 选项     | 做法                     | 代价                   |\n| ------ | ---------------------- | -------------------- |\n| A 永不统一 | `scripts/` 作为脚本的稳定命名空间 | 两套扫描逻辑长期并存；zip 布局分两种 |","table":"table-21"},"2169":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-338","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#132-目录统一时机","content":"| 选项          | 做法                             | 代价                                                |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| B 将来统一（未排期） | 全部 `plugins/<id>/`，用 `kind` 区分 | 要改 SDK 中间插件的扫描根（跨仓），且 `AGENTS.md` 约束 51 的发布顺序要跟着动 |","table":"table-21"},"2170":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-339","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#132-目录统一时机","content":"| 选项        | 做法                    | 代价                        |\n| --------- | --------------------- | ------------------------- |\n| C 宿主指定扫描根 | 中间插件从宿主配置读扫描根，目录形态随宿主 | 契约变更（中间插件要认一个新配置键），但比 B 轻 |","table":"table-21"},"2171":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-340","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#132-目录统一时机","content":"**建议**：分发 P0/P1 都不动（选 A 的现状），等中间插件支持「宿主指定扫描根」（C）之后再谈 B。\n真正该先做的是「让 `plugin list` 把两种形态都列清楚」，而不是搬家。"},"2172":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-341","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#133-tui-商店的依赖与签名","content":"**依赖（已定）**：`fuyubot-cli` 已加 `ureq` / `sha2` / `zip`（§12.4），\nCLI 是唯一带网络与解压能力的 crate；`AGENTS.md` 约束 9 已补例外。"},"2173":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-342","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#133-tui-商店的依赖与签名","content":"**签名**：P0 索引没有签名字段，**不显示签名状态**、也不假装校验过；minisign 等 P1。"},"2174":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-343","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#133-tui-商店的依赖与签名","content":"**索引可信度**：索引由商城 CI 生成；如果索引本身被换掉，sha256 也跟着换——所以\n索引签名比资产签名更重要。这也是「签名等 P1」的前提：P1 之前，索引必须从**固定官方 URL** 拉。"},"2175":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-344","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#134-静态-provides-排序是否值得做","content":"收益：不 `dlopen` 就能排出加载顺序，并在**安装时**发现「依赖的服务没人提供」；"},"2176":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-345","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#134-静态-provides-排序是否值得做","content":"代价：`provides` 是作者声明，可能与实际 `provide_service` 不一致（声明了没提供 → 排序对了也起不来）；\n还要定义「缺提供者」怎么报（建议：**硬依赖缺提供者 = 安装时警告**；启动时按现有内核行为处理——\n`inject` 缺服务就是停在 Waiting 不激活，不要为此新增一种致命错误）。"},"2177":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-346","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#135-zip-的入口只有一个","content":"契约（`bundle.mdx` §6）已按这个口径改好：**CLI 的 `plugin install` 不处理 zip；\nzip 只由 TUI 商店消费（或用户手动解压）**。这样「谁能吃 zip」只有一个答案，\n不会出现「CLI 一个半吊子解压 + TUI 一个完整解压」。"},"2178":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-347","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#136-pluginslock-归属","content":"本文把它划给安装器（§8.5）。如果将来希望宿主也能「按锁文件校验已装插件」，\n那是一条新的本仓增量（只读校验，不做安装），需要单独排期。"},"2179":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-348","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#137-卸载是否保留数据","content":"建议：`uninstall` **只删插件目录**，保留 `[plugin.<id>]` 配置与 `data/plugins/<id>/`；\n另给 `--purge` 显式删数据（并二次确认）。现在的 `uninstall` 已经是「只删目录」，保持一致。"},"2180":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-349","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"| 项             | 建议                        |\n| ------------- | ------------------------- |\n| `id` 是否强制反向域名 | 本仓不强制（本地插件随便叫）；**商城收录强制** |","table":"table-22"},"2181":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-350","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"| 项                     | 建议                       |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------ |\n| `version` 是否强制 semver | 本仓 P0 不强制；商城强制（要排序、要判新版） |","table":"table-22"},"2182":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-351","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"| 项              | 建议                                                 |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 一个 zip 能否装多个插件 | **禁止**：一 zip 一插件。否则 `id` / 目标目录 / 原子替换 / 锁文件全部要重设计 |","table":"table-22"},"2183":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-352","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"| 项               | 建议                               |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `abi` 缺失时是否拒绝安装 | 不拒绝，`plugin list` 显示 `?`，真值加载时判定 |","table":"table-22"},"2184":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-353","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#138-其它小项","content":"| 项                       | 建议                                                                    |\n| ----------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 是否允许插件自带 `bin/` 之外的 dll | 允许（兄弟库），但**只 `dlopen` `entry` 那一个**；兄弟库靠 `open_library` 的同目录查找（约束 30） |","table":"table-22"},"2185":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-354","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                              | 职责                                           | 状态   |\n| ------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| `crates/fuyubot-abi/src/lib.rs` | `ABI_VERSION = 5`、`SYM_*` 常量、`HostApiVTable` | ✅ 不动 |","table":"table-23"},"2186":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-355","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                                    | 职责                                                                                                               | 状态   |\n| ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ---- |\n| `crates/fuyubot-loader/src/bundle.rs` | `BundleManifest` / `BundleError` / `plugin_entries` / `script_bundles` / `disabled_bundles` / `current_platform` | ✅ 落地 |","table":"table-23"},"2187":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-356","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                                    | 职责                                                                                  | 状态     |\n| ------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `crates/fuyubot-loader/src/loader.rs` | `probe` / `probe_bundle` / `probe_entry` / `DylibPlugin` / `plugin_files` / `Probe` | ✅ 扩展完成 |","table":"table-23"},"2188":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-357","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                                 | 职责             | 状态  |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------- | --- |\n| `crates/fuyubot-loader/src/lib.rs` | `pub use` 新公开面 | ✅   |","table":"table-23"},"2189":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-358","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                              | 职责                                        | 状态           |\n| ------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `crates/fuyubot-app/src/app.rs` | 加载队列、Go 分区（`unloadable`）、`probe_entry` 调用 | ✅ 新 API 接线完成 |","table":"table-23"},"2190":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-359","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                                   | 职责                                                                                                                    | 状态        |\n| ------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --------- |\n| `crates/fuyubot-cli/src/scaffold.rs` | `install` / `install_script_dir` / `uninstall` / `install_builtins` / `find_artifact` / `script_metadata` / `migrate` | ✅ 目录化改造完成 |","table":"table-23"},"2191":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-360","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                               | 职责                                          | 状态  |\n| -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| `crates/fuyubot-cli/src/main.rs` | `plugin list`（去 `dlopen`）/ `plugin migrate` | ✅   |","table":"table-23"},"2192":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-361","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"| 位置                                      | 职责                                                                          | 状态           |\n| --------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------ |\n| `crates/fuyubot-cli/src/panel/store.rs` | TUI 商店：索引 / 搜索 / 详情 / 下载 / sha256 / 解压 / 安装 / 卸载（**唯一**允许出现 HTTP 与 zip 的模块） | ✅ 落地（21 条单测） |","table":"table-23"},"2193":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-362","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#附录-a本仓落点","content":"新增依赖：**加载器与运行时零新增**（`serde_json` 已有）；TUI 商店要 `ureq` / `sha2` / `zip`，\n只加在 `fuyubot-cli`（§12.4）。\nzip / sha256 / HTTP 只出现在 `panel/store.rs`（以及外部安装器）里，\n`fuyubot-loader` 与运行时的依赖图**一个都不沾**——这也是「边界划在模块级」的实际好处。"},"2194":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-363","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#相关文档","content":"插件分发格式 v1：分发 P0 的**权威契约**（本文与它冲突时以它为准）"},"2195":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-364","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#相关文档","content":"插件迁移：用户与作者的迁移指南"},"2196":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-365","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#相关文档","content":"`docs/design-script-plugin-v2.md`：脚本插件（中间插件 + 一脚本一进程）"},"2197":{"id":"/docs/plugin/store-366","page_id":"/docs/plugin/store","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/store#相关文档","content":"`AGENTS.md`：约束 9 / 18 / 30 / 49 / 50 / 52 / 53 / 54 / 57 / **59 / 60 / 61** 与本文直接相关"},"2198":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"page","content":"调用 TDLib","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib"},"2199":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"td_invoke、请求号与 response 通道、便捷封装"},"2200":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号与 response 通道"},"2201":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"方法名以 TDLib 为准"},"2202":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"便捷封装：`fuyubot-simplify`"},"2203":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"等到什么才返回"},"2204":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"回调里用 `*_then`"},"2205":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"最小上手"},"2206":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"两条时间线"},"2207":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"Python / JS"},"2208":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"插件不直接碰 `tdjson` 库，只把请求交给宿主："},"2209":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数   | 输入                       | 用途     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------ | ------ |\n| `td_invoke` | 完整请求 JSON（**含 `@type`**） | 手写整份请求 |","table":"table-0"},"2210":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数              | 输入            | 用途                                                |\n| ---------------------- | ------------- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_invoke_simplified` | 方法名 + 参数 JSON | 宿主把参数补上 `@type = 方法名`（参数不是对象就整份换成 `{\"@type\": …}`） |","table":"table-0"},"2211":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"| VTable 函数    | 输入                   | 用途                                                                    |\n| ------------ | -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `td_execute` | 完整请求 JSON，**同步**返回响应 | 只给「不碰服务器」的方法用（`parseTextEntities` / `getTextEntities` 之类）。当场有结果、不发请求号 |","table":"table-0"},"2212":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","content":"前两个返回**请求号**（`RequestId`），不是结果。结果从响应通道回来。"},"2213":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号把去程与回程对上"},"2214":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件调 td_invoke 拿到请求号，宿主注入字符串 @extra 后发给 TDLib；响应回来时接收循环按 @extra 认出归属，转成数值 request_id，再经 emit_scoped 只发回发起这个请求的插件。"},"2215":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"去程"},"2216":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"插件"},"2217":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"td_invoke → 请求号 N"},"2218":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"HostRuntime"},"2219":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"注入 @extra = \"N\""},"2220":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"TDLib"},"2221":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"真的发出去"},"2222":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"请求号"},"2223":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应回来"},"2224":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"回程"},"2225":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"接收循环 route()"},"2226":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"按 @extra 认出归属"},"2227":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"emit_scoped"},"2228":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"response 通道"},"2229":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"发起的插件"},"2230":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"过滤器 request_id = N"},"2231":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"同一条 @extra 把去程和回程对上；没接 TDLib 时只发合成请求号，永远等不到响应"},"2232":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"响应负载是 TDLib 原始 JSON，宿主额外挂一个**数值型** `request_id`（来自它注入的字符串 `@extra`，\n别自己设这个字段）。"},"2233":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"要等某条响应：过滤器写 `{\"event_type\":\"response\",\"request_id\":5}`。`event_type` 键只选通道，\n不参与负载匹配（见 订阅与事件）。"},"2234":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"**没接 TDLib 时**（`--replay` / `--no-tdlib`）请求只留档并返回**合成请求号**（从 `1 << 48` 起），\n链路照样能测通，但永远不会真的到达 TDLib。"},"2235":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#请求号与-response-通道","content":"`wait_for_update` **阻塞当前线程**，`timeout_ms == 0` 表示只检查当前状态；\n返回的 `payload_json` 是宿主线程局部缓冲，只在下一次宿主调用前有效——要留就当场拷走。"},"2236":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"⚠️ **TDLib 的方法名 ≠ Telegram Bot API 的方法名**。TDLib 里所有发送都是 `sendMessage`，\n内容类型靠 `input_message_content` 区分；`sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation`\n（HTTP Bot API）**在 TDLib 里不存在**。"},"2237":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                          |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `sendPhoto` / `sendDocument` / `sendLocation` | `sendMessage` + `input_message_content.@type` = `inputMessagePhoto` / `inputMessageDocument` / `inputMessageLocation` |","table":"table-1"},"2238":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的     | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                                                                                                                                        |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `message_thread_id` | `topic_id`，类型是 `MessageTopic`——**论坛**群组用 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicForum\",\"forum_topic_id\":N}`，**非论坛**群组的评论串才是 `{\"@type\":\"messageTopicThread\",\"message_thread_id\":N}`（用 `Topic` 就不会选错） |","table":"table-1"},"2239":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的       | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                        |\n| --------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `reply_to_message_id` | `reply_to`（`{\"@type\":\"inputMessageReplyToMessage\",\"message_id\":N}`） |","table":"table-1"},"2240":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的                               | 在 TDLib 里这么写                            |\n| --------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `disable_notification` / `protect_content` | `options`（`@type: messageSendOptions`）里 |","table":"table-1"},"2241":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                       |\n| --------------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| 顶层 `caption`    | 在内容类型里（`inputMessageText` / `inputMessagePhoto` …） |","table":"table-1"},"2242":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的 | 在 TDLib 里这么写                                                             |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `parse_mode`    | 没有这个字段；`formattedText` 只有 `text` + `entities`（要标记先走 `parseTextEntities`） |","table":"table-1"},"2243":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"| 你在 Bot API 里习惯的         | 在 TDLib 里这么写         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------- |\n| `file_id`（`updateFile`） | 在 **`file.id`**，不是顶层 |","table":"table-1"},"2244":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"`sendMessage` 的真签名（来自 `td_api.tl`）："},"2245":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#方法名以-tdlib-为准","content":"查方法名最快的办法是问 SDK（它读的是真 `td_api.tl`）："},"2246":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"`Simplify` 只简化**输入**，不改变输出：每个方法都经 `td_invoke*` 发出，原始更新照旧对插件可见。\n参数形状是**一个方法一个结构体 + 短字段名**，调用方不用拼 TDLib 的嵌套 JSON；\n文本格式（Markdown / HTML）**不自己解析**，经同步的 `td_execute` 问 TDLib 的 `parseTextEntities`。"},"2247":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#便捷封装fuyubot-simplify","content":"它的**完整 API 参考（按功能范围分组）在 Simplify 封装**；\n想知道为什么这么拼、为什么这么等，看开发 › simplify 封装是怎么实现的。\n本页只留跟「请求号 + 线程」有关的那两件事——它们是这层最容易被搞错的部分。"},"2248":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**每个方法都等到结果才返回**，不交回请求号。分两类："},"2249":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                               | 等到什么                                                                                                    | 返回值                                   |\n| ------------------------------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| 发送类（`send_message` / `send_message_album` / 富消息） | 响应（**还没发出去**的临时消息）+ 它的**发送结局**：`updateMessageSendSucceeded`（里面有最终 `Message`）或 `updateMessageSendFailed` | 最终 `Message`（相册是与 `medias` 同序的 `Vec`） |","table":"table-2"},"2250":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"| 类别                                                        | 等到什么     | 返回值                  |\n| --------------------------------------------------------- | -------- | -------------------- |\n| 其余（`edit_*` / `delete_message` / `answer_callback_query`） | 只有**响应** | 改完的 `Message` / `()` |","table":"table-2"},"2251":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"两步之间按临时消息的 `old_message_id` 精确对号，同一会话里别人的结局不会串进来；"},"2252":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"相册的 `timeout_ms` 是**整组共用**的一个预算（先等 `Messages` 响应、再等 N 条结局），不是每项各等一次；"},"2253":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"**超时先撤回**：到期还没结局，就先 `deleteMessages(revoke = true)` 把那条没发出去的消息撤掉，再返回\n`Timeout`——发出去的撤不回，没发出去的会被取消；"},"2254":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#等到什么才返回","content":"`@type == \"error\"` 的响应一律变成 `SimplifyError::Tdlib`（例如 `Message is not modified`），\n**封装层不重试**：限流该等多久是调用方的事。"},"2255":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"等更新要靠**接收循环**那个线程送回来，而插件的更新回调就跑在它上面——在那里等待=自己卡自己，\n等到的一定是超时。每个等待版都有一个 `*_then`：把等待挪到另一个线程，结局交给闭包。"},"2256":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#回调里用-_then","content":"它们返回那个线程的 `JoinHandle`——**插件要在 `stop()` 里 join 掉**，否则动态库卸载之后线程还在跑库里的代码\n（未定义行为）。三个内置插件就是这么写的，可以照抄。"},"2257":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#最小上手","content":"方法名与参数名由 `every_request_simplify_builds_passes_the_real_schema` 拿真 `td_api.tl` 烤出来的元数据\n（`TdApiSchema::compiled()`）逐条校验，离线就能跑。"},"2258":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"便捷方法把等待收进去了：发送类等**响应 + 发送结局**，其余等**响应**\n（`\"response\"` 通道，事件类型 `RESPONSE_EVENT`，只发给发起请求的那个插件）。\n想自己接原始 JSON，底层出口 `wait_response` / `wait_for_update` 仍然公开。"},"2259":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`WaitHandle::payload_json` / `td_execute` 的返回串都是宿主临时的**线程局部缓冲**，\n只在下一次宿主调用之前有效。要拿数据就立刻读，或者用 `*_json` / `wait_response`（它们已经替你拷好了）。"},"2260":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#两条时间线","content":"`HostRuntime::td_send` 在**没接 TDLib** 时只留档 + 发合成请求号（从 `1 << 48` 起），`td_execute` 在同样\n情况下返回 `None`——所以本文的每个方法在离线状态下都能被跑通、但不会真的到达 TDLib（Markdown 会退回纯文本）。"},"2261":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tdlib","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tdlib#python--js","content":"脚本里的 `invoke` 有第三参数 `on_response`，按 `request_id` 自动配对，脚本不用自己记请求号："},"2262":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"page","content":"调试与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing"},"2263":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"回放验证、静态检查、装进插件目录"},"2264":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"静态检查：`fuyubot-sdk check`"},"2265":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放：不接账号也能验插件"},"2266":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"安装"},"2267":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"装完还是不响？"},"2268":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"插件出问题通常不是「代码写得不对」，而是「没被加载」「加载了但没订阅上」「订阅了但请求拼错」。\n这三步各有对应的工具，全都不需要 Telegram 账号。"},"2269":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                       | 干什么                  | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------------------ | -------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot-sdk check <产物>` | **静态**读导出符号，不 dlopen | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2270":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                          | 干什么                   | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run --replay <文件>` | 把一批更新灌进管线后退出，不接 TDLib | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2271":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                            | 干什么              | 需要账号吗 |\n| ----------------------------- | ---------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin install <路径>` | 复制产物（＋脚本同伴）进插件目录 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2272":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令                    | 干什么                 | 需要账号吗 |\n| --------------------- | ------------------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot plugin list` | 真的加载一次，看插件名与 ABI 版本 | 否     |","table":"table-0"},"2273":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing","content":"| 命令            | 干什么     | 需要账号吗 |\n| ------------- | ------- | ----- |\n| `fuyubot run` | 真登录、真更新 | 是     |","table":"table-0"},"2274":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"**非零退出 = 宿主会拒绝加载**（缺必需的 `plugin_init`，或根本不是动态库），可以进 CI。"},"2275":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"它**不加载、不运行**：走 `object` 解析 PE / ELF / Mach-O 的导出表，不碰 `dlopen`\n（`dlopen` 会在宿主进程里跑插件的初始化代码，那已经算「加载」了）。"},"2276":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#静态检查fuyubot-sdk-check","content":"因此它**看不到 ABI 版本**——版本是 `plugin_init` 的**返回值**，不是符号。它只会如实报\n「只能运行时判定」，不编一个看起来可信的结论。"},"2277":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放把文件里的更新（单个对象或对象数组）灌进六阶段管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，\n插件发出的请求只留档不发。输出三样东西："},"2278":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"每条更新的 `UpdateOutcome`："},"2279":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件打的日志（`HostRuntime::log_lines`，上限 256 行）；"},"2280":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"插件发出去的请求：`#请求号 方法名 参数`。"},"2281":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数              | 说明             |\n| --------------- | -------------- |\n| `--replay <文件>` | 要回放的更新；对象或对象数组 |","table":"table-1"},"2282":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                  | 说明                                         |\n| ------------------- | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖插件目录（默认取 `fuyubot.toml` 的 `plugins.dir`） |","table":"table-1"},"2283":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"| 参数                   | 说明                                           |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--replay-wait <MS>` | 回放后的静默窗口；不填时脚本插件 2000ms、纯原生插件 150ms（上限 60 秒） |","table":"table-1"},"2284":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"脚本插件在**另一个进程**里跑，反应要经管道回来，还可能捎带网络请求——窗口太短会把最终答复漏掉。"},"2285":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#回放不接账号也能验插件","content":"回放**故意不接 TDLib**：它要在任何机器上离线可跑，接了就要账号与网络。\n所以回放能证明「插件收到更新后做出了正确判断、发出了正确请求」，**不能**证明真 Telegram 认这些参数。"},"2286":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"传**工程目录**时会把旁边的 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷；传单个 dll 时看不到脚本在哪，\n**脚本插件请传工程目录**。"},"2287":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#安装","content":"`plugin install <工程目录>` 找产物的顺序是 `<工程>/target/{release,debug}` → 工程目录本身 →\n**沿父链最近的** `target/{release,debug}`（两边都有时取**较新**的那个）。最后一档专为 workspace\n成员准备：`cargo build -p <crate>` 的产物默认落在仓库根 `target/`，工程自己那份 `target/` 并不存在，\n靠父链一样能找到——**没有 `--target-dir` 这个参数**，找不着就直接指着产物装。"},"2288":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状                          | 先看                                                              |\n| --------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `check` 报 `[缺] plugin_init` | crate 是不是 `crate-type = [\"cdylib\"]`；C++ 的七个符号在不在 `extern \"C\"` 里 |","table":"table-2"},"2289":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                      |\n| ------------ | ------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 日志里有「跳过 xxx」 | ABI 版本不匹配，或 `dlopen` 失败（缺兄弟 DLL：把依赖放在插件旁边，加载器会先查库自己的目录） |","table":"table-2"},"2290":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                      |\n| ------------ | --------------------------------------- |\n| 加载了但一条事件都没收到 | 订阅句柄是不是被 drop 了（Rust 侧 `let _ =` 会立刻退订） |","table":"table-2"},"2291":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状      | 先看                                                                                                               |\n| ------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 脚本插件起不来 | manifest 身份段（`[tool.fuyubot]` / `\"fuyubot\"`）与 `entry` 对不对；`run()` 是不是最后一行；`uv` / `bun` 在不在；原生桥库找不找得到（见 脚本插件常见问题） |","table":"table-2"},"2292":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"| 症状           | 先看                                                    |\n| ------------ | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 请求发出去了但没收到响应 | 回放里本来就不会有响应（请求只留档）；真环境下等的是 `\"response\"` 通道，见 调用 TDLib |","table":"table-2"},"2293":{"id":"/docs/plugin/testing-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/testing","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/testing#装完还是不响","content":"要查 TDLib 的方法名与参数名，用 `fuyubot-sdk td-methods --filter <片段>` / `td-method <名字>`；\n契约与所有权规则见 ABI 契约。"},"2294":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"page","content":"工具与中间件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","插件开发"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools"},"2295":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-0","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"注册工具（元数据 + 处理器）、call_tool / call_tool_result、六阶段洋葱管线"},"2296":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-1","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"注册工具：元数据 + 处理器"},"2297":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-2","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"调用工具：请求号或同步结果"},"2298":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-3","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件：六阶段洋葱"},"2299":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-4","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools","content":"工具（tool）是「有名字、有 schema、可被别的插件或宿主调用」的能力；中间件（middleware）\n是流经更新管线时的洋葱式拦截点。两者的注册都记在**当前插件的作用域**下：\n插件卸载（或加载失败）时宿主一次性回滚这批注册。"},"2300":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-5","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"ABI v4 的 `register_tool` 收三个东西：JSON 描述、可选的处理器、处理器要用的 `user_data`。\n处理器是 `C-unwind` 的 `fn(user_data, input_json) -> *const c_char`，返回 JSON 字符串。"},"2301":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-6","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"只登记元数据（不提供执行能力）用 `register_tool_meta(descriptor)`，等价于\n`register_tool(descriptor, None, null)`。`handle` 无效（`id == 0`）表示登记被拒\n（重名、schema 不合法等）。"},"2302":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-7","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段     | 类型     | 说明                |\n| ------ | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `name` | string | 全局唯一，建议 `插件名.工具名` |","table":"table-0"},"2303":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-8","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段        | 类型     | 说明                |\n| --------- | ------ | ----------------- |\n| `version` | string | semver，默认 `0.1.0` |","table":"table-0"},"2304":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-9","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段            | 类型     | 说明      |\n| ------------- | ------ | ------- |\n| `description` | string | 给人看的一句话 |","table":"table-0"},"2305":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-10","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段             | 类型          | 说明   |\n| -------------- | ----------- | ---- |\n| `input_schema` | JSON Schema | 描述入参 |","table":"table-0"},"2306":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-11","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段              | 类型          | 说明                  |\n| --------------- | ----------- | ------------------- |\n| `output_schema` | JSON Schema | `null` / `{}` 表示不校验 |","table":"table-0"},"2307":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-12","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段                     | 类型       | 说明        |\n| ---------------------- | -------- | --------- |\n| `required_permissions` | string[] | 调用前要过的权限门 |","table":"table-0"},"2308":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-13","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ---- | ---------- |\n| `idempotent` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"2309":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-14","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段           | 类型     | 说明         |\n| ------------ | ------ | ---------- |\n| `timeout_ms` | number | 默认 `30000` |","table":"table-0"},"2310":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-15","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明         |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------- |\n| `is_async` | bool | 默认 `false` |","table":"table-0"},"2311":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-16","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#注册工具元数据--处理器","content":"| 字段         | 类型   | 说明                     |\n| ---------- | ---- | ---------------------- |\n| `callable` | bool | **读出时才有**：本进程里有没有可调处理器 |","table":"table-0"},"2312":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-17","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"两条入口，按需选："},"2313":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-18","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                            | 返回          | 用途                |\n| ----------------------------- | ----------- | ----------------- |\n| `call_tool(name, input_json)` | `RequestId` | 只需要“发出去”，或将来接异步工具 |","table":"table-1"},"2314":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-19","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"| 入口                                   | 返回          | 用途                              |\n| ------------------------------------ | ----------- | ------------------------------- |\n| `call_tool_result(name, input_json)` | 结果 JSON 字符串 | **同步**拿结果（失败是 `{\"error\": \"…\"}`） |","table":"table-1"},"2315":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-20","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool_result` 的顺序是："},"2316":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-21","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"call_tool_result 的五步链路"},"2317":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-22","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步调用工具时，宿主依次做：按名字查表、过权限门、校验入参 schema、跑处理器、校验出参 schema；任一步失败就返回 error 对象。"},"2318":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-23","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"同步链路：任一步不过就到此为止"},"2319":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-24","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"查表"},"2320":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-25","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"名字 → 注册项"},"2321":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-26","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"权限门"},"2322":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-27","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"required_…"},"2323":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-28","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"入参校验"},"2324":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-29","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"input_schema"},"2325":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-30","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"处理器"},"2326":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-31","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"C-unwind 回调"},"2327":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-32","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"出参校验"},"2328":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-33","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"output_schema"},"2329":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-34","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"结果 JSON（线程局部缓冲，读完即弃）"},"2330":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-35","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"任一步不过 → {'{\"error\": …}'}"},"2331":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-36","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`call_tool`（返回请求号那条）走的是同一张表，只是不等结果——想要结果就用 `call_tool_result`。"},"2332":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-37","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"`list_tools()` 返回全部工具的元数据 JSON 数组。**宿主线程局部缓冲**：读完即弃，\n要留就当场拷走，**不要试图释放它**。"},"2333":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-38","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#调用工具请求号或同步结果","content":"脚本侧（`fuyubot_plugin.*` 内嵌桥）：Python `host.call_tool(name, input, on_response)`、\nJS `host.callTool(name, input, onResponse)` 现在都走同步结果，回调收到 `output`\n（失败是 `{\"error\": …}`）。脚本注册工具仍只有元数据（`registerTool` / `register_tool`），\n没有处理器指针——脚本进程不能把函数指针交回宿主。"},"2334":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-39","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一个中间件自己看到的是**进入段 / 退出段**两截，中间那句 `next.run(ctx)` 就是分界："},"2335":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-40","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"中间件的洋葱：进入段、next.run、退出段"},"2336":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-41","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"一次 run 会先复制层列表再执行；next.run 之前是进入段，之后是退出段，外层先进后出。不调 next.run 就不往下走。"},"2337":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-42","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"run(stage, ctx)：层列表先复制一份再跑，所以中间件里再挂中间件不会自锁"},"2338":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-43","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"进入段"},"2339":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-44","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之前的代码"},"2340":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-45","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run(ctx)"},"2341":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-46","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"交给下一层"},"2342":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-47","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"退出段"},"2343":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-48","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"next.run 之后的代码"},"2344":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-49","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"外层先进后出；回调返回非 0 就中断这一阶段；不调 next.run 就是不往下走"},"2345":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-50","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段          | 数值  | 谁跑它       |\n| ----------- | --- | --------- |\n| `PreUpdate` | 0   | 收到更新、还没解析 |","table":"table-2"},"2346":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-51","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它             |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------- |\n| `PreRoute` | 1   | 已解析 `@type`，路由前 |","table":"table-2"},"2347":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-52","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段         | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ---------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `InPlugin` | 2   | 分发给监听器之前；**一条更新只跑一遍** |","table":"table-2"},"2348":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-53","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它    |\n| -------------- | --- | ------ |\n| `PostResponse` | 3   | 响应发出之后 |","table":"table-2"},"2349":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-54","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段            | 数值  | 谁跑它                   |\n| ------------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `PreToolCall` | 4   | 工具调用之前（**目前没有生产调用方**） |","table":"table-2"},"2350":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-55","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"| 阶段             | 数值  | 谁跑它        |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------- |\n| `PostToolCall` | 5   | 工具调用之后（同上） |","table":"table-2"},"2351":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-56","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"数值就是 ABI 里的 `stage` 参数，与 `fuyubot-middleware::Stage` 一一对应。"},"2352":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-57","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"要点："},"2353":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-58","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**回调是 `C-unwind` 的** `fn(user_data, stage: u32, payload_json) -> i32`：返回 `0` 继续、**非 0 中断本阶段**。\n中断只影响**本阶段剩下的层**，管线继续走下一阶段（已经改过的负载照样往下传），宿主记一条 warning。"},"2354":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-59","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"**中间件一条更新跑一遍，不是每个监听器跑一遍**：`InPlugin` 的产出就是所有监听器看到的版本。\n按监听器各跑一遍的话，第 N 个会看到被改过 N 次的负载。"},"2355":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-60","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"洋葱模型：进入段在「继续往下」之前，退出段在之后。不往下走就是中断。"},"2356":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-61","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"Rust 侧注册返回的 `MiddlewareHandle` 也是 `#[must_use]`，drop 即摘除。"},"2357":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-62","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"阶段号非法或回调为空会让 `use_middleware` 直接返回无效句柄（不会静默挂个空层）。"},"2358":{"id":"/docs/plugin/tools-63","page_id":"/docs/plugin/tools","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/plugin/tools#中间件六阶段洋葱","content":"想看订阅与双通道怎么配合，见 订阅与事件；工具调用的格式最终由宿主层决定，\n契约本身见 ABI 契约。"},"2359":{"id":"/docs/usage/build","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"page","content":"从源码构建","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build"},"2360":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"开发者路线：自己编 fuyubot 与 fuyubot-sdk"},"2361":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"前置"},"2362":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"构建"},"2363":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"编出来的东西在哪"},"2364":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"发布包是怎么出的"},"2365":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"自检"},"2366":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build","content":"普通用户请走 下载与安装——发布包里有可执行文件和 `tdjson`，不用编译。\n这一页是给要改代码、或者平台没有发布包（比如 Intel Mac）的人。"},"2367":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                    |\n| ---- | --------------------- |\n| Rust | 1.99+（`edition 2024`） |","table":"table-0"},"2368":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置      | 要求                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| Windows | MSVC 工具链（Rust / C / C++ 插件都用它链接） |","table":"table-0"},"2369":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置   | 要求                   |\n| ---- | -------------------- |\n| 构建输入 | 一份 `td_api.tl`（下面说明） |","table":"table-0"},"2370":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#前置","content":"| 前置  | 要求                           |\n| --- | ---------------------------- |\n| 运行期 | `tdjson` 动态库（构建期会被拷到可执行文件同级） |","table":"table-0"},"2371":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`td_api.tl` 是**构建的必需输入**：`fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs` 无条件去拿它——`TDLIB_TD_API_TL`（显式指定，优先级最高）→ **包内 `vendor/<tdlib-version>/td_api.tl`** → 缓存 → 从 GitHub Releases 下载，拿不到就让**构建失败**。包内那份随 crate 一起发布（1.8.69 已带），所以从 crates.io 装下来的下游与 docs.rs **不用联网**；升 `tdlib-version` 时要记得补 `vendor/<新版本>/`。缓存根顺序：`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` → `$CARGO_HOME/fuyubot-tdlib-vendored` → 项目本地 `<工作区>/.tdlib-cache`。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已把最后一档指好，在仓库里敲命令不用先 export。"},"2372":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"转换在**编译期**完成，构建日志里只有一条 `已转换 …\\td_api.tl：共 N 条`。条数取决于构建时用的那份文件（本机三千多条），**不是常量**，别当断言用。"},"2373":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#构建","content":"`tdjson` 是**运行时**动态加载的，编译期不依赖它存在——所以构建成功不代表运行找得到。构建期 `fuyubot-tdlib/build.rs` 会把它（连同那个目录里的兄弟 DLL）拷到可执行文件同级目录，`target/debug/fuyubot.exe` 拷走就能跑。唯一例外是 `cargo install` 装出来的二进制：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放。"},"2374":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                           | 产物                         | 说明  |\n| ---------------------------- | -------------------------- | --- |\n| `cargo build -p fuyubot-cli` | `target\\debug\\fuyubot.exe` | 开发用 |","table":"table-1"},"2375":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令                  | 产物                           | 说明                  |\n| ------------------- | ---------------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `cargo package-bot` | `target\\release\\fuyubot.exe` | 本地打包（tdjson 已在同级目录） |","table":"table-1"},"2376":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"| 命令          | 产物  | 说明                    |\n| ----------- | --- | --------------------- |\n| `cargo bot` | —   | 一键 `fuyubot run` 当前目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2377":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"别名就这三个，都写在仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml`（只影响本仓，**没有** `package-sdk`）：\n`fuyubot-sdk` 属于 FuyuBot-SDK 那个仓库，\n在那边用 `cargo build -p fuyubot-sdk-cli` 编，它不需要 `tdjson`。"},"2378":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#编出来的东西在哪","content":"本文档其余页面里的 `fuyubot` / `fuyubot.exe` 指的就是这些产物；从发布包安装的用户手里就是解压出来的那个。"},"2379":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#发布包是怎么出的","content":"`.github/workflows/release-bot.yml` 在 `v*` tag 上按平台编 `fuyubot`、三个内置插件与 `fuyubot-sdk`，\n**分开**打三份中间包（本体 / 插件 / SDK），`publish` 再把本体 + 内置插件叠成各平台一个 zip：\n解压得到 `<资产名>/`，里面有可执行文件、该平台的 `tdjson`（从 `TDLib-v<版本>` 那个 Release 取）\n和 `plugins/`。SDK 是单独的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`。\n名字与 `crates/fuyubot-tdlib/src/loader/vendored.rs` 的 `ASSETS` 表同一套口径（`x86_64` / `aarch64`），\n加平台时两边一起加。"},"2380":{"id":"/docs/usage/build-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/build","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/build#自检","content":"真 TDLib 的端到端自检（要本机的 `tdjson`）："},"2381":{"id":"/docs/usage/config","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"page","content":"配置文件","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config"},"2382":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"fuyubot.toml 的字段与默认值"},"2383":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"字段"},"2384":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件自己的配置段"},"2385":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"几条约定"},"2386":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改了配置怎么生效"},"2387":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"`fuyubot run` 读 `fuyubot.toml`，**所有键都有默认值**。缺这个文件时 `run` 会按模板自动生成一份（等价于先跑一次 `fuyubot init`）——`--replay` 是例外，它不会为了回放在你的目录里留配置。"},"2388":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"> `run --tui` 的**配置页**可以直接改核心项：`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑，写回时保留注释与 CRLF。\n> 运行中改完需重启实例；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 / 密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。"},"2389":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config","content":"一个项目目录长这样："},"2390":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键            | 默认值       | 它决定什么                     |\n| ------------ | --------- | ------------------------- |\n| `[bot].name` | `fuyubot` | 显示名（启动那行、`status` 里的「名字」） |","table":"table-0"},"2391":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                             |\n| -------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[bot].api_id` | `0` | **旧位置**；`[telegram].api_id` 优先。新配置写进 `[telegram]` |","table":"table-0"},"2392":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                         | 默认值   | 它决定什么                                                         |\n| ------------------------- | ----- | ------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].account_type` | `bot` | 登录走哪条路：`bot` → Bot Token；`user` → 手机号 / 扫码。**写错报错**，不会静默当 bot |","table":"table-0"},"2393":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                   | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| ------------------- | --- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[telegram].api_id` | `0` | TDLib api_id（到 my.telegram.org 申请）。不是秘密；`0` = 没配，`run` 会问 |","table":"table-0"},"2394":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                      |\n| --------------------- | ------ | ------------------------------------------ |\n| `[telegram].data_dir` | `data` | TDLib 的数据目录：database 与 files **都**指它。相对项目根 |","table":"table-0"},"2395":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键               | 默认值       | 它决定什么                                                     |\n| --------------- | --------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].dir` | `plugins` | `run` 从这里加载插件（动态库 + `scripts/` 下的脚本插件）；`--plugin-dir` 覆盖它 |","table":"table-0"},"2396":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                     | 默认值    | 它决定什么                                                                                                                                   |\n| --------------------- | ------ | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `[plugins].log_level` | `info` | 插件日志的最低级别：error / warn / info / debug / trace。排查插件时调成 `\"debug\"`；**写错级别名会报错**。运行中也可以在 `run --tui` 的日志页按 `Tab` 聚焦工作区后按 `l` 临时调整（只对本次运行生效） |","table":"table-0"},"2397":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键              | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                          |\n| -------------- | --- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `[tdlib].path` | 空   | 留空 = 按四级优先级自动找 tdjson；指定时给 tdjson 的**目录**或文件路径 |","table":"table-0"},"2398":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                       | 默认值 | 它决定什么                                                              |\n| ----------------------- | --- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `[tdlib].log_verbosity` | `1` | TDLib 日志详细度。TDLib 自己的默认更啰嗦（每轮 `td_receive` 的超时都打到 stderr）；负数按 0 处理 |","table":"table-0"},"2399":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#字段","content":"| 键                | 默认值 | 它决定什么        |\n| ---------------- | --- | ------------ |\n| `[plugin.<插件名>]` | 无   | 插件自己的配置段（见下） |","table":"table-0"},"2400":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"每个插件在 `[plugin.<插件名>]` 下可以有自己的配置，键值任意、可嵌套。插件名是点分的\n（`define_plugin!` / 脚手架里登记的那个名字，如 `fuyubot.manage`），所以在 TOML 里自然写成\n嵌套表——`[plugin.fuyubot.manage]` 就代表插件 `fuyubot.manage` 那段："},"2401":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"插件在**运行时**读它、写它，走的是 ABI 接口（不是 `plugin_start` 的那个 `config_json`）："},"2402":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**读**：`get_config(section, key)` —— 读任意段（自己的 + 别人的）。`section` 空串读顶层\n（`[bot]` / `[telegram]` 等），`key` 空串读整段，`key` 是点路径（`nested.k`）。"},"2403":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**写**：`set_config(key, value_json)` —— **只能写自己名下的段**（没有 section 参数，宿主按调用者身份判定，插件无法伪造）。成功会写内存并回写 `fuyubot.toml`。"},"2404":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"各语言的写法：Rust 插件、C / C++ 插件、\nPython 插件、JS / TS 插件（每页都有「读 / 写配置」一节），\n函数签名在插件 ABI。脚本插件读**自己**那段还有个同步入口\n（`plugin_config()` / `pluginConfig()`），`run()` 之前就能用。"},"2405":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**`set_config` 回写是「全量重写」**：`fuyubot.toml` 里你手写的注释、空白会被 `toml` 序列化丢掉。插件写配置属于程序化修改，这是简单且可预期的一步；要保注释就把插件要写的值也手工维护进文件、别让插件运行时去改。唯一会被保住的是 `[telegram].api_hash`——它不在插件能读到的配置树里，回写时会从磁盘补回来。"},"2406":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"模板（`fuyubot init` 生成的就是它）："},"2407":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#插件自己的配置段","content":"**凭据的边界**：`api_id` 与 `api_hash` 是**例外**——它们**每次冷启动**都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发给 TDLib（session 还有效也一样），不记住就得每次手输，所以 `fuyubot run` 交互式问过之后会把它们**明文写回** `[telegram]` 段。这意味着这份文件从此带着你的应用密钥：**别提交进版本库、别整份发给别人**。不想落盘就设 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`（环境变量优先，且不会被写回）。Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码仍然**一律不落盘**，只认环境变量或交互输入（连日志也不许出现）。session 由 TDLib 自己落在 `data_dir`，配置里不记任何登录态。"},"2408":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**相对路径相对配置文件所在目录**（也就是项目根）：`plugins`、`data`、日志目录都按它解析。\n插件也吃这一条：`fuyubot run` 在加载插件之前会把**进程工作目录切到项目根**，所以插件配置里的相对路径（如 `cache` / `Cache`）和插件起的子进程，都落在 `fuyubot.toml` 旁边，而不是「你在哪个目录敲的命令」。"},"2409":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"**自动 init 只认默认文件名**：缺 `fuyubot.toml` 时 `run` 会生成一份；但用 `--config 别的名字` 时不会凭空造，直接报错。"},"2410":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`status` / `stop` **不替你造配置**：找不到 `fuyubot.toml` 就报「先 `fuyubot init` 建一个」——面对的是已经存在的实例，凭空建一个只会更迷惑。"},"2411":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"`--plugin-dir` 覆盖 `[plugins].dir`，`--config` 换配置文件本身。"},"2412":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"想知道**某一行到底生效成了什么**（含默认值）：`fuyubot config` 直接打出来，见 `fuyubot` 命令参考。"},"2413":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#几条约定","content":"字段读出来后，运行参数（凭据来源、加载顺序）见 运行与实例管理；`account_type` 之外没有别的自定义登录入口。"},"2414":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"配置在 `run` 启动时读一次。改完要重启实例："},"2415":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"`--replay` 不占单实例锁，所以它可以和跑着的实例并存、跑完就退，适合改插件期间反复试。"},"2416":{"id":"/docs/usage/config-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/config","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/config#改了配置怎么生效","content":"改完先别急着重启：`fuyubot config --config demo\\fuyubot.toml` 会打印生效值，`account_type` 之类写错时当场就能看出来（那一行是 `⚠️` 开头，而 `run` 要走到登录才报）。"},"2417":{"id":"/docs/usage/env","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"page","content":"环境变量","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env"},"2418":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"每个变量的读取者与作用"},"2419":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"构建期 vs 运行期"},"2420":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"凭据"},"2421":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"只在自动 init 那一次生效"},"2422":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                | 谁读                                    | 作用                                 |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TD_API_TL` | `fuyubot-tdlib-sys/build.rs`（**构建期**） | 显式指定 `td_api.tl`，优先级最高（完全离线构建就这么干） |","table":"table-0"},"2423":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                             | 谁读                     | 作用                                                                         |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` | 两个 `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 缓存根：`td_api.tl` 与 vendored 动态库都放这儿。**必须绝对路径**（build.rs 的 CWD 是各自的 crate 根） |","table":"table-0"},"2424":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                            | 谁读                  | 作用                                                                        |\n| ----------------------------- | ------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_RELEASES_REPO` | `build.rs`（**构建期**） | 覆盖 `[package.metadata.fuyubot] releases-repo`（默认 `CatMoeCircle/Fuyu-Bot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2425":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                  | 谁读           | 作用                                 |\n| ------------------- | ------------ | ---------------------------------- |\n| `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` | 加载器（**运行期**） | tdjson 的目录或文件，查找优先级 1；嫌四级排查麻烦就直接设它 |","table":"table-0"},"2426":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量          | 谁读                      | 作用                                                             |\n| ----------- | ----------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_ID` | `fuyubot run` / `login` | TDLib api_id（**不是**秘密）。参与凭据解析（`--api-id` 之后、配置之前），也顺手带进自动生成的配置 |","table":"table-0"},"2427":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量            | 谁读                             | 作用                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------ | ----------------------------------- |\n| `TG_API_HASH` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | api_hash，**凭据**。它优先于配置里已保存的值，且不会被写回 |","table":"table-0"},"2428":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                             | 作用                                    |\n| -------------- | ------------------------------ | ------------------------------------- |\n| `TG_BOT_TOKEN` | `fuyubot run` / `login` / 集成测试 | bot 账号的 token；有值就不问 Bot Token，后台运行也能登 |","table":"table-0"},"2429":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量             | 谁读                               | 作用                                  |\n| -------------- | -------------------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_NAME` | `fuyubot run` / `login` 的自动 init | 自动生成配置时的 `[bot].name`（默认 `fuyubot`） |","table":"table-0"},"2430":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env","content":"| 变量                 | 谁读                 | 作用                                                                                                                     |\n| ------------------ | ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `FUYUBOT_SDK_PATH` | `fuyubot-sdk init` | **可选**：指向 SDK 仓库里放着 crate 的目录（`crates/`）。设了生成的插件用 `path = …` 对着源码开发；不设就写 crates.io 版本号（`fuyubot-plugin-api = \"0.1.1\"`） |","table":"table-0"},"2431":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"**`FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE` 只在构建期读。** 运行期用的是构建时烤进二进制的路径（`cargo:rustc-env` 写进去的 `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_DIR`——那是构建产物，不是让你设的变量）。运行时动态库最终由加载器的四级优先级决定，**不读** `FUYUBOT_TDLIB_VENDORED_CACHE`。"},"2432":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"缓存根是一串候选，顺序即优先级："},"2433":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#构建期-vs-运行期","content":"前两档写不进去时会退到项目本地那档；**全都写不进去**才退到 `$OUT_DIR`——那个目录每次重跑构建脚本都会被清空，于是下次构建会重新下载（构建脚本会明确警告）。仓里的 `.cargo/config.toml` 已经把项目本地那档指好了。"},"2434":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"**Bot Token、手机号、验证码、两步验证密码一律不落盘**：不得写进仓库任何文件、`fuyubot.toml`、测试夹具或日志，只允许**环境变量**与**交互式输入**两个来源。`api_id` / `api_hash` 是例外——它们每次冷启动都要发给 TDLib，`run` 问过之后会明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（见 配置文件），所以那份文件要当密钥看待。"},"2435":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_id` **不是**凭据，写进配置没问题（`[telegram].api_id`）。"},"2436":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"`api_hash` 三个来源，按序：`TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的（`[telegram].api_hash`）→ 交互提问。问出来的会被写回配置，之后就不用再输。"},"2437":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#凭据","content":"后台运行没有 stdin：没有 session、也没 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 时会直接失败；首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了，先在前台 `run` 一次（或设好上表那两个环境变量）。"},"2438":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`FUYUBOT_NAME` 只在 `run` / `login` **自动生成配置**时被读（缺 `fuyubot.toml`，或 `--config` 指向默认文件名而它不存在）。配置已存在就不参与——否则每次跑都会覆盖你手写的名字。"},"2439":{"id":"/docs/usage/env-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/env","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/env#只在自动-init-那一次生效","content":"`TG_API_ID` 不一样：它除了带进自动生成的配置，还是**每次** `run` / `login` 解析 `api_id` 的一档\n（`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问）。它只覆盖 `api_id`，不会动 `[bot].name`。"},"2440":{"id":"/docs/usage","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"page","content":"下载与安装","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage"},"2441":{"id":"/docs/usage-0","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"下载对应平台的包，解压就能跑"},"2442":{"id":"/docs/usage-1","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"下载哪个包"},"2443":{"id":"/docs/usage-2","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"解压、验证"},"2444":{"id":"/docs/usage-3","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"起一个 bot 项目"},"2445":{"id":"/docs/usage-4","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"跑起来"},"2446":{"id":"/docs/usage-5","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"不接账号先验一遍"},"2447":{"id":"/docs/usage-6","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"目录布局"},"2448":{"id":"/docs/usage-7","page_id":"/docs/usage","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"下一步"},"2449":{"id":"/docs/usage-8","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage","content":"不用装 Rust、不用编译：到 Releases 下对应平台的 zip，\n解压后里面就是可执行文件，**TDLib 动态库已经和它放在同一个目录**（运行时按「可执行文件所在目录」\n自动找到，不用配环境变量、不用单独装 TDLib），内置插件在同级的 `plugins/`。"},"2450":{"id":"/docs/usage-9","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"资产名是 **`fuyubot-<版本>-<OS>-<平台>.zip`**（例：`fuyubot-v0.1.0-windows-x86_64.zip`）：\n`<版本>` 就是 Release 版本号，带在名字里方便一眼看出下的是哪个；`<OS>` = windows / linux / macos，\n`<平台>` = x86_64 / aarch64（cargo 口径，和 TDLib 自己的资产同序）。"},"2451":{"id":"/docs/usage-10","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                 | 资产                                | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ------------------ | --------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 10/11（x64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2452":{"id":"/docs/usage-11","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                | 资产                                 | 包里有什么                                                    |\n| ----------------- | ---------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Windows 11（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-windows-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot.exe` + `tdjson.dll` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2453":{"id":"/docs/usage-12","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统            | 资产                              | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------- | ------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（x86_64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-x86_64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2454":{"id":"/docs/usage-13","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统           | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                  |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| Linux（ARM64） | `fuyubot-<版本>-linux-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.so` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2455":{"id":"/docs/usage-14","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"| 系统                   | 资产                               | 包里有什么                                                     |\n| -------------------- | -------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------- |\n| macOS（Apple Silicon） | `fuyubot-<版本>-macos-aarch64.zip` | `fuyubot` + `libtdjson.dylib` + `plugins/` + `README.txt` |","table":"table-0"},"2456":{"id":"/docs/usage-15","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**解压出来就是本体**：zip 里没有额外的一层目录，建议先建一个空目录再往里解压。"},"2457":{"id":"/docs/usage-16","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"归档一律 `.zip`（Windows 资源管理器双击就能解，Linux / macOS 用 `unzip`）。"},"2458":{"id":"/docs/usage-17","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"**上面没有的平台**（Intel Mac 等）暂时没有包，自己编：见 从源码构建。"},"2459":{"id":"/docs/usage-18","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下载哪个包","content":"插件开发 CLI（`fuyubot-sdk`）在**另一个仓库**的 Release 里：\nFuyuBot-SDK 的 `fuyubot-sdk-<系统>-<架构>.zip`，\n它**不需要** `tdjson`。"},"2460":{"id":"/docs/usage-19","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"先建一个空目录再解压（zip 里没有套层目录，直接解到当前目录会把文件摊开）："},"2461":{"id":"/docs/usage-20","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"Linux / macOS："},"2462":{"id":"/docs/usage-21","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"macOS 从网上下载的二进制会被 Gatekeeper 拦住，解一次隔离属性："},"2463":{"id":"/docs/usage-22","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#解压验证","content":"`--version` 能打印版本号，说明这个可执行文件本身没坏；真正加载 TDLib 是在 `run` 的时候\n（日志里会有一行 `TDLib 1.8.69 命中「可执行文件所在目录」`——版本号是构建时声明的那个）。加载失败按\n常见问题 排查。"},"2464":{"id":"/docs/usage-23","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#起一个-bot-项目","content":"`api_id` 到 my.telegram.org 申请，**它不是秘密**，可以直接写进配置；`api_hash` 是凭据，\n但每次启动都要发给 TDLib，所以 `run` 首次问过之后会把明文写回 `fuyubot.toml`（也可以事先设环境变量 `TG_API_HASH`\n让它一次都不问）——那份文件要当密钥看待，别提交进版本库（见 配置文件）。"},"2465":{"id":"/docs/usage-24","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"真账号的最后一环**没有端到端验过**：`run` 会问凭据、驱动授权状态机、`getMe` 打印账户，然后才开分发；\n真库上的登录与 session 复用是在 `fuyubot-tdlib` 的 `-- --ignored` 自检里验的，但「收真更新 → 插件回一条」\n还没有真账号证据。想先确认插件行为，用下面的 `--replay` 或 `--no-login`。"},"2466":{"id":"/docs/usage-25","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"**没有插件也能起**（「插件 0 个」），插件是后装的：拿到编好的 `.dll` / `.so` / `.dylib` 之后"},"2467":{"id":"/docs/usage-26","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#跑起来","content":"插件怎么编见 插件总览。"},"2468":{"id":"/docs/usage-27","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"回放是**离线**的：把一批更新 JSON 灌进整条管线，请求只留档、不发到 Telegram。先写一条最小的回放文件："},"2469":{"id":"/docs/usage-28","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#不接账号先验一遍","content":"退出码 0 表示回放成功。细节（`--replay-wait`、脚本插件要等静默窗口）见 离线回放。"},"2470":{"id":"/docs/usage-29","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#目录布局","content":"`fuyubot init` 建出来的项目："},"2471":{"id":"/docs/usage-30","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"配置文件\" href=\"/docs/usage/config/\" />"},"2472":{"id":"/docs/usage-31","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"运行与实例管理\" href=\"/docs/usage/run/\" />"},"2473":{"id":"/docs/usage-32","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"离线回放\" href=\"/docs/usage/replay/\" />"},"2474":{"id":"/docs/usage-33","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"CLI 参考\" href=\"/docs/cli/\" />"},"2475":{"id":"/docs/usage-34","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"常见问题\" href=\"/docs/usage/troubleshooting/\" />"},"2476":{"id":"/docs/usage-35","page_id":"/docs/usage","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage#下一步","content":"<Card title=\"从源码构建\" href=\"/docs/usage/build/\" />"},"2477":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"page","content":"离线回放","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay"},"2478":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"不接账号验证插件"},"2479":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"输出里看什么"},"2480":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"慢插件与脚本插件：`--replay-wait`"},"2481":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"插件目录别指 `target\\debug`"},"2482":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"与实例的关系"},"2483":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"`fuyubot run --replay` 把一批更新的 JSON 灌进整条管线后退出：**不接 TDLib、不用账号**，用来在任何机器上验插件。"},"2484":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay","content":"**每条 update 打一行**，`listeners` 是收到它的订阅数。退出码 0 表示回放成功，非零表示插件加载或回放本身失败。"},"2485":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落                                 | 含义                                   |\n| ---------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `回放 <@type> → UpdateOutcome { … }` | 管线跑完一条更新的结果。`warnings` 非空说明有阶段或回调抱怨过 |","table":"table-0"},"2486":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                                     |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `插件打出来的日志：` | 插件 `log` 的原样回显（`Info mybot: init` / `start()` 是插件生命周期） |","table":"table-0"},"2487":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"| 段落          | 含义                                    |\n| ----------- | ------------------------------------- |\n| `插件发出去的请求：` | 插件请求的**留档**。回放不连 Telegram，所以请求不会真的发出去 |","table":"table-0"},"2488":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#输出里看什么","content":"回放是离线路径，所以插件发请求只留档、也不会等响应——要验「响应回到插件」用真 TDLib，并准备好账号。"},"2489":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"回放完不是立刻退出，而是等一个**安静窗口**再看结果（脚本插件的反应是异步的）。窗口的默认值按插件形态自动选："},"2490":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                       | 默认窗口    |\n| -------------------------- | ------- |\n| 有脚本（`.py` / `.js` / `.ts`） | 2000 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2491":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"| 插件形态                | 默认窗口   |\n| ------------------- | ------ |\n| 纯原生（Rust / C / C++） | 150 ms |","table":"table-1"},"2492":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#慢插件与脚本插件--replay-wait","content":"插件要发慢速网络请求就把它调大："},"2493":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"`--plugin-dir` 要指向「只放你要验的插件」的目录。指 `target\\debug` 会混进所有示例产物：其中 `counter.dll` 是**脚本插件**，脚本不在它旁边，于是 Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'`，并且**整个回放以非零码中止**。"},"2494":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#插件目录别指-targetdebug","content":"正确做法是 `plugin install` 到一个干净目录，或把 dll + 脚本一起拷进去："},"2495":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"`--replay` **不占单实例锁、不发布状态**：同一个目录可以一边跑着实例、一边回放。它也**不会自动 init**（回放不该因为你试了一次就在当前目录留下 `fuyubot.toml`），没有配置就按默认值跑，也不碰 `.fuyubot/` 里的实例状态。"},"2496":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放**不接 TDLib**（无论有没有 `tdjson`）：这是硬约定，否则回放就要账号和网络。"},"2497":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"要看运行中的实例、后台跑、优雅停止，见 运行与实例管理。"},"2498":{"id":"/docs/usage/replay-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/replay","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/replay#与实例的关系","content":"回放里插件加载失败，多半是 ABI 版本或脚本同伴位置的问题，见 常见问题。"},"2499":{"id":"/docs/usage/run","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"page","content":"运行与实例管理","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run"},"2500":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run","content":"前台/后台运行、status、stop 与单实例锁"},"2501":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"一个目录一个实例"},"2502":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"前台运行"},"2503":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台运行"},"2504":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"操作面板（`--tui`）"},"2505":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"看状态"},"2506":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"停掉"},"2507":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"常见情形"},"2508":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"实例状态与运行期控制放在 `<项目根>/.fuyubot/` 下，**每件事各占一个文件**："},"2509":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                                                 |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/lock` | **只用来独占**（`try_lock`，进程死即释放）。里面不存内容——Windows 的文件锁是强制的，别的进程读不到被锁的字节 |","table":"table-0"},"2510":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                | 作用                                                                                         |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `.fuyubot/status` | `key=value`：pid / started / version / log_level / plugins / name。**启动完成之后**才发布（拿上锁只说明进程活着） |","table":"table-0"},"2511":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件              | 作用                                      |\n| --------------- | --------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/stop` | 停止请求，内容是 PID。`fuyubot stop` 先写它，让实例自己收摊 |","table":"table-0"},"2512":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"| 文件                   | 作用                                                                  |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `.fuyubot/log-level` | **可选的运行期控制**：面板在日志页按 `l` 写它，实例每 500ms 读一次并切换插件日志级别；新实例拿锁时清掉，不会带到下一轮 |","table":"table-0"},"2513":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"第二次 `run`（前台后台都算）会被拒，报错里带上在跑的那个 PID。"},"2514":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"陈旧的 `lock` **不用手工清理**：拿锁时会顺手删掉上一个实例的 `status` / `stop` / `log-level`。"},"2515":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#一个目录一个实例","content":"`--replay` **不占锁、不发布状态**：离线开发路径不该和跑着的实例互斥。"},"2516":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"顺序是固定的：自动 init → 拿单实例锁 → attach TDLib → 问/读凭据 → **加载全部插件** → 发 `setTdlibParameters` 并登录 → `getMe` 打印账户 → 发布状态 → 最后才开分发。插件先于登录加载，是为了不漏掉登录窗口里的更新。"},"2517":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                     |\n| --------------- | ---------------------- |\n| `--config <路径>` | 配置文件，默认 `fuyubot.toml` |","table":"table-1"},"2518":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                  | 作用         |\n| ------------------- | ---------- |\n| `--plugin-dir <目录>` | 覆盖配置里的插件目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2519":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数              | 作用                                                                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n| `--api-id <ID>` | 覆盖配置里的 `api_id`（**不是**秘密）。优先级：`--api-id` → `TG_API_ID` → 配置 → 交互提问；`api_hash` 没有对应参数 |","table":"table-1"},"2520":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用                                           |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------- |\n| `--no-login` | 只起框架、不走登录流程（CI / 容器；已有 session 仍会被 TDLib 打开） |","table":"table-1"},"2521":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数           | 作用             |\n| ------------ | -------------- |\n| `--no-tdlib` | 不接 TDLib，只加载插件 |","table":"table-1"},"2522":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数             | 作用    |\n| -------------- | ----- |\n| `--background` | 放到后台跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2523":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数               | 作用                                             |\n| ---------------- | ---------------------------------------------- |\n| `--tui`（短写 `-t`） | 打开终端操作面板（见下节）；与 `--background` / `--replay` 互斥 |","table":"table-1"},"2524":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"| 参数                                       | 作用     |\n| ---------------------------------------- | ------ |\n| `--replay <JSON>` / `--replay-wait <MS>` | 见 离线回放 |","table":"table-1"},"2525":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#前台运行","content":"凭据来源（按序）：`TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH` → 配置里已保存的 `[telegram].api_id` / `.api_hash` → 交互式提问。**交互问出来的会被写回配置文件**，下次冷启动不用再输（这两个值每次都要随 `setTdlibParameters` 发出去，session 有效也一样）。Bot Token 仍只认 `TG_BOT_TOKEN` 或交互输入、不落盘，详见 环境变量。"},"2526":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"它派生一个没有终端的自己，stdout/stderr 写进 `<目录>logs\\fuyubot.log`（每次新启动先清空旧日志）；父进程等子进程**真起来**（`.fuyubot/status` 发布）才返回。"},"2527":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"后台跑**没有 stdin**。要交互式登录的场合（还没有 session、也没给 `TG_BOT_TOKEN`）会直接失败，并把日志尾巴打出来指路——先用前台 `run` 或 `fuyubot login` 登一次，session 会落在 `data/`。首次连 `api_id` / `api_hash` 也问不了：先在前台跑一次让它写回配置，或设好 `TG_API_ID` / `TG_API_HASH`。"},"2528":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#后台运行","content":"想单独把登录走完而不起框架，用 `fuyubot login`；要退出登录（清掉本地会话）用 `fuyubot logout`。"},"2529":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"打开的是**操作面板**，不是前台 bot：顶部版本栏（`[fuyubot - v…]`；实例运行中才显示状态，\n没跑时只显示刷新时间）、左侧导航、中央工作区、底部两行（当前可用操作 / 资源占用）。\n顶部和底部不铺背景色，当前焦点靠窗口边框高亮 + 底栏的 `[导航]` / `[工作区]` 标记。"},"2530":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"底部资源行：`CPU · 内存 · 运行时长 · 插件数 · 日志级别 · PID`，采的是**运行中实例的 PID**\n（`sysinfo`）。实例没跑时 CPU / 内存 / 运行 / PID 显示 `—`、插件数为 0，日志级别显示\n面板下次启动会用哪一档；第一个采样点的 CPU 是 `0.0%`，下一秒才有真实值。"},"2531":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                  |\n| ------------------- | ------------------- |\n| `Tab` / `Shift+Tab` | 切换焦点：导航 ↔ 工作区（边框高亮） |","table":"table-2"},"2532":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-32","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键              | 作用                                   |\n| --------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `Enter` / `Esc` | 导航 → 工作区 / 工作区 → 导航（在导航上按 `Esc` 才退出） |","table":"table-2"},"2533":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-33","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                  | 作用                                  |\n| ------------------- | ----------------------------------- |\n| `↑` / `↓`、`j` / `k` | 导航焦点：切页；工作区焦点：滚动日志 / 选择配置项 / 移动日志选择 |","table":"table-2"},"2534":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-34","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                       |\n| --------- | ------------------------ |\n| `←` / `→` | 切换顶部标签页（窄屏横向导航；工作区焦点也生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2535":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-35","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用             |\n| --------- | -------------- |\n| `h` / `l` | 导航焦点：上一页 / 下一页 |","table":"table-2"},"2536":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-36","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                         |\n| ------- | -------------------------- |\n| `1`–`5` | 直接跳到概览 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 / 帮助 |","table":"table-2"},"2537":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-37","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键      | 作用                               |\n| ------- | -------------------------------- |\n| `Enter` | 日志页：进入日志选择模式；配置页：编辑选中的配置项（`e` 同） |","table":"table-2"},"2538":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-38","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `y` | 日志选择模式：复制选中行（TDLib Update 复制完整 JSON） |","table":"table-2"},"2539":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-39","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                                                                   |\n| --- | -------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `s` | 启动 bot（派生 `run --background`，带上面板拿到的 `--api-id` / `--log-level` 等参数） |","table":"table-2"},"2540":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-40","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键        | 作用                                                 |\n| --------- | -------------------------------------------------- |\n| `x` → `y` | 停止 bot（`y` 是确认；`.fuyubot/stop` 走插件的 `plugin_stop`） |","table":"table-2"},"2541":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-41","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                    |\n| --- | --------------------- |\n| `r` | 立刻刷新状态 / 插件 / 日志 / 配置 |","table":"table-2"},"2542":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-42","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                              |\n| --- | ------------------------------- |\n| `l` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：调整运行中实例的日志级别（下一圈生效） |","table":"table-2"},"2543":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-43","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                       |\n| --- | ------------------------ |\n| `F` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：按级别 / 来源过滤日志 |","table":"table-2"},"2544":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-44","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                        |\n| --- | ------------------------- |\n| `c` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：清空当前日志文件（要确认） |","table":"table-2"},"2545":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-45","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键  | 作用                 |\n| --- | ------------------ |\n| `f` | 日志页 + 工作区焦点：跟随末尾开关 |","table":"table-2"},"2546":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-46","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键                             | 作用                            |\n| ------------------------------ | ----------------------------- |\n| `PgUp` / `PgDn`、`Home` / `End` | 工作区焦点：日志 / 帮助翻页、首尾；配置页选择翻页、首尾 |","table":"table-2"},"2547":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-47","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"| 按键           | 作用               |\n| ------------ | ---------------- |\n| `q`、`Ctrl+C` | 退出面板（不会停掉已启动的实例） |","table":"table-2"},"2548":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-48","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"面板**不占实例锁、不加载插件、不接 TDLib**——TDLib 的数据库同一时刻只能一个进程打开。\n它读 `.fuyubot/status`、配置、插件目录与 `logs/fuyubot.log`；启停都派生子进程，\n和手敲命令走同一条路，所以看到的就是真正在跑的那个实例。"},"2549":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-49","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志级别是**运行期**的：配置里的 `[plugins].log_level` 决定启动值，日志页按 `l` 选的值只对\n**本次运行**生效（写 `.fuyubot/log-level`，实例下一圈读并切换），重启后回到配置值。\n`fuyubot status`、面板的日志页与概览都会显示当前生效的级别。"},"2550":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-50","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"日志过滤（`F`）：级别是下限（`info+` = error / warn / info，排除 debug / trace），来源分\n**插件 / 宿主 / 管道 / 更新 / TDLib / 其他**。新日志格式按「插件行 / source 词」归类（旧四列\n也兼容）：`TDLib Update` 追踪归**更新**（级别 trace），TDLib C 库的 `[ N][t …]` 原样行归\n**TDLib**；认不出级别的启动提示按 info 对待。应用后底栏显示 `过滤 info+ · 全部` 与\n`x/y 行`，`c` 在弹框里一键重置。日志字段不按固定列补空格，长行按显示宽度折行\n（续行缩进两格）。"},"2551":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-51","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"TDLib Update 行只显示 `@type`（如 `updateNewMessage`），不铺整段 JSON。日志页按 `Enter`\n进入选择模式，`↑↓` 选行，`y` / `Enter` 复制：TDLib Update 复制**完整 JSON**，其它行复制整行；\n`Esc` 退出选择。"},"2552":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-52","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"后台实例每次新启动都会先清空 `logs/fuyubot.log`；日志页按 `c` 可手动清空当前日志\n（确认后清空并回到跟随末尾，运行中的实例继续写新行）。"},"2553":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-53","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"窄终端（手机 / Termux）会自动收缩：宽度 < 60 列时导航移到工作区上方，变成一行\n横向标签，用 `←` / `→`（工作区焦点也生效）或 `h` / `l`（导航焦点）切换；更窄时标签\n退化成单字。底栏窄屏只留 `CPU / 内存 / 级别`，不显示运行时长、插件数量和 PID；\n配置项窄屏改成「完整键 + 值」两行，帮助页可 `↑↓` / `PgUp` / `PgDn` 滚动；日志窄屏只留\n`HH:MM:SS`、插件名最后一段和级别。复制优先 `termux-clipboard-set`（`termux-api`），\n否则 OSC 52。"},"2554":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-54","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#操作面板--tui","content":"配置页是**可编辑表格**：段 / 键 / 生效值 / 来源，`↑↓` 选中、`Enter` / `e` 编辑。\n文本、整数和枚举（`account_type` / `log_level`）先校验再写回；写回只替换那一行，\n保留注释、顺序和 CRLF。运行中保存的配置**重启后生效**；`api_hash`、Bot Token / 手机号 /\n密码和 `[plugin.*]` 段只读。配置读不出来时页面显示错误原文，改好按 `r` 重读。"},"2555":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-55","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"`status` 只读 `.fuyubot/`，**不加载插件、不接 TDLib**。三种结果：运行中 / 陈旧（没人在跑，附上次的 pid 与启动时间）/ 没有运行中的实例。还有一种是「有实例在跑、但状态还没发布」，也就是卡在启动里。"},"2556":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-56","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#看状态","content":"登录成功之后还会多一行「账户」（`名字 @用户名（id=…） [bot]`）：`getMe` 拿到就写进 status，\n之后 TDLib 用 `updateUser` 改名字 / 用户名时实例跟着刷新并重发——面板的概览页读的是同一份。"},"2557":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-57","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"`stop` 的机制：写 `.fuyubot/stop` → 实例每 500 ms 看一次 → 停接收循环 → 卸载插件（跑 `plugin_stop`）→ 停内核 → 放锁；**8 秒不理会才硬杀兜底**。硬杀跑不到插件的 `plugin_stop`，所以别一上来就 `taskkill`。"},"2558":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-58","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#停掉","content":"**Ctrl-C 仍是硬杀**：捕获它要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature（会带进 `mio` + `signal-hook-registry` + `errno`，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅退出就用 `fuyubot stop`，别按 Ctrl-C。"},"2559":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-59","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                        | 处理                               |\n| ------------------------- | -------------------------------- |\n| 重复 `run` 报「已经有实例在跑」，带 PID | 先 `status`，再 `stop`；不要手工删 `lock` |","table":"table-3"},"2560":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-60","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象           | 处理                        |\n| ------------ | ------------------------- |\n| `status` 说陈旧 | 正常，陈旧状态不用清理，下次 `run` 自己接管 |","table":"table-3"},"2561":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-61","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象                      | 处理                         |\n| ----------------------- | -------------------------- |\n| 后台启动后立刻 `status` 报「启动中」 | 状态是在插件加载 + 登录之后才发布的，等一会儿再看 |","table":"table-3"},"2562":{"id":"/docs/usage/run-62","page_id":"/docs/usage/run","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/run#常见情形","content":"| 现象       | 处理                            |\n| -------- | ----------------------------- |\n| 进程活着但没更新 | 没登录就收不到任何更新；先用 `--replay` 验插件 |","table":"table-3"},"2563":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"page","content":"常见问题","breadcrumbs":["Docs","使用文档"],"tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting"},"2564":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-0","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","content":"tdjson 找不到、%TEMP%、乱码、插件加载失败"},"2565":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-1","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"找不到 tdjson"},"2566":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-2","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"`LNK1104: cannot open file '...\\Temp\\lnk{GUID}.tmp'`"},"2567":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-3","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"中文乱码 / 行号错位"},"2568":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-4","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"插件加载失败"},"2569":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-5","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"回放以非零码中止"},"2570":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-6","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","type":"heading","tags":[],"url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"收不到更新 / 进程停不下来"},"2571":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-7","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"**构建成功不代表运行找得到**：`fuyubot-tdlib` 在编译期不依赖 tdjson 存在。缺库时 `run` 不会崩，而是打一行然后继续跑（插件照样加载，只是收不到更新）："},"2572":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-8","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"四级查找顺序（不要重排）："},"2573":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-9","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                   |\n| --- | ------------------------------------ |\n| 1   | `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH` 指向的**文件**或**目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2574":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-10","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                 |\n| --- | ---------------------------------- |\n| 2   | vendored（构建期烤进去的目录）→ **可执行文件所在目录** |","table":"table-0"},"2575":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-11","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                      |\n| --- | --------------------------------------- |\n| 3   | Linux 带版本号的系统库（`libtdjson.so.1.8.69` …） |","table":"table-0"},"2576":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-12","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"| 优先级 | 位置                                          |\n| --- | ------------------------------------------- |\n| 4   | 裸库名（`tdjson.dll` / `libtdjson.so`，走 `PATH`） |","table":"table-0"},"2577":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-13","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"报错里的 `[1]` … `[4]` 就是这四档的逐条结果，按顺序看就知道断在哪。嫌排查麻烦就直接指定："},"2578":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-14","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"加载动态库时会**先查库自己所在的目录**（Windows 上是 `LOAD_WITH_ALTERED_SEARCH_PATH`）。否则 tdjson 的兄弟依赖（libssl / zlib 之类）找不到，报的却是 `ERROR_MOD_NOT_FOUND`（126）——错误信息说「库不在」，实际缺的是它的依赖。所以 tdjson 和它的兄弟 DLL 要放在一起。"},"2579":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-15","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#找不到-tdjson","content":"`cargo install` 装出来的二进制是唯一例外：安装目录不受构建脚本管，tdjson 得自己放到它旁边或设 `TDLIB_TDJSON_PATH`。"},"2580":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-16","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"这是 **MSVC 链接器写不了 `%TEMP%`**（受限环境 / 沙箱里常见），跟你的代码无关。把临时目录指到可写的位置："},"2581":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-17","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#lnk1104-cannot-open-file-templnkguidtmp","content":"同一坑的另一面：**测试不许依赖 `%TEMP%`**。仓库约定临时目录一律放 `target/test-tmp/<crate>/<名字>`——MSYS（git bash）会把 `TEMP` 改成 `/tmp`（在 Windows 上解析成当前盘根），受限环境里真实 `%TEMP%` 也可能写不了。换个 shell 就红的测试几乎总是这个原因。"},"2582":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-18","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"本机 PowerShell 的默认代码页是 cp936：`Get-Content` 会把 UTF-8 当 **GBK** 解码，中文注释直接毁掉，还会**吞换行**导致行号错位（按行号删代码会删错）。看文件内容用编辑器或 `read` 工具，别用 shell 的文本通道读写源码。"},"2583":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-19","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#中文乱码--行号错位","content":"脚本插件那条链路的 stdio 两侧已经钉成 UTF-8——Windows 上 Python 默认按系统代码页读管道，不钉就会把中文变乱码。这是 SDK 的职责，插件作者不用管。"},"2584":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-20","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`run` 遇到加载不了的插件会打一行然后**继续**："},"2585":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-21","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"`--plugin-dir` 下的东西会被逐个尝试，所以「少加载了一个」不会让整个进程失败——去看这行。"},"2586":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-22","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                | 原因 / 怎么查                             |\n| ----------------- | ------------------------------------ |\n| `ABI 版本是 N，宿主是 M` | 插件与宿主的 ABI 不匹配：用同一份 SDK 重新编译，别拿旧产物硬跑 |","table":"table-1"},"2587":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-23","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                        | 原因 / 怎么查                                              |\n| ------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |\n| 缺 `plugin_init` / 根本不是动态库 | `fuyubot-sdk check <路径>` **静态**看导出符号；非零退出码 = 宿主一定拒绝加载 |","table":"table-1"},"2588":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-24","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象                                           | 原因 / 怎么查                                                                                      |\n| -------------------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| Node 报 `Cannot find module '...\\counter.ts'` | 脚本同伴不在 cdylib 旁边。用 `plugin install` 装（会连 `.py` / `.js` / `.ts` / `.pyi` 一起拷），或把脚本和 dll 拷进同一目录 |","table":"table-1"},"2589":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-25","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"| 现象              | 原因 / 怎么查                                        |\n| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------- |\n| `.dll` 加载报找不到依赖 | 插件把兄弟 DLL 放自己旁边是支持的（加载器先查库所在目录），别把它挪走，也别只拷主 dll |","table":"table-1"},"2590":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-26","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#插件加载失败","content":"脚本插件还有一条硬约定：`.py` / `.js` / `.ts` 必须和那个 cdylib **同目录**，宿主按「库旁边找脚本」的规则找它。"},"2591":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-27","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#回放以非零码中止","content":"多半是插件目录里有你不想要的东西：`--plugin-dir` 指向 `target/debug` 会混进所有示例产物，其中脚本插件的脚本不在旁边，加载失败就把回放整个拉停。把要验的插件装进一个干净目录即可。见 离线回放。"},"2592":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-28","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象         | 处理                             |\n| ---------- | ------------------------------ |\n| 进程跑着但插件没反应 | 没登录就收不到任何更新。要立刻验插件用 `--replay` |","table":"table-2"},"2593":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-29","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象            | 处理                                                         |\n| ------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |\n| `stop` 之后进程还在 | `stop` 是写停止请求，实例每 500 ms 看一次；8 秒不理会才硬杀。硬杀跑不到 `plugin_stop` |","table":"table-2"},"2594":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-30","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"| 现象           | 处理                                                                         |\n| ------------ | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n| 终端里按了 Ctrl-C | 那是硬杀，不是优雅退出（捕获信号要开 tokio 的 `signal` feature，依赖白名单没放行）。要优雅就用 `fuyubot stop` |","table":"table-2"},"2595":{"id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting-31","page_id":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/usage/troubleshooting#收不到更新--进程停不下来","content":"实例状态、锁与 `status` 的三种结果见 运行与实例管理。"}},"count":2595},"sorting":{"language":"multilingual","sortableProperties":["content","page_id","type","url"],"sortablePropertiesWithTypes":{"content":"string","page_id":"string","type":"string","url":"string"},"sorts":{"content":{"docs":{"1":1484,"2":2174,"3":323,"4":262,"5":260,"6":234,"7":2350,"8":1854,"9":2329,"10":1177,"11":1172,"12":1173,"13":1180,"14":2330,"15":1868,"16":206,"17":261,"18":432,"19":433,"20":1624,"21":1925,"22":2462,"23":2325,"24":1474,"25":2537,"26":324,"27":391,"28":2397,"29":350,"30":351,"31":419,"32":264,"33"